<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="JOB" style="id">RRK18.SFM Runyankore-Rukiga Bible Version 1964 lasted edited 06.07.2022</book>
  <para style="h">YOBU</para>
  <para style="toc1">Ekitabo Kya Yobu</para>
  <para style="toc2">Yobu</para>
  <para style="toc3">Yob</para>
  <para style="mt2">EKITABO KYA</para>
  <para style="mt1">YOBU</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="JOB 1" />
  <para style="s1">Okuhikiirira kwa Yobu n'obutungi bwe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 1:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">1:1: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JOB 4:6">Yob 4:6</ref>; <ref loc="JOB 28:28">28:28</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 34:14">Zab 34:14</ref>; <ref loc="PRO 16:6">Enf 16:6</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 14:14">Ezk 14:14</ref>, <ref loc="EZK 14:20">20</ref>; <ref loc="JAS 5:11">Yak 5:11</ref>. </char>
    </note> Omu nsi ya Uuzi hakaba harimu omushaija orikwetwa Yobu; ogwo mushaija akaba ari omuntu otaine kabara, kandi ohikiriire, owaabaire atiina Ruhanga, akeetantara ekibi. <verse eid="JOB 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 1:2" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:2: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 42:13">Yob 42:13</ref>. </char></note> Akazaara aboojo mushanju n'abaishiki bashatu. <verse eid="JOB 1:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 1:3" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:3: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JDG 6:3">Bar 6:3</ref>. </char></note> Kandi akaba atungire entaama enkumi mushanju, engamira enkumi ishatu, enimi z'okuhingisa rukumi, ebuguma z'endogoya magana ataano, n'abahuuku baingi munonga. N'ahabw'ekyo ogwo mushaija akaba ari omushaija rugambwa orikukira abashaija boona ab'omu nsi z'oburugwa-izooba. <verse eid="JOB 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 1:4" />Kandi abatabani bakaba bakunda kuriira obugyenyi omu nju ya buri omwe aha izooba rye, kandi batuma ahari banyaanyabo bonshatu kwija kurya n'okunywa nabo. <verse eid="JOB 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 1:5" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:5: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1SA 16:5">1 Sam 16:5</ref>; <ref loc="JOB 2:5">Yob 2:5</ref>; <ref loc="JOB 42:8">42:8</ref>. </char></note> Bwanyima ebiro byabo eby'obugyenyi bikihwa, Yobu abatumaho kubeeza, aimuka kare omu kasheeshe, atamba ebitambo by'okwotsya ebirikwingana n'omubaro gwabo boona; ahabw'okuba Yobu akaba agira ati: Obundi abaana bangye bakaaba basiisire, bahemukire ahari Ruhanga omu mitima yaabo. Okwo nikwo Yobu yaabaire atwaza obutoosha.<verse eid="JOB 1:5" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Sitaane okugaya okuhikiirira kwa Yobu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 1:6" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">1:6: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="1KI 22:19">1 Bag 22:19</ref>; <ref loc="1CH 21:1">1 Bus 21:1</ref>; <ref loc="JOB 2:1">Yob 2:1</ref>; <ref loc="JOB 38:7">38:7</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 89:6">Zab 89:6</ref>; <ref loc="ZEC 3:1">Zek 3:1</ref>; <ref loc="REV 12:9-10">Kush 12:9-10</ref>. </char>
    </note> Eizooba rimwe abaana ba Ruhanga bakaija kwemurika ahari MUKAMA, na Sitaane yaabaijamu. <verse eid="JOB 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 1:7" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:7: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1PE 5:8">1 Pet 5:8</ref>. </char></note> MUKAMA yaabuuza Sitaane ati: Nooruga hi? Sitaane yaamugarukamu ati: Ninduga kugyendagyenda omu nsi, n'okugizengyereramu. <verse eid="JOB 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 1:8" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:8: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 12:7">Kub 12:7</ref>; <ref loc="2SA 7:5">2 Sam 7:5</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 20:3">Isa 20:3</ref>. </char></note> MUKAMA yaagaruka yaamubuuza ati: Ebyo waayetegyereza omwiru wangye Yobu, ku hataine mushaija orikumushusha omu nsi, ku ataine kabara kandi ku ahikiriire, omushaija orikuntiina, kandi orikwetantara ekibi? <verse eid="JOB 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 1:9" />Sitaane yaagarukamu MUKAMA ati: Noogira ngu Yobu akutiinira busha? <verse eid="JOB 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 1:10" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:10: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 34:7">Zab 34:7</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 128:1">128:1</ref>, <ref loc="PSA 128:2">2</ref>. </char></note> Tiiwe omurinda embaju zoona, we n'enju ye n'ebi atungire byona? Okaha omugisha ebi yaakozire n'emikono ye, kandi waakanyisa ebi atungire byona. <verse eid="JOB 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 1:11" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:11: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 19:21">Yob 19:21</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 53:4">Isa 53:4</ref>. </char></note> Kwonka hati gorora omukono gwawe, okore aha bintu bye byona; naija kukwehakana butunu. <verse eid="JOB 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 1:12" />MUKAMA yaagira Sitaane ati: Reeba, ebi atungire byona biri omu bushoboorozi bwawe; kwonka we, otamukoraho. Atyo Sitaane yaaruga omu maisho ga MUKAMA.<verse eid="JOB 1:12" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yobu okumarwaho ebye, n'okufeerwa abaana be</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 1:13" />Eizooba rimwe abatabani na bahara be bakaba nibarya nibanywera viinyo omu nju ya mukuru waabo; <verse eid="JOB 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 1:14" />entumwa yaija ahari Yobu, yaamubikira eti: Enimi zaaba nizihinga, n'endogoya niziriira aha rubaju rwazo; <verse eid="JOB 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 1:15" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:15: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 10:1">1 Bag 10:1</ref>; <ref loc="JOB 6:19">Yob 6:19</ref>. </char></note> ahonaaho aba Sabeya baazeeshukamu, baazinyaga, n'abariisa baazo baabaitsa rurara; niinye nyenka owaahonokaho, nkaija kubikubikira. <verse eid="JOB 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 1:16" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:16: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 19:24">Kut 19:24</ref>; <ref loc="2KI 1:12">2 Bag 1:12</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 11:6">Zab 11:6</ref>. </char></note> Ku yaabaire naakigamba, endiijo ntumwa yaija, yaagira eti: Omuriro gwa Ruhanga gwaruga omu iguru, gwayotsya entaama n'abariisa baazo, gwabicwekyereza; niinye nyenka owaahonokaho, nkaija kubikubikira. <verse eid="JOB 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 1:17" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:17: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 24:2">2 Bag 24:2</ref>. </char></note> Nawe ku yaabaire naakigamba, haija ondiijo, yaagira ati: Abakaludaaya baija omu mitwe eshatu, baayeshuka omu ngamira, baazinyaga, n'abariisa baazo baabaitsa rurara; niinye nyenka owaahonokaho, nkaija kubikubikira. <verse eid="JOB 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 1:18" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:18: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 1:4">Yob 1:4</ref>, <ref loc="JOB 1:13">13</ref>. </char></note> N'ogwo ku yaabaire naakigamba, haija ondiijo, yaagira ati: Batabani baawe na bahara baawe baaba nibarya, nibanywera viinyo omu nju ya mukuru waabo; <verse eid="JOB 1:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 1:19" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:19: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 21:1">Isa 21:1</ref>; <ref loc="JER 4:11">Yer 4:11</ref>; <ref loc="HOS 13:15">Hos 13:15</ref>. </char></note> omuyaga gw'amaani gwareetwa omu ihamba, gwateera embaju ina z'enju, enju yaagwera abo batsigazi, baafa; niinye nyenka owaahonokaho, nkaija kubikubikira.<verse eid="JOB 1:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 1:20" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">1:20: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="GEN 37:29">Kut 37:29</ref>; <ref loc="EZR 9:3">Ezr 9:3</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 15:2">Isa 15:2</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 22:12">22:12</ref>; <ref loc="1PE 5:6">1 Pet 5:6</ref>. </char>
    </note> Yobu, ku yaabihuriire, yaimuka, yaataagura ekijwaro kye, yaamwa eishokye rye, yaajuumara ahansi, yaaramya, naagira ati: <verse eid="JOB 1:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 1:21" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:21: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 49:17">Zab 49:17</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 113:3">113:3</ref>; <ref loc="ECC 5:15">Mub 5:15</ref>, <ref loc="ECC 5:19">19</ref>; <ref loc="DAN 2:20">Dan 2:20</ref>; <ref loc="EPH 5:20">Efe 5:20</ref>; <ref loc="1TH 5:18">1 Tes 5:18</ref>; <ref loc="1TI 6:7">1 Tim 6:7</ref>; <ref loc="JAS 1:17">Yak 1:17</ref>. </char></note> Nkaruga omunda ya maawe ntaine ki njwaire, kandi nikwo ndigarukayo ntyo. MUKAMA akampa, mbwenu abiinyihireho. Eiziina rya MUKAMA risiimwe! <verse eid="JOB 1:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 1:22" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:22: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 2:10">Yob 2:10</ref>. </char></note> Omuri ebyo byona Yobu tarakozire kibi, n'obu kwakuba okubarira Ruhanga okushobya.<verse eid="JOB 1:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="JOB 2" />
  <para style="s1">Sitaane okushaba Ruhanga okubonabonesa Yobu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 2:1" />Kandi aha izooba erindi abaana ba Ruhanga bakaija kwemurika ahari MUKAMA, na Sitaane yaabaijamu ngu nawe ayemurikye ahari MUKAMA. <verse eid="JOB 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 2:2" />MUKAMA yaabuuza Sitaane ati: Nooruga hi? Sitaane yaamugarukamu ati: Ninduga kugyendagyenda omu nsi, n'okugizengyereramu. <verse eid="JOB 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 2:3" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:3: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 1:8">Yob 1:8</ref>. </char></note> MUKAMA yaagaruka yaabuuza Sitaane ati: Ebyo oyetegyereize omwiru wangye Yobu, ku hataine mushaija orikumushusha omu nsi, ku ataine kabara, kandi ku ahikiriire, omushaija orinkutiina akeetantara ekibi? Na mbwenu, n'obu oraabe wandeeteire kumukora kubi, n'okumucwekyereza nimmutura busha, kwonka akihamiire aha kuhikiirira kwe. <verse eid="JOB 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 2:4" />Sitaane yaamugarukamu ati: Amagara gakira amagana. Ebi omuntu atungire byona, akaabihayo ahaw'amagara ge. <verse eid="JOB 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 2:5" />Kwonka mbwenu gorora omukono gwawe, okore aha magufa ge n'aha mubiri gwe, naija kukwehakana butunu. <verse eid="JOB 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 2:6" />MUKAMA yaagira Sitaane ati: Reeba, ari omu bushoboorozi bwawe; kwonka otamwita.<verse eid="JOB 2:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 2:7" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">2:7: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EXO 9:9">Kur 9:9</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 28:35">Bir 28:35</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 1:6">Isa 1:6</ref>. </char>
    </note> Atyo Sitaane yaaruga omu maisho ga MUKAMA, yaarwaza Yobu ebihuute bibi, okuruga aha mara g'ebigyere okuhika aha kazingiro k'eishokye. <verse eid="JOB 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 2:8" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:8: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 42:6">Yob 42:6</ref>. </char></note> Yobu yaayesherurira orugusyo rw'okweyaguza, yaashutama omu iju. <verse eid="JOB 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 2:9" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:9: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 1:5">Yob 1:5</ref>; <ref loc="JOB 27:5">27:5</ref>, <ref loc="JOB 27:6">6</ref>. </char></note> Bwanyima omukazi we yaamugira ati: Beitu na hati okuhamiire aha kuhikiirira kwawe? Yehakane Ruhanga, ofe. <verse eid="JOB 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 2:10" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:10: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 1:22">Yob 1:22</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 39:1">Zab 39:1</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 74:18">74:18</ref>, <ref loc="PSA 74:22">22</ref>; <ref loc="JAS 5:10">Yak 5:10</ref>, <ref loc="JAS 5:11">11</ref>. </char></note> Kwonka we yaamugarukamu ati: Noogamba nk'omukazi omushema. Noogira ngu turyaheebwa ebirungi byonka omu mikono ya Ruhanga, tituriheebwa n'ebibi? Omuri ebyo byona Yobu taracumwire na rurimi rwe.<verse eid="JOB 2:10" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Banywani ba Yobu okwija kumuyaagira</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 2:11" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">2:11: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JOB 42:11">Yob 42:11</ref>; <ref loc="PRO 17:17">Enf 17:17</ref>; <ref loc="ROM 12:15">Rom 12:15</ref>. </char>
    </note> Bwanyima banywani ba Yobu bashatu, ku baahuriire ezo naku zoona ezimuhikireho, baija, buri muntu naaruga owe, Elifaazi Omutemaani, Biludaadi Omushuuhi, na Zofari Omunaamasi. Baaragaana kwija kumuyaagira n'okumugumya. <verse eid="JOB 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 2:12" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:12: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOS 7:6">Yos 7:6</ref>; <ref loc="GEN 37:29">Kut 37:29</ref>; <ref loc="LAM 2:10">Tonz 2:10</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 27:30">Ezk 27:30</ref>. </char></note> Ku baamureebire bakiri hare, baamwebwa, baimutsya amaraka gaabo, baarira; baataagura ebijwaro byabo, baayeshuka eiju omu mutwe, kandi baarimiisha n'ahaiguru. <verse eid="JOB 2:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 2:13" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:13: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 50:10">Kut 50:10</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 3:15">Ezk 3:15</ref>. </char></note> Bwanyima baashutama nawe ahansi okumara ebiro mushanju nyomushana na nyekiro; tihaagira n'omwe owaamugambira ekigambo, ahabw'okureeba obusaasi bwe burengyesereize.<verse eid="JOB 2:13" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="JOB 3" />
  <para style="s1">Okutonzya kwa Yobu ahabw'obusaasi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 3:1" />Bwanyima y'ebyo Yobu yaayashamya akanwa ke, yaagamba, yaakyeena eizooba eri yaazaariirweho, <verse eid="JOB 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 3:2" />naagira ati:<verse eid="JOB 3:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 3:3" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">3:3: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JER 20:14-18">Yer 20:14-18</ref>. </char>
    </note> Nkaahenwa ki, eizooba eri naazaariirweho ricwekyerezibwa,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 3:3">N'ekiro eki baagambiireho ngu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 3:3">Maawe abakira enda y'omwana w'omwojo.<verse eid="JOB 3:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 3:4" />Eryo izooba rihinduka omwirima!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 3:4">Ruhanga ow'ahaiguru areka kuryetaho,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 3:4">Kandi rireka kujwerwa omushana;<verse eid="JOB 3:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 3:5" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">3:5: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JOB 10:21">Yob 10:21</ref>, <ref loc="JOB 10:22">22</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 23:4">Zab 23:4</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 9:2">Isa 9:2</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 1:79">Luk 1:79</ref>. </char>
    </note> Omwirima n'ekibunda kya rufu birihindura eryabyo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 3:5">Ebicu birikondakondera,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 3:5">Obwira-kabiri bwona buritiinisa,<verse eid="JOB 3:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 3:6" />Ekyo kiro kikwatwa omwirima ndindindi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 3:6">Kireka kushemererwa omu biro by'omwaka,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 3:6">N'obu kwakuba okubarirwa omu gandi meezi;<verse eid="JOB 3:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 3:7" />Eego, ekyo kiro kiba engumba,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 3:7">Kireka kuhurirwamu akaari k'okushemererwa;<verse eid="JOB 3:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 3:8" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">3:8: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JOB 41:1">Yob 41:1</ref>. </char>
    </note> Rikyeenwa abakyeena ebiro,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 3:8">Abarikumanya kwimutsya Leviasaani;<verse eid="JOB 3:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 3:9" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">3:9: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JOB 41:18">Yob 41:18</ref>. </char>
    </note> Enyonyoozi z'omu buturuturu bwaryo zireka kujwa,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 3:9">Ritegyereza omushana, guriburira,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 3:9">Kandi ribura kureeba okujuguta kw'omushekye;<verse eid="JOB 3:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 3:10" />Ahabw'okuba tiriragaize nda ya maawe,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 3:10">N'obu kwakuba okuzibira amaisho gangye kureeba obusaasi.<verse eid="JOB 3:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 3:11" />Ahabw'enki ntarafiire ninzaarwa,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 3:11">Nkabura kwitsya ninkishohora nti?<verse eid="JOB 3:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 3:12" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">3:12: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="GEN 30:3">Kut 30:3</ref>; <ref loc="GEN 50:23">50:23</ref>. </char>
    </note> Ahabw'enki naashangire ebibero by'okukiikirwaho,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 3:12">N'amabeere g'okwonka?<verse eid="JOB 3:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 3:13" />Kuri kyabaire kityo, nkaabaire mbyami, mpunami;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 3:13">Nkaabaire ngwejegyeire, nyehuumuriire,<verse eid="JOB 3:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 3:14" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">3:14: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 58:12">Isa 58:12</ref>. </char>
    </note> Ndi hamwe n'abagabe b'ensi n'abahi b'obwengye baabo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 3:14">Abaayeyombekyeire ebituuro by'ekitiinisa by'okuziikwamu;<verse eid="JOB 3:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 3:15" />Nari shi, n'abanyiginya abaabaire baine ezaabu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 3:15">Baijwize amaka gaabo efeeza.<verse eid="JOB 3:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 3:16" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">3:16: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 58:8">Zab 58:8</ref>; <ref loc="ECC 6:3">Mub 6:3</ref>; <ref loc="1CO 15:8">1 Kor 15:8</ref>. </char>
    </note> Kuri naabaire nk'enda erugamu etamanyirwe,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 3:16">Nk'abeereere abatarareebire mushana;<verse eid="JOB 3:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 3:17" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">3:17: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JOB 17:16">Yob 17:16</ref>. </char>
    </note> Okwo niyo abasiisi baba batakiitira kubi bantu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 3:17">Kandi niyo abaruhire baruhuukira.<verse eid="JOB 3:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 3:18" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">3:18: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EXO 5:13">Kur 5:13</ref>, <ref loc="EXO 5:14">14</ref>. </char>
    </note> Niyo enkwatwa zihuumurira hamwe, zituurize,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 3:18">Zitakihurira iraka ry'orikuzikoresa kubi.<verse eid="JOB 3:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 3:19" />Omuto n'omukuru niyo bataaha,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 3:19">Kandi omuhuuku tategyekyerwayo mukama we.<verse eid="JOB 3:19" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 3:20" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">3:20: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JOB 10:1">Yob 10:1</ref>; <ref loc="2KI 4:27">2 Bag 4:27</ref>; <ref loc="1SA 1:10">1 Sam 1:10</ref>. </char>
    </note> Ahabw'enki Ruhanga ajwisiza enshoberwa omushana,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 3:20">N'abaine entimba aha mutima akabagumyaho?<verse eid="JOB 3:20" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 3:21" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">3:21: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PRO 2:4">Enf 2:4</ref>; <ref loc="REV 9:6">Kush 9:6</ref>. </char>
    </note> Ahabw'okuba beetenga rufu, tibagibona;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 3:21">Bagitimba okukira oku abantu batimba ezaabu esherekirwe.<verse eid="JOB 3:21" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 3:22" />Ku bahika aha kituuro, bashemererwa munonga, beesiima.<verse eid="JOB 3:22" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOB 3:23" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">3:23: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JOB 19:8">Yob 19:8</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 40:27">Isa 40:27</ref>. </char>
    </note> Ahabw'enki Ruhanga ajwisiza omuntu omushana,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 3:23">Otaine butooro, kandi ou akubiire hamwe?<verse eid="JOB 3:23" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOB 3:24" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">3:24: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 22:1">Zab 22:1</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 38:8">38:8</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 42:3">42:3</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 80:5">80:5</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 102:9">102:9</ref>. </char>
    </note> Manya okutsinda kwangye kumbeereire eby'okurya,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 3:24">N'okuborooga kwangye nikweshuka nk'amaizi;<verse eid="JOB 3:24" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOB 3:25" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">3:25: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PRO 10:24">Enf 10:24</ref>. </char>
    </note> Ahabw'okuba eki ndikutiina, nikyo kirikumpikaho,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 3:25">Kandi ekirikuunyitsa obwoba nikyo kirikungwaho.<verse eid="JOB 3:25" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JOB 3:26" />Tiinyine busingye, tintuurize, kandi tiinyine buhuumure,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 3:26">Kureka enaku nizo zirikuunyeshukyera.<verse eid="JOB 3:26" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="JOB 4" />
  <para style="s1">Okugarukamu kwa Elifaazi</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 4:1" />Bwanyima Elifaazi Omutemaani yaagarukamu ati:<verse eid="JOB 4:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 4:2" />Omuntu ku yaakuteeraho kugamba naiwe, okaaguubwa kubi?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 4:2">Beitu shi hoona n'oha orikubaasa kwezibira kugamba?<verse eid="JOB 4:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 4:3" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">4:3: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 35:3">Isa 35:3</ref>; <ref loc="HEB 12:12">Heb 12:12</ref>. </char>
    </note> Reeba, okaba oyegyesa baingi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 4:3">Kandi okaba ohamya emikono etaine maani.<verse eid="JOB 4:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 4:4" />Ebigambo byawe bikaba biramira orikwenda kugwa,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 4:4">Kandi okaba ohamya entegye ezirikubonda.<verse eid="JOB 4:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 4:5" />Kwonka mbwenu niiwe bihikireho, kandi tiwaagumisiriza!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 4:5">Bikukozireho, waahahaaza omutima!<verse eid="JOB 4:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 4:6" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">4:6: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JOB 1:1">Yob 1:1</ref>; <ref loc="JOB 31:24">31:24</ref>. </char>
    </note> Obwesigye bwawe tiburi omu kutiina Ruhanga,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 4:6">Kandi amatsiko gaawe tigari omu kuhikiirira kw'emitwarize yaawe?<verse eid="JOB 4:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 4:7" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">4:7: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 37:25">Zab 37:25</ref>. </char>
    </note> Mbwenu ijuka; n'oha oracwekyereire ataine rubanja?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 4:7">Nari shi, abahikiriire baramazirweho?<verse eid="JOB 4:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 4:8" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">4:8: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PRO 22:8">Enf 22:8</ref>; <ref loc="HOS 10:13">Hos 10:13</ref>; <ref loc="GAL 6:7">Gal 6:7</ref>, <ref loc="GAL 6:8">8</ref>. </char>
    </note> Nyowe nk'oku ndareebire, abahinga okutahikiirira,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 4:8">Bakabiba obubi, nibyo bagyesha.<verse eid="JOB 4:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 4:9" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">4:9: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EXO 15:8">Kur 15:8</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 18:15">Zab 18:15</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 11:4">Isa 11:4</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 30:33">30:33</ref>; <ref loc="2TH 2:8">2 Tes 2:8</ref>. </char>
    </note> Bacwekyerezibwa omwitsyo gwa Ruhanga,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 4:9">Bamarwaho okuhoorera kw'ekiniga kye.<verse eid="JOB 4:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 4:10" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">4:10: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 58:6">Zab 58:6</ref>. </char>
    </note> Okutsinda kw'entare, n'eiraka ry'entare enshaarizi bihunama,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 4:10">N'amaino g'emigunju y'entare gacweka.<verse eid="JOB 4:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 4:11" />Ekisimba ky'entare kifa ahabw'okubura omuhiigo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 4:11">Kandi n'obwana bw'entare enkazi butaataana.<verse eid="JOB 4:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 4:12" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">4:12: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JOB 26:14">Yob 26:14</ref>. </char>
    </note> Mbwenu hariho ekigambo eki naagambiirwe bwesherekye,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 4:12">Okutu kwangye kukakihurira nikiija mpora,<verse eid="JOB 4:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 4:13" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">4:13: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JOB 33:15">Yob 33:15</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 29:10">Isa 29:10</ref>; <ref loc="1SA 26:12">1 Sam 26:12</ref>; <ref loc="GEN 15:12">Kut 15:12</ref>. </char>
    </note> Omu biteekateeko ebyarugire omu kworekwa kwa nyekiro,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 4:13">Abantu baahirwayo.<verse eid="JOB 4:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 4:14" />Naagira obwoba, naatetema,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 4:14">Kyareetera amagufa gangye goona kukomangana.<verse eid="JOB 4:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 4:15" />Omuzimu gwandaba omu maisho,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 4:15">Ekikoba kyampwa aha mutwe;<verse eid="JOB 4:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 4:16" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">4:16: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="NUM 12:8">Kub 12:8</ref>; <ref loc="1KI 19:12">1 Bag 19:12</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 17:15">Zab 17:15</ref>. </char>
    </note> Gwayemerera aho, kwonka tinaamanya oku gurikushusha;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 4:16">Omu maisho gangye haabamu waringa.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 4:16">Haabaho akaceceko, bwanyima naahurira eiraka eririkugira riti:<verse eid="JOB 4:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 4:17" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">4:17: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JOB 9:2">Yob 9:2</ref>; <ref loc="JOB 25:4">25:4</ref>; <ref loc="JOB 32:2">32:2</ref>. </char>
    </note> Omuntu ofa naabaasa kuba ohikiriire omu maisho ga Ruhanga?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 4:17">Naabaasa kuba oshugaine omu maisho g'Owaamuhangire?<verse eid="JOB 4:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 4:18" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">4:18: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JOB 15:15">Yob 15:15</ref>. </char>
    </note> Nangwa n'abagaragwa be tabeesiga,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 4:18">Na baamaraika be aboomesereza ebishobyo;<verse eid="JOB 4:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 4:19" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">4:19: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JOB 10:9">Yob 10:9</ref>; <ref loc="JOB 13:28">13:28</ref>; <ref loc="JOB 33:6">33:6</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 64:8">Isa 64:8</ref>; <ref loc="2CO 4:7">2 Kor 4:7</ref>; <ref loc="2CO 5:1">5:1</ref>. </char>
    </note> Kaashwa abo abatuura omu maka g'eitaka,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 4:19">Agu omusingi gwago guri omu mucuucu;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 4:19">Abarikuribatwa bakatanga ekiyenje kubaruka.<verse eid="JOB 4:19" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 4:20" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">4:20: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 90:5">Zab 90:5</ref>, <ref loc="PSA 90:6">6</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 38:12">Isa 38:12</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 57:1">57:1</ref>. </char>
    </note> Bacwekyererera ahagati y'akasheeshe n'omwabazyo;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 4:20">Bahweraho kimwe, hataine okyetaireho.<verse eid="JOB 4:20" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 4:21" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">4:21: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JOB 36:12">Yob 36:12</ref>; <ref loc="PRO 5:23">Enf 5:23</ref>; <ref loc="PRO 10:21">10:21</ref>; <ref loc="HOS 4:6">Hos 4:6</ref>. </char>
    </note> Omurunga gw'eihema ryabo ku gubaihwamu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 4:21">Tibafa, kandi bakafa bataine bwengye?<verse eid="JOB 4:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="JOB 5" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 5:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">5:1: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JOB 15:15">Yob 15:15</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 89:5">Zab 89:5</ref>, <ref loc="PSA 89:7">7</ref>. </char>
    </note> Hati taka; hariho n'omwe orikukugarukamu?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 5:1">Omu barikwera ou waakwagira n'oha?<verse eid="JOB 5:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 5:2" />Buzimazima ekiniga kiita omushema,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 5:2">Kandi eihari riita otaine bwengye.<verse eid="JOB 5:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 5:3" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">5:3: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 37:35">Zab 37:35</ref>; <ref loc="JER 12:2">Yer 12:2</ref>, <ref loc="JER 12:3">3</ref>. </char>
    </note> Nkareeba omushema naatsimba emizi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 5:3">Kwonka omu mwanya mukye naakyeena obutaaho bwe;<verse eid="JOB 5:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 5:4" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">5:4: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 119:155">Zab 119:155</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 127:5">127:5</ref>; <ref loc="AMO 5:12">Amo 5:12</ref>. </char>
    </note> Abaana be obuhooro bubari hare,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 5:4">Basingyererwa omu marembo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 5:4">Babura kijuna.<verse eid="JOB 5:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 5:5" />Ebi ashaarwire biriibwa abaine enjara,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 5:5">Bagaruka batwara n'ebiri omu mahwa;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 5:5">Abaine eiriho bainiire ebintu bye ekyaka;<verse eid="JOB 5:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 5:6" />Ahabw'okuba okubonabona tikuruga mu mucuucu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 5:6">N'enaku tizimera mu itaka,<verse eid="JOB 5:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 5:7" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">5:7: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JOB 14:1">Yob 14:1</ref>; <ref loc="ECC 2:23">Mub 2:23</ref>; <ref loc="GEN 3:17-19">Kut 3:17-19</ref>. </char>
    </note> Kwonka omuntu azaarirwa enaku</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 5:7">Nk'oku esiriira zituumuuka omu mwanya.<verse eid="JOB 5:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 5:8" />Nyowe ahabwangye nkaasherwire Ruhanga,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 5:8">Kandi Ruhanga mba niwe naayegyekyera ebyangye.<verse eid="JOB 5:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 5:9" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">5:9: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JOB 11:7">Yob 11:7</ref>; <ref loc="JOB 37:5">37:5</ref>; <ref loc="JOB 9:10">9:10</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 40:5">Zab 40:5</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 72:18">72:18</ref>; <ref loc="ROM 11:33">Rom 11:33</ref>; <ref loc="REV 15:3">Kush 15:3</ref>. </char>
    </note> Niwe akora eby'amaani ebitakareebwaga,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 5:9">N'eby'okutangaaza ebitarikubaasa kubarwa.<verse eid="JOB 5:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 5:10" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">5:10: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 65:9">Zab 65:9</ref>, <ref loc="PSA 65:10">10</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 147:8">147:8</ref>; <ref loc="JER 5:24">Yer 5:24</ref>; <ref loc="JER 14:22">14:22</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 5:45">Mat 5:45</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 14:17">Byak 14:17</ref>. </char>
    </note> Niwe agwisiza ensi enjura,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 5:10">Akashandaaza amaizi omu misiri.<verse eid="JOB 5:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 5:11" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">5:11: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="1SA 2:7">1 Sam 2:7</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 113:7">Zab 113:7</ref>. </char>
    </note> Niwe atunguura ab'ahansi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 5:11">N'abarikuborooga akabaimutsya, bakaba buhooro.<verse eid="JOB 5:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 5:12" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">5:12: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="NEH 4:15">Neh 4:15</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 33:10">Zab 33:10</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 8:10">Isa 8:10</ref>. </char>
    </note> Ahindura busha enaama z'engobya,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 5:12">Ngu emikono yaazo eremwe kuhitsya eki zimaririire kukora.<verse eid="JOB 5:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 5:13" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">5:13: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 9:15">Zab 9:15</ref>; <ref loc="1CO 3:19">1 Kor 3:19</ref>. </char>
    </note> Akwatira abanyabwengye omu bugobya bwabo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 5:13">N'enaama z'engobya zimarwaho juba.<verse eid="JOB 5:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 5:14" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">5:14: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JOB 12:25">Yob 12:25</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 59:10">Isa 59:10</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 28:29">Bir 28:29</ref>. </char>
    </note> Babugaabugana n'omwirima nyomushana,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 5:14">Babandagira omu ihangwe nk'owa nyekiro.<verse eid="JOB 5:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 5:15" />Kwonka omworo amujuna omu kanwa kaabo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 5:15">N'omukyene amwiha omu mikono y'ab'amaani.<verse eid="JOB 5:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 5:16" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">5:16: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 107:42">Zab 107:42</ref>. </char>
    </note> N'ahabw'ekyo omworo agira amatsiko,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 5:16">Kandi n'akanwa k'abatahikiriire kabumbwa.<verse eid="JOB 5:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 5:17" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">5:17: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 94:12">Zab 94:12</ref>; <ref loc="PRO 3:11">Enf 3:11</ref>; <ref loc="HEB 12:5">Heb 12:5</ref>; <ref loc="REV 3:19">Kush 3:19</ref>. </char>
    </note> Manya, omuntu ou Ruhanga ahana, aba ahiiriirwe,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 5:17">N'ahabw'ekyo otagaya okuhana kw'Ow'obushoboorozi bwona;<verse eid="JOB 5:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 5:18" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">5:18: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="DEU 32:39">Bir 32:39</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 30:26">Isa 30:26</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 61:1">61:1</ref>; <ref loc="HOS 6:1">Hos 6:1</ref>. </char>
    </note> Ahabw'okuba ahutaaza, kwonka ashemba obuhuta,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 5:18">Ateera, kwonka engaro ze nizo zikiza.<verse eid="JOB 5:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 5:19" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">5:19: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 34:19">Zab 34:19</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 91:3">91:3</ref>, <ref loc="PSA 91:10">10</ref>; <ref loc="AMO 1:6">Amo 1:6</ref>. </char>
    </note> Aryakujuna obugwe mukaaga,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 5:19">Nangwa n'omu bugwe mushanju tihariho kibi ekirikuhikaho.<verse eid="JOB 5:19" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 5:20" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">5:20: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 33:19">Zab 33:19</ref>. </char>
    </note> Omu biro by'enjara aryakucungura, orekye kufa;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 5:20">N'omu rugamba aryakukiza amaani ga rurara.<verse eid="JOB 5:20" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 5:21" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">5:21: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 31:20">Zab 31:20</ref>. </char>
    </note> Oryasherekwa orurimi rurikubambura,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 5:21">Kandi okuhwerekyerera ku kuriija, torikutiina.<verse eid="JOB 5:21" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 5:22" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">5:22: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 11:8">Isa 11:8</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 65:25">65:25</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 34:25">Ezk 34:25</ref>; <ref loc="HOS 2:18">Hos 2:18</ref>. </char>
    </note> Okuhwerekyerera n'enjara oryabishekyerera,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 5:22">Kandi toritiina nyamaishwa z'omu nsi;<verse eid="JOB 5:22" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOB 5:23" />Ahabw'okuba oryaragaana n'amabaare g'omu bwerere,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 5:23">N'enyamaishwa z'omu ihamba ziryagira obusingye naiwe.<verse eid="JOB 5:23" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOB 5:24" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">5:24: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JOB 21:9">Yob 21:9</ref>. </char>
    </note> Oryamanya ku eka yaawe eine obusingye,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 5:24">Oryaguma nooreeba engombe y'amatungo gaawe, oshangye hataine kibuziremu.<verse eid="JOB 5:24" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOB 5:25" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">5:25: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JOB 21:8">Yob 21:8</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 112:2">Zab 112:2</ref>. </char>
    </note> Nibwo orimanya ku oruzaaro rwawe rurikanya,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 5:25">Na baijukuru baawe bakaba nk'obunyaatsi bw'omu nsi.<verse eid="JOB 5:25" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JOB 5:26" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">5:26: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="GEN 25:8">Kut 25:8</ref>; <ref loc="PRO 9:11">Enf 9:11</ref>; <ref loc="PRO 10:27">10:27</ref>. </char>
    </note> Oryataaha omu kituuro kyawe okuzire gye,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 5:26">Nk'ekiba ky'engano oku kihunikwa omu bunaku bwakyo.<verse eid="JOB 5:26" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JOB 5:27" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">5:27: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 111:2">Zab 111:2</ref>. </char>
    </note> Reeba, ebyo nibyo twacondoorize, tukashanga biri bityo;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 5:27">Obihurire, obyegyereho eky'okukugasira.<verse eid="JOB 5:27" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="JOB 6" />
  <para style="s1">Yobu okugarukamu Elifaazi</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 6:1" />Bwanyima Yobu yaagarukamu ati:<verse eid="JOB 6:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 6:2" />Ai bambe! Nkaabaasibwa ki, obugwa kubi bwangye burengwa,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 6:2">Nari ebihikiirizi byangye byona biteebwa aha minzaani!<verse eid="JOB 6:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 6:3" />Bikaaremeera okukira omusheenyi ogw'omu nyanja.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 6:3">Nikyo kindeeteire kurahuka kugamba;<verse eid="JOB 6:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 6:4" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">6:4: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JOB 16:13">Yob 16:13</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 38:2">Zab 38:2</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 88:16">88:16</ref>. </char>
    </note> Ahabw'okuba emyambi y'Ow'obushoboorozi bwona endi omunda,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 6:4">Amagara gangye niganywa obushegu bwayo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 6:4">Eby'okutiinisa bya Ruhanga bitengire orugamba kundwanisa.<verse eid="JOB 6:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 6:5" />Noogira ngu enturegye neekunga, eine obunyaatsi omu kanwa,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 6:5">Nari shi ente ejuga neerya?<verse eid="JOB 6:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 6:6" />Ekitaine nsha kiriibwa kitarimu mwonyo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 6:6">Nari omu maizi g'eihuri habamu akanuzi?<verse eid="JOB 6:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 6:7" />Omutima gwangye tigurikwenda kubirozaho;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 6:7">Nibinsusira nk'eby'okurya birikunugwa.<verse eid="JOB 6:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 6:8" />Nkaabaasibwa ki, ntunga eki ndikushaba,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 6:8">Ruhanga ampa eki ndikwetenga!<verse eid="JOB 6:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 6:9" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">6:9: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="NUM 11:15">Kub 11:15</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 38:12">Isa 38:12</ref>. </char>
    </note> Ruhanga aikiriza kunsingyera,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 6:9">Atayo omukono gwe, ampuhura.<verse eid="JOB 6:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 6:10" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">6:10: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="LEV 19:2">Lev 19:2</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 57:15">Isa 57:15</ref>. </char>
    </note> Obwo nkaatunga obuhuumure,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 6:10">Nangwa n'omu busaasi obutarikutuuza nkaayesiima,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 6:10">Ahabw'okuba tindikuhakanisa bi Orikwera arikugamba.<verse eid="JOB 6:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 6:11" />Nyine maani ki g'okutegyereza?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 6:11">Omuheru gw'obusaasi bwangye n'enki, ngu mbone kugumisiriza?<verse eid="JOB 6:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 6:12" />Amaani gangye n'amaani g'amabaare,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 6:12">Nari omubiri gwangye n'omuringa?<verse eid="JOB 6:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 6:13" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">6:13: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JOB 5:12">Yob 5:12</ref>. </char>
    </note> Buzimazima omuriinye tinkiinemu buhwezi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 6:13">Kandi obundi buhwezi bwona buunyihirweho.<verse eid="JOB 6:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 6:14" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">6:14: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PRO 17:17">Enf 17:17</ref>. </char>
    </note> Munywani w'omuntu orembire ashemereire kumugirira embabazi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 6:14">Ngu atakaareka kutiina Ow'obushoboorozi bwona.<verse eid="JOB 6:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 6:15" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">6:15: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JER 15:18">Yer 15:18</ref>. </char>
    </note> Beene waitu n'endyarya, nk'otugyera,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 6:15">Nk'omukura ogurikureetwamu omwegyemure, gukooma,<verse eid="JOB 6:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 6:16" />Ogurikwiraguzibwa amaizi agakwatsire,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 6:16">Omu orubaare rweshereka.<verse eid="JOB 6:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 6:17" />Hakibaho obutagatsi bikahwerera,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 6:17">Omushana gukijwa, bikaruga omu mwanya gwabyo.<verse eid="JOB 6:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 6:18" />Emitwe y'abagyenzi eyaabaire eraba aha rubaju rw'ogwo mukura, eteishuka,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 6:18">Eza omu ihamba, egwayo.<verse eid="JOB 6:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 6:19" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">6:19: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JOB 1:15">Yob 1:15</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 21:14">Isa 21:14</ref>. </char>
    </note> Emitwe y'Abateema eguma neesherura,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 6:19">N'abagyenzi ba Sheeba baguma bategyereize;<verse eid="JOB 6:19" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 6:20" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">6:20: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JER 14:3">Yer 14:3</ref>. </char>
    </note> Bahwa amatsiko, ahabw'okuba bakaba bagira obwesigye,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 6:20">Bakihikayo, bashoberwa.<verse eid="JOB 6:20" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 6:21" />Okwo nikwo mumbeereire;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 6:21">Ku mureebire ebihikiirizi ebimpikireho, mwatiina.<verse eid="JOB 6:21" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 6:22" />Hariho obu naagizire nti: Mugire eki mwampa?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 6:22">Nari shi nti: Mumpe ekiconco aha bi mutungire?<verse eid="JOB 6:22" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOB 6:23" />Nari nti: Munjune omu mikono y'omuzigu?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 6:23">Nari nti: Muncungure omu mikono y'abarikumpata?<verse eid="JOB 6:23" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOB 6:24" />Muunyegyese, naanye niinyija kwetsiza;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 6:24">Mummanyise eki naashobize.<verse eid="JOB 6:24" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOB 6:25" />Ebigambo by'okuhikiirira ka n'eby'amaani!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 6:25">Mbwenu empaka zaanyu nizimpana ki?<verse eid="JOB 6:25" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JOB 6:26" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">6:26: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JOB 7:7">Yob 7:7</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 41:29">Isa 41:29</ref>. </char>
    </note> Nimwenda kuhana ebigambo?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 6:26">Manya ebigambo by'owaayehweire amatsiko biri nk'omuyaga.<verse eid="JOB 6:26" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JOB 6:27" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">6:27: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JOL 3:3">Yoel 3:3</ref>; <ref loc="NAM 3:10">Nah 3:10</ref>. </char>
    </note> Buzima nimukunda kuteerera efuuzi enteenyu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 6:27">N'okwiha ahari munywani waanyu enshaagi.<verse eid="JOB 6:27" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JOB 6:28" />Mbwenu hati nimbeeshengyereza mundeebe;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 6:28">Ahabw'okuba buzima tindikubeiha, nk'oku murikundeeba.<verse eid="JOB 6:28" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JOB 6:29" />Nimbeeshengyereza muhindukye, mutakora ebitari by'okuhikiirira.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 6:29">Eego muhindukye; ebyangye n'eby'oburyo.<verse eid="JOB 6:29" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JOB 6:30" />Nimugira ngu orurimi rwangye rwine oku ruri?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 6:30">Tirurikubaasa kumanya ekibi?<verse eid="JOB 6:30" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="JOB 7" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 7:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">7:1: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JOB 14:14">Yob 14:14</ref>. </char>
    </note> Omuntu okiri omu nsi tari aha rubu rw'okurwana orugamba?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 7:1">Ebiro bye ti nk'eby'orikukorera ebihembo?<verse eid="JOB 7:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 7:2" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">7:2: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JOB 14:6">Yob 14:6</ref>; <ref loc="LEV 19:13">Lev 19:13</ref>. </char>
    </note> Nk'oku omuhuuku ayetenga ekicuucu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 7:2">Kandi nk'oku orikukorera ebihembo abitegyereza,<verse eid="JOB 7:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 7:3" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">7:3: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JOB 7:16">Yob 7:16</ref>; <ref loc="JOB 30:17">30:17</ref>. </char>
    </note> Naanye nikwo naahairwe ameezi ga busha,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 7:3">Nkateerwaho ebiro birikurusya.<verse eid="JOB 7:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 7:4" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">7:4: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="DEU 28:67">Bir 28:67</ref>. </char>
    </note> Ku mbyama, ngira nti: Nibusheesha ryari, nkaimuka?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 7:4">Kwonka ekiro kigyenda ira;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 7:4">Ndaara niinyehindaguturana, burugaho busheesha.<verse eid="JOB 7:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 7:5" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">7:5: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JOB 2:7">Yob 2:7</ref>, <ref loc="JOB 2:8">8</ref>. </char>
    </note> Omubiri gwangye gushwekirwe enyogori n'ebikoko,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 7:5">Oruhu rwagwo nirugangaara, rugaruka rushatuka.<verse eid="JOB 7:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 7:6" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">7:6: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JOB 9:25">Yob 9:25</ref>. </char>
    </note> Ebiro byangye nibyehuuta okukira eky'okurukisa ky'omuriki w'emyenda;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 7:6">Bihwaho ntaine matsiko.<verse eid="JOB 7:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 7:7" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">7:7: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 78:39">Zab 78:39</ref>. </char>
    </note> Ai bambe, ijuka amagara gangye, ku gari nk'omuyaga;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 7:7">Amaisho gangye tigarigaruka kureeba birungi.<verse eid="JOB 7:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 7:8" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">7:8: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JOB 7:21">Yob 7:21</ref>; <ref loc="JOB 20:9">20:9</ref>. </char>
    </note> Orikundeeba tarigaruka kundeeba bundi;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 7:8">Amaisho gaawe ku gariba nigakindeeba, ndyabura.<verse eid="JOB 7:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 7:9" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">7:9: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JOB 21:13">Yob 21:13</ref>; <ref loc="JOB 30:15">30:15</ref>. </char>
    </note> Nk'oku ekicu kiyaayuuka, kikabura,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 7:9">Nikwo orikushuuma okuzimu atarigaruka;<verse eid="JOB 7:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 7:10" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">7:10: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="2SA 12:23">2 Sam 12:23</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 103:16">Zab 103:16</ref>. </char>
    </note> Tarigaruka mu ka ye obundi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 7:10">Kandi omwanya gwe tigurigaruka kumumanya.<verse eid="JOB 7:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 7:11" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">7:11: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JOB 10:1">Yob 10:1</ref>; <ref loc="JOB 21:4">21:4</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 38:15">Isa 38:15</ref>; <ref loc="1SA 1:10">1 Sam 1:10</ref>. </char>
    </note> Nikyo ntarikubaasiza kwezibira kugamba;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 7:11">Niinyija kugambisibwa obusaasi bw'omu mutima gwangye,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 7:11">Nyetomboite ahabw'entimba y'omu magara gangye.<verse eid="JOB 7:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 7:12" />Nyowe ndi enyanja, nari ndi omugoye,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 7:12">Waaza kuntaho ow'okundinda?<verse eid="JOB 7:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 7:13" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">7:13: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JOB 9:27">Yob 9:27</ref>. </char>
    </note> Ku ndaagire nti: Ekitanda kyangye nikiija kumpuumuza,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 7:13">Ekitabo kyangye nikiija kutuubya aha busaasi bwangye,<verse eid="JOB 7:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 7:14" />Obwo nonkangisa n'ebirooto,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 7:14">Ontiinisa n'ebi oyorekirwe,<verse eid="JOB 7:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 7:15" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">7:15: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JOB 19:20">Yob 19:20</ref>; <ref loc="JOB 30:17">30:17</ref>. </char>
    </note> Ngu nyihemu okuteebwa aha munigo, nkafa,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 7:15">Okukira okuguma mpweire aha magufa.<verse eid="JOB 7:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 7:16" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">7:16: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JOB 9:21">Yob 9:21</ref>; <ref loc="JOB 10:1">10:1</ref>, <ref loc="JOB 10:20">20</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 39:13">Zab 39:13</ref>. </char>
    </note> Amagara gangye ngatamirwe, tinkyenda kugumaho;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 7:16">Ndeka, ahabw'okuba ebiro byangye n'ebya busha.<verse eid="JOB 7:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 7:17" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">7:17: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 8:4">Zab 8:4</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 144:3">144:3</ref>; <ref loc="HEB 2:6">Heb 2:6</ref>. </char>
    </note> Omuntu ni kintu ki, Iwe okumutunguura,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 7:17">N'okumwetaho okamwetaho,<verse eid="JOB 7:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 7:18" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">7:18: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 11:4">Zab 11:4</ref>, <ref loc="PSA 11:5">5</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 17:3">17:3</ref>. </char>
    </note> Okamutaayayira buri kasheeshe,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 7:18">Okamugyeza buri kaanya?<verse eid="JOB 7:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 7:19" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">7:19: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JOB 14:6">Yob 14:6</ref>. </char>
    </note> Oryahitsya hi okutaanyihaho riisho,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 7:19">N'okutampa kaanya k'okumira amacwante?<verse eid="JOB 7:19" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 7:20" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">7:20: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 27:3">Isa 27:3</ref>. </char>
    </note> Ku ndaabe naasiisire, iwe</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 7:20">Omurinzi w'abantu, nkwitsize ki?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 7:20">Ahabw'enki ompindwire ekimaasho?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 7:20">Ahanki nkubeereire omutwaro?<verse eid="JOB 7:20" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 7:21" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">7:21: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JOB 7:8">Yob 7:8</ref>; <ref loc="DAN 12:2">Dan 12:2</ref>. </char>
    </note> N'enki ekikuzibiire kusaasira ekicumuro kyangye,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 7:21">Okaanyihaho ekibi?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 7:21">Ahabw'okuba hati naaza kubyama omu mucuucu;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 7:21">Naiwe oryayezirika kunsherura, oshangye ntakiriho.<verse eid="JOB 7:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="JOB 8" />
  <para style="s1">Biludaadi okugarukamu Yobu</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 8:1" />Bwanyima Biludaadi Omushuuhi yaamugarukamu ati:<verse eid="JOB 8:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 8:2" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">8:2: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JOB 15:2">Yob 15:2</ref>. </char>
    </note> Beitu oryahitsya hi okugamba otyo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 8:2">Kandi ebigambo by'omu kanwa kaawe kuba nk'omuyaga gw'amaani?<verse eid="JOB 8:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 8:3" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">8:3: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JOB 34:12">Yob 34:12</ref>; <ref loc="ROM 3:5">Rom 3:5</ref>; <ref loc="2CH 19:7">2 Bus 19:7</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 32:4">Bir 32:4</ref>; <ref loc="GEN 18:25">Kut 18:25</ref>. </char>
    </note> Noogira ngu Ruhanga asingisiriza,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 8:3">Nari Ow'obushoboorozi bwona aita emanja z'oburyo?<verse eid="JOB 8:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 8:4" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">8:4: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JOB 1:5">Yob 1:5</ref>. </char>
    </note> Abaana baawe ku baraabe baacumwire ahari Ruhanga,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 8:4">Akabahayo omu bushoboorozi bw'ekicumuro kyabo.<verse eid="JOB 8:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 8:5" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">8:5: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JOB 5:8">Yob 5:8</ref>. </char>
    </note> Kwonka iwe, ku oraayezirikye kusherura Ruhanga,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 8:5">Waayeshengyereza Ow'obushoboorozi bwona,<verse eid="JOB 8:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 8:6" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">8:6: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 7:6">Zab 7:6</ref>; <ref loc="PRO 3:33">Enf 3:33</ref>. </char>
    </note> Ku oraabe oshemeire kandi ohikiriire,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 8:6">Buzimazima Ruhanga naija kwimuka ahabwawe,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 8:6">Akugarurire eka yaawe eyaabaire ehikiriire.<verse eid="JOB 8:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 8:7" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">8:7: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JOB 42:12">Yob 42:12</ref>; <ref loc="JAS 5:11">Yak 5:11</ref>. </char>
    </note> Kandi n'obu okutandika kwawe kuraabe kwabaire kuri kukye,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 8:7">Kwonka omu biro byawe ebya bwanyima ebyawe biryakanya munonga.<verse eid="JOB 8:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 8:8" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">8:8: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JOB 15:18">Yob 15:18</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 4:32">Bir 4:32</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 32:7">32:7</ref>. </char>
    </note> Ninkweshengyereza, buuza eby'ebiro bya ira,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 8:8">Oyetegyereze eki baatatenkuriitwe baareebire;<verse eid="JOB 8:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 8:9" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">8:9: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JOB 14:2">Yob 14:2</ref>; <ref loc="1CH 29:15">1 Bus 29:15</ref>. </char>
    </note> Ahabw'okuba itwe turi aba nyomwabazyo, titwine ki turikumanya,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 8:9">Kandi ebiro byaitu omu nsi ni nk'ekicuucu.<verse eid="JOB 8:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 8:10" />Tibarikwija kukwegyesa, bakakugambire,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 8:10">Nibahamya ebigambo ebi barikumanya?<verse eid="JOB 8:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 8:11" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">8:11: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="GEN 41:2">Kut 41:2</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 18:2">Isa 18:2</ref>. </char>
    </note> Orufunjo nirubaasa kumera ahataine byondo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 8:11">Nari omubimbiri kumera ahataine maizi?<verse eid="JOB 8:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 8:12" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">8:12: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 9:17">Zab 9:17</ref>; <ref loc="PRO 10:28">Enf 10:28</ref>. </char>
    </note> Ku biba bikiri bibisi, bitakatemirwe,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 8:12">Bibandiza ebindi binyaatsi byona kwoma.<verse eid="JOB 8:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 8:13" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">8:13: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JOB 27:8">Yob 27:8</ref>. </char>
    </note> Emihanda y'abarikwebwa Ruhanga boona nikwo eri,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 8:13">N'amatsiko g'otarikutiina Ruhanga garyahwaho.<verse eid="JOB 8:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 8:14" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">8:14: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 59:5">Isa 59:5</ref>. </char>
    </note> Eki arikwesiga kiryacuubwamu kabiri,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 8:14">N'obwesigye bwe ni nk'orububi rw'orutangura.<verse eid="JOB 8:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 8:15" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">8:15: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JOB 27:18">Yob 27:18</ref>. </char>
    </note> Aryayegamira enju ye, kwonka teryemerera;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 8:15">Aryagikwata, kwonka terigumaho.<verse eid="JOB 8:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 8:16" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">8:16: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 80:11">Zab 80:11</ref>. </char>
    </note> Naabengyeya aha mushana,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 8:16">N'omurubo gwe gubuga omusiri gwe;<verse eid="JOB 8:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 8:17" />Emizi ye neerandira aha mutuumo gw'amabaare,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 8:17">Atuura omu nkiri.<verse eid="JOB 8:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 8:18" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">8:18: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JOB 7:8">Yob 7:8</ref>, <ref loc="JOB 7:10">10</ref>. </char>
    </note> Ku ariihwa ahu yaabaire ari,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 8:18">Haryamwehakana hati: Tinkakureebaga.<verse eid="JOB 8:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 8:19" />Reeba, okwo nikwo kushemererwa kw'omuhanda gwe,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 8:19">Kandi omu itaka haryameramu abandi.<verse eid="JOB 8:19" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 8:20" />Reeba, tarinaga muntu ohikiriire,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 8:20">Kandi tariramira nkozi z'ebibi.<verse eid="JOB 8:20" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 8:21" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">8:21: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 126:2">Zab 126:2</ref>. </char>
    </note> Kwonka obunaku butari obu aryaijuza akanwa kaawe esheko</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 8:21">N'eminwa yaawe eteere akaari.<verse eid="JOB 8:21" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 8:22" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">8:22: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 35:26">Zab 35:26</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 132:18">132:18</ref>. </char>
    </note> Abaabaire nibakwanga, baryashwekwa enshoni,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 8:22">Kandi eihema ry'enkozi z'ebibi tiririgaruka kubaho.<verse eid="JOB 8:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="JOB 9" />
  <para style="s1">Okugarukamu kwa Yobu</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 9:1" />Bwanyima Yobu yaagarukamu ati:<verse eid="JOB 9:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 9:2" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">9:2: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JOB 4:17">Yob 4:17</ref>. </char>
    </note> N'amazima nimmanya ngu nikwo kiri;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 9:2">Beitu shi, omuntu akaabaasa ata kuba ohikiriire omu maisho ga Ruhanga?<verse eid="JOB 9:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 9:3" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">9:3: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JOB 10:2">Yob 10:2</ref>. </char>
    </note> Omuntu ku yaakwenda kuhakana nawe,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 9:3">Takaabaasa kumugarukamu kigambo na kimwe omu bigambo rukumi.<verse eid="JOB 9:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 9:4" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">9:4: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JOB 12:13">Yob 12:13</ref>; <ref loc="EXO 7:13">Kur 7:13</ref>; <ref loc="EXO 32:9">32:9</ref>. </char>
    </note> Omutima gwe n'ogw'obwengye, kandi amaani ge ni maingi;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 9:4">(N'oha owaakumugangaarira, haza akaba gye?)<verse eid="JOB 9:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 9:5" />Aihaho enshozi zitakimanyire,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 9:5">Ku aba naazijuumika n'ekiniga kye.<verse eid="JOB 9:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 9:6" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">9:6: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JOB 26:11">Yob 26:11</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 75:3">Zab 75:3</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 2:19">Isa 2:19</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 13:13">13:13</ref>; <ref loc="HAG 2:6">Hag 2:6</ref>, <ref loc="HAG 2:21">21</ref>. </char>
    </note> Atengyetsa ensi, agiiha omu mwanya gwayo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 9:6">Enyomyo zaayo zitengyeta.<verse eid="JOB 9:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 9:7" />Aragiira eizooba, tirituruka,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 9:7">N'enyonyoozi azitwekyerera.<verse eid="JOB 9:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 9:8" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">9:8: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JOB 26:7">Yob 26:7</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 104:2">Zab 104:2</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 40:22">Isa 40:22</ref>; <ref loc="JER 10:12">Yer 10:12</ref>. </char>
    </note> Niwe wenka owaabambire eiguru,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 9:8">Akaribatiirira ebingonzi by'enyanja.<verse eid="JOB 9:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 9:9" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">9:9: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JOB 37:9">Yob 37:9</ref>; <ref loc="JOB 38:31">38:31</ref>, <ref loc="JOB 38:32">32</ref>; <ref loc="AMO 5:8">Amo 5:8</ref>. </char>
    </note> Akahanga enyonyoozi Dubu na Orioni,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 9:9">Na Kakaaga n'emyanya y'obukiizi-bwa-buryo.<verse eid="JOB 9:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 9:10" />Akora ebikuru ebitarikubaasa kushoboororwa,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 9:10">N'eby'okutangaaza ebitarikubaasa kubarwa.<verse eid="JOB 9:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 9:11" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">9:11: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JOB 23:8">Yob 23:8</ref>, <ref loc="JOB 23:9">9</ref>. </char>
    </note> Reeba, andabaho, kwonka timmureeba;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 9:11">Agumizamu, kwonka timmwetegyereza.<verse eid="JOB 9:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 9:12" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">9:12: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JOB 11:10">Yob 11:10</ref>; <ref loc="JOB 23:13">23:13</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 45:9">Isa 45:9</ref>; <ref loc="JER 18:6">Yer 18:6</ref>; <ref loc="ROM 9:20">Rom 9:20</ref>. </char>
    </note> Reeba, anyaga; n'oha orikubaasa kumuzibira?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 9:12">N'oha owaakubaasa kumugira ati: Ekyo nookora ki?<verse eid="JOB 9:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 9:13" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">9:13: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JOB 26:12">Yob 26:12</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 89:10">Zab 89:10</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 13:7">Isa 13:7</ref>. </char>
    </note> Ruhanga tariihaho kiniga kye;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 9:13">Nangwa n'abahwezi ba Rahabu bamwinamira.<verse eid="JOB 9:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 9:14" />Mbwenu shi niinye naakumugarukamu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 9:14">Nkeesherurira ebigambo by'okumuhakanisa?<verse eid="JOB 9:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 9:15" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">9:15: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JOB 10:15">Yob 10:15</ref>. </char>
    </note> N'obu naakuba ndi ohikiriire, tinkaamugarukamu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 9:15">Kureka nkaamushaba kusaasirwa, ahakuba niwe arikunshinja.<verse eid="JOB 9:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 9:16" />Nangwa n'obu naakumweta, akangarukamu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 9:16">Tinkaikiriza ngu yampurira;<verse eid="JOB 9:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 9:17" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">9:17: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JOB 34:6">Yob 34:6</ref>. </char>
    </note> Ahabw'okuba ansingyeera n'eihunga,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 9:17">Akanyisa ebihuta byangye nantura busha.<verse eid="JOB 9:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 9:18" />Tandeka ngu nyitsye,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 9:18">Kureka anyijuza obushaarizi.<verse eid="JOB 9:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 9:19" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">9:19: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JER 49:19">Yer 49:19</ref>. </char>
    </note> Ku ndaagambe aha maani g'emanzi, Mukama waago ngugu!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 9:19">Ku biraabe biri eby'okucwa emanja, We naagira ati:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 9:19">N'oha oranteereho obunaku?<verse eid="JOB 9:19" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 9:20" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">9:20: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JOB 15:6">Yob 15:6</ref>. </char>
    </note> N'obu ndaabe ndi ohikiriire, akanwa kangye nikancwera orubanja;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 9:20">N'obu ndaabe ntaine kabara, nanshinja obugomi.<verse eid="JOB 9:20" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 9:21" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">9:21: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JOB 1:1">Yob 1:1</ref>; <ref loc="JOB 7:16">7:16</ref>; <ref loc="JOB 10:1">10:1</ref>. </char>
    </note> Ndi ohikire! Tiinyine ki nyeteireho!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 9:21">Ntamirwe amagara gangye.<verse eid="JOB 9:21" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 9:22" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">9:22: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ECC 9:2">Mub 9:2</ref>, <ref loc="ECC 9:3">3</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 21:3">Ezk 21:3</ref>. </char>
    </note> Byona nikyo kimwe; nikyo ndikugirira nti:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 9:22">Acwekyereza abahikire n'ababi.<verse eid="JOB 9:22" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOB 9:23" />Akagwe ku kagwa, kaakinura abantu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 9:23">Ashekyeerera abataine rubanja baaguubwaho akabi.<verse eid="JOB 9:23" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOB 9:24" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">9:24: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JOB 12:17">Yob 12:17</ref>. </char>
    </note> Ensi eheirweyo omu mikono y'ababi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 9:24">Ashweka amaisho g'abaramuzi baayo;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 9:24">Ku araabe atari We, ondiijo n'oha?<verse eid="JOB 9:24" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOB 9:25" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">9:25: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JOB 7:6">Yob 7:6</ref>; <ref loc="JER 51:31">Yer 51:31</ref>; <ref loc="2CH 30:6">2 Bus 30:6</ref>. </char>
    </note> Ebiro byangye nibiiruka okukira matarisi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 9:25">Nibihunga, kandi tibigira kirungi kyona eki bireeba;<verse eid="JOB 9:25" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JOB 9:26" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">9:26: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 18:2">Isa 18:2</ref>; <ref loc="HAB 1:8">Hab 1:8</ref>. </char>
    </note> Nibihingura, nk'amaato ganguhi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 9:26">Nk'oku empungu erahuka neeza kuteera eki ehiigire.<verse eid="JOB 9:26" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JOB 9:27" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">9:27: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JOB 7:13">Yob 7:13</ref>; <ref loc="JOB 10:20">10:20</ref>. </char>
    </note> Ku naakugira nti: Niinyija kwehuzya ekirikunsaasa,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 9:27">Ndekye kumanywa ku ngwirwe kubi, nyesiime,<verse eid="JOB 9:27" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JOB 9:28" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">9:28: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JOB 10:14">Yob 10:14</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 119:120">Zab 119:120</ref>. </char>
    </note> Biri ntiinire obusaasi bwangye bwona;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 9:28">Ahabw'okuba nimmanya ngu torinteekateekaho nk'otaine rubanja.<verse eid="JOB 9:28" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JOB 9:29" />Ndyasingwa orubanja;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 9:29">Mbwenu niinyeruhiza ki?<verse eid="JOB 9:29" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JOB 9:30" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">9:30: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JOB 22:30">Yob 22:30</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 1:25">Isa 1:25</ref>; <ref loc="JER 2:22">Yer 2:22</ref>. </char>
    </note> N'obu naakwoga amaizi g'ebirika,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 9:30">Nkanaaba engaro zangye n'esabuuni,<verse eid="JOB 9:30" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JOB 9:31" />Nabwo noija kunnaga omu kiina,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 9:31">N'ebijwaro byangye ahabwangye bintamwe.<verse eid="JOB 9:31" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="JOB 9:32" />Ahabw'okuba Ogwo ti muntu nkaanye, ngu mmugarukyemu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 9:32">Twemerere hamwe, tutongane;<verse eid="JOB 9:32" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JOB 9:33" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">9:33: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JOB 9:19">Yob 9:19</ref>; <ref loc="1SA 2:25">1 Sam 2:25</ref>. </char>
    </note> Tihariho w'okuturamura,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 9:33">Akatucura engaro omu maisho.<verse eid="JOB 9:33" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="JOB 9:34" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">9:34: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JOB 13:21">Yob 13:21</ref>; <ref loc="JOB 21:9">21:9</ref>; <ref loc="JOB 33:7">33:7</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 39:10">Zab 39:10</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 89:32">89:32</ref>. </char>
    </note> Mbwenu anyiheho enkoni ye,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 9:34">N'okutiinisa kwe kurekye kuunyitsa obwoba;<verse eid="JOB 9:34" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="JOB 9:35" />Haza obwo ngambe ntarikumutiina,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 9:35">Ahabw'okuba ahabwangye tindi w'okutiina.<verse eid="JOB 9:35" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="JOB 10" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 10:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">10:1: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="NUM 11:15">Kub 11:15</ref>; <ref loc="1KI 19:4">1 Bag 19:4</ref>; <ref loc="JOB 7:11">Yob 7:11</ref>, <ref loc="JOB 7:16">16</ref>; <ref loc="JOB 21:4">21:4</ref>. </char>
    </note> Ntamirwe amagara gangye;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 10:1">Tindikwija kwezibira kutaka;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 10:1">Niinyija kugamba ahabw'obusaasi bw'omu mutima gwangye.<verse eid="JOB 10:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 10:2" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">10:2: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JOB 9:3">Yob 9:3</ref>, <ref loc="JOB 9:29">29</ref>. </char>
    </note> Ngambire Ruhanga nti:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 10:2">Otancwera orubanja kunsinga,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 10:2">Kureka onyorekye eki orikuntura.<verse eid="JOB 10:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 10:3" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">10:3: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 138:8">Zab 138:8</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 64:8">Isa 64:8</ref>. </char>
    </note> Nooyesiimira okuhata,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 10:3">Okugaya eki waahangire,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 10:3">N'okushemerererwa enaama z'enkozi z'ebibi?<verse eid="JOB 10:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 10:4" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">10:4: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="1SA 16:7">1 Sam 16:7</ref>. </char>
    </note> Amaisho gaawe n'ag'omubiri,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 10:4">Nari shi oreeba nk'oku abantu bareeba?<verse eid="JOB 10:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 10:5" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">10:5: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JOB 36:26">Yob 36:26</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 77:10">Zab 77:10</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 90:4">90:4</ref>; <ref loc="2PE 3:8">2 Pet 3:8</ref>. </char>
    </note> Naiwe ebiro byawe ni nk'eby'abantu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 10:5">Nari emyaka yaawe ni nk'ey'abantu,<verse eid="JOB 10:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 10:6" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">10:6: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JOB 14:16">Yob 14:16</ref>. </char>
    </note> Kikabona kukureetera kucondooza okutahikiirira kwangye,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 10:6">N'okucaaka ekibi kyangye,<verse eid="JOB 10:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 10:7" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">10:7: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JOB 2:3">Yob 2:3</ref>, <ref loc="JOB 2:9">9</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 32:39">Bir 32:39</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 43:13">Isa 43:13</ref>. </char>
    </note> N'obu orikumanya ku ntaine rubanja,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 10:7">Kandi ku hatariho orikubaasa kujuna omuntu omu mikono yaawe?<verse eid="JOB 10:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 10:8" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">10:8: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 119:73">Zab 119:73</ref>. </char>
    </note> Engaro zaawe nizo zambumbire, zikampanga,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 10:8">Mbwenu wampindukana, wancwekyereza.<verse eid="JOB 10:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 10:9" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">10:9: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JOB 34:15">Yob 34:15</ref>; <ref loc="GEN 3:19">Kut 3:19</ref>; <ref loc="ECC 12:7">Mub 12:7</ref>. </char>
    </note> Ijuka ku wambumbire nk'eibumba;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 10:9">Mbwenu nooyenda kugaruka kumpindura omucuucu?<verse eid="JOB 10:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 10:10" />Okanshuka nk'amate,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 10:10">Wankamya nk'amajuta ga kiizi,<verse eid="JOB 10:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 10:11" />Wanshweka oruhu n'enyama,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 10:11">Wanteeranisa amagufa n'emitsi;<verse eid="JOB 10:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 10:12" />Wampa amagara n'obushongore,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 10:12">Okureeberera kwawe nikwo kungumizeho.<verse eid="JOB 10:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 10:13" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">10:13: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JOB 23:14">Yob 23:14</ref>; <ref loc="JOB 27:11">27:11</ref>. </char>
    </note> Kwonka ebyo byona okabibiika omu mutima gwawe,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 10:13">Kandi nimmanya ebyo ku waabigyendereire.<verse eid="JOB 10:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 10:14" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">10:14: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JOB 9:28">Yob 9:28</ref>; <ref loc="JOB 13:27">13:27</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 130:3">Zab 130:3</ref>. </char>
    </note> Ku nshobya, ommanya,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 10:14">Kandi toonyihaho rubanja;<verse eid="JOB 10:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 10:15" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">10:15: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JOB 9:15">Yob 9:15</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 3:11">Isa 3:11</ref>. </char>
    </note> Ku mba mubi, ndeeba enaku;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 10:15">Ku mba ohikiriire, timbaasa kwimutsya mutwe;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 10:15">Ahabw'okuba mba nyijwire okuhemuka,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 10:15">Nindeeba okubonabona kwangye.<verse eid="JOB 10:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 10:16" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">10:16: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 38:13">Isa 38:13</ref>; <ref loc="HOS 5:14">Hos 5:14</ref>; <ref loc="HOS 13:7">13:7</ref>. </char>
    </note> Kandi n'obu naakwimutsya omutwe, okaampiiga nk'entare,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 10:16">Ogaruka onkoraho eby'amahano,<verse eid="JOB 10:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 10:17" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">10:17: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JOB 16:8">Yob 16:8</ref>; <ref loc="JOB 19:12">19:12</ref>. </char>
    </note> Oimutsya busya baamushinja b'okunshinja,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 10:17">Oyongyera kungwerwa kubi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 10:17">Kandi oguma noondeetera amahe masya g'okundwanisa.<verse eid="JOB 10:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 10:18" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">10:18: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JOB 3:11">Yob 3:11</ref>. </char>
    </note> Mbwenu okaanyihira ki omunda ya maawe?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 10:18">Nangwa kuri naafiire hatakagizire riisho ryona eryandeeba,<verse eid="JOB 10:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 10:19" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">10:19: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="OBA 1:16">Oba 16</ref>. </char>
    </note> Nkaba nk'otakabahoga,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 10:19">Nkaziikwa ninkiruga omu nda.<verse eid="JOB 10:19" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 10:20" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">10:20: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JOB 7:16">Yob 7:16</ref>; <ref loc="JOB 9:27">9:27</ref>; <ref loc="JOB 14:1">14:1</ref>. </char>
    </note> Beitu ebiro by'amagara gangye ti bikye?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 10:20">Ndeka, nduhuukyeho kakye,<verse eid="JOB 10:20" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 10:21" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">10:21: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JOB 3:5">Yob 3:5</ref>; <ref loc="JOB 16:22">16:22</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 88:12">Zab 88:12</ref>. </char>
    </note> Ntakagiire ei ntariruga,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 10:21">Omu nsi y'omwirima, kandi ey'ekibunda kya rufu,<verse eid="JOB 10:21" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 10:22" />Omu nsi y'omwirima etarimu buteeka,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 10:22">Ei omushana guba nk'omwirima.<verse eid="JOB 10:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="JOB 11" />
  <para style="s1">Okugarukamu kwa Zofari</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 11:1" />Bwanyima Zofari Omunaamasi yaagarukamu ati:<verse eid="JOB 11:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 11:2" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">11:2: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PRO 10:19">Enf 10:19</ref>; <ref loc="ECC 5:3">Mub 5:3</ref>. </char>
    </note> Ebigambo bingi bityo tibishemereire kugarukwamu?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 11:2">Nari shi, engambi y'amaingi eshemereire kwihwaho orubanja?<verse eid="JOB 11:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 11:3" />Abantu bashemereire kuhunamisibwa emyehimbiso yaawe?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 11:3">Kandi ku oraateere enaku, tihariho orikukukwatsa enshoni?<verse eid="JOB 11:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 11:4" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">11:4: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JOB 10:7">Yob 10:7</ref>. </char>
    </note> Ahabw'okuba noogira oti: Ebi ndikwegyesa bihikire,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 11:4">Ndi mwere omu maisho ga Ruhanga.<verse eid="JOB 11:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 11:5" />Nkaabasibwa ki, Ruhanga agamba,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 11:5">Ayashamya akanwa ke, akwomesereza.<verse eid="JOB 11:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 11:6" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">11:6: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EZR 9:13">Ezr 9:13</ref>. </char>
    </note> Akugambira emibonano y'obwengye,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 11:6">Ahabw'okuba n'obw'emiringo mingi.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 11:6">Mbwenu omanye ku Ruhanga atarikufubira,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 11:6">Nk'oku ebibi byawe biri.<verse eid="JOB 11:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 11:7" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">11:7: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JOB 5:9">Yob 5:9</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 145:3">Zab 145:3</ref>; <ref loc="ECC 3:11">Mub 3:11</ref>; <ref loc="ECC 8:17">8:17</ref>; <ref loc="ROM 11:33">Rom 11:33</ref>. </char>
    </note> Noogira ngu okaabaasa kucondooza Ruhanga, omumanya?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 11:7">Okaabaasa kumanya Ow'obushoboorozi bwona, omumarayo?<verse eid="JOB 11:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 11:8" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">11:8: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JOB 22:12">Yob 22:12</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 139:8">Zab 139:8</ref>. </char>
    </note> Kiri ahaiguru okukira eiguru; nooyenda kukigira ota?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 11:8">Kiri okuzimu okukira owa Nyamuteza; nookimanya ota?<verse eid="JOB 11:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 11:9" />Oburaingwa bwakyo nibukira ensi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 11:9">N'obukiika bwakyo nibukira enyanja.<verse eid="JOB 11:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 11:10" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">11:10: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JOB 9:12">Yob 9:12</ref>; <ref loc="JOB 12:14">12:14</ref>. </char>
    </note> Ku yaakuraba omu nsi, yaata abantu omu kihome,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 11:10">Yaabeeta omu rubanja, n'oha owaakumuzibira?<verse eid="JOB 11:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 11:11" />Ahabw'okuba naamanya abantu entakimazire;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 11:11">Ku araareebe okutahikiirira, noogira ngu naakwehuzya?<verse eid="JOB 11:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 11:12" />Enturegye ku yaakuzaara omuntu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 11:12">Entakimazire akaagira obwengye.<verse eid="JOB 11:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 11:13" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">11:13: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="1SA 7:3">1 Sam 7:3</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 78:8">Zab 78:8</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 88:9">88:9</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 143:6">143:6</ref>. </char>
    </note> Ku oraashemeze omutima gwawe,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 11:13">Omutegye emikono.<verse eid="JOB 11:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 11:14" />Ku haraabe hariho okutahikiirira omu ngaro zaawe, okute hare;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 11:14">Otaikiriza obubi kuguma omu ka yaawe.<verse eid="JOB 11:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 11:15" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">11:15: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JOB 22:26">Yob 22:26</ref>; <ref loc="JOB 31:7">31:7</ref>; <ref loc="2PE 3:14">2 Pet 3:14</ref>; <ref loc="1JN 3:21">1 Yoh 3:21</ref>. </char>
    </note> Buzimazima obwo nibwo oriimutsya amaisho gaawe otaine kamogo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 11:15">Oryahama, kandi toritiina.<verse eid="JOB 11:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 11:16" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">11:16: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 65:16">Isa 65:16</ref>. </char>
    </note> Oryayebwa obujune bwawe,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 11:16">Obwijukye nk'amaizi agaheza kurabaho.<verse eid="JOB 11:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 11:17" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">11:17: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 37:6">Zab 37:6</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 58:8">Isa 58:8</ref>, <ref loc="ISA 58:10">10</ref>. </char>
    </note> Amagara gaawe garyayaka okukira eihangwe;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 11:17">N'obu gariba garimu omwirima, garyaba nk'akasheeshe.<verse eid="JOB 11:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 11:18" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">11:18: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 4:8">Zab 4:8</ref>; <ref loc="PRO 3:24">Enf 3:24</ref>. </char>
    </note> Oryagira obwesigye, ahabw'okugira amatsiko;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 11:18">Oryarindwa, ohuumure buhooro;<verse eid="JOB 11:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 11:19" />Oryabyama, tiharigira owaakutiinisa;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 11:19">Eego, baingi baryakuhakwaho.<verse eid="JOB 11:19" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 11:20" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">11:20: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JOB 17:5">Yob 17:5</ref>; <ref loc="JER 15:9">Yer 15:9</ref>. </char>
    </note> Kwonka amaisho g'ababi garyabwerabwera,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 11:20">Baryabura obuhungiro,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 11:20">Kandi amatsiko gaabo garyaba okuhwamu omwitsyo.<verse eid="JOB 11:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="JOB 12" />
  <para style="s1">Okugarukamu kwa Yobu</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 12:1" />Bwanyima Yobu yaagarukamu ati:<verse eid="JOB 12:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 12:2" />Eego, niimwe bantu mwenka;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 12:2">Kandi ku murifa, obwengye buryahwaho naimwe!<verse eid="JOB 12:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 12:3" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">12:3: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JOB 13:2">Yob 13:2</ref>; <ref loc="JOB 15:9">15:9</ref>. </char>
    </note> Kwonka naanye nyine obwengye nkaimwe;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 12:3">Timurikunkira.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 12:3">Mbwenu n'oha otarikumanya ebigambo nk'ebyo?<verse eid="JOB 12:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 12:4" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">12:4: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JOB 30:1">Yob 30:1</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 91:15">Zab 91:15</ref>. </char>
    </note> Ndi eky'okushekyererwa ahari bagyenzi bangye,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 12:4">Nyowe owaabaire atakira Ruhanga, akangarukamu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 12:4">Omuntu ohikiriire, otaine kamogo;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 12:4">Mbwenu ndi ow'okushekyererwa.<verse eid="JOB 12:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 12:5" />Omu mutima gw'omuntu ogaramisiriize habamu okugaya abahikiriirwe.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 12:5">Ebihikiirizi bitegyereize abarikuterera.<verse eid="JOB 12:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 12:6" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">12:6: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JOB 21:7">Yob 21:7</ref>. </char>
    </note> Amahema g'abambuzi gari gye;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 12:6">Abarikugwisa kubi Ruhanga bahamire,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 12:6">Abu emikono yaabo eba ruhanga waabo.<verse eid="JOB 12:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 12:7" />Mbwenu buuza enyamaishwa, niziija kukwegyesa,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 12:7">N'enyonyi z'omu mwanya niziija kukugambira;<verse eid="JOB 12:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 12:8" />Nari ogambire ensi, neija kukwegyesa,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 12:8">Kandi eby'omu nyanja nabyo nibiija kukumanyisa.<verse eid="JOB 12:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 12:9" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">12:9: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JOB 1:21">Yob 1:21</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 41:20">Isa 41:20</ref>. </char>
    </note> Omuri ebyo byona n'oha otarikumanya,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 12:9">Ku MUKAMA niwe yaakozire ekyo?<verse eid="JOB 12:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 12:10" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">12:10: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="DAN 5:23">Dan 5:23</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 17:28">Byak 17:28</ref>. </char>
    </note> Omu mukono gwe nimwo amagara g'ekintu kyona ekihuriire gari,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 12:10">Kandi n'omwitsyo gw'abantu boona nimwo guri.<verse eid="JOB 12:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 12:11" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">12:11: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JOB 34:3">Yob 34:3</ref>. </char>
    </note> Okutu tikutaanisa ebigambo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 12:11">Nk'oku akanwa kamanya eby'okurya?<verse eid="JOB 12:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 12:12" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">12:12: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JOB 32:7">Yob 32:7</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 119:100">Zab 119:100</ref>. </char>
    </note> Abagurusi nibo bagira obwengye,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 12:12">N'abahikize emyaka mingi nibo beetegyereza.<verse eid="JOB 12:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 12:13" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">12:13: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JOB 9:4">Yob 9:4</ref>; <ref loc="JOB 36:5">36:5</ref>. </char>
    </note> Obwengye n'amaani biinwe Ruhanga,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 12:13">Niwe ahanuura, kandi aine okwetegyereza.<verse eid="JOB 12:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 12:14" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">12:14: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JOB 11:10">Yob 11:10</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 22:22">Isa 22:22</ref>; <ref loc="REV 3:7">Kush 3:7</ref>. </char>
    </note> Ku asheenya, tihaine ogaruka kwombeka;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 12:14">Kandi ku akingirana omuntu, tihaine obaasa kwiguraho.<verse eid="JOB 12:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 12:15" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">12:15: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="GEN 7:11-24">Kut 7:11-24</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 11:17">Bir 11:17</ref>; <ref loc="1KI 8:35">1 Bag 8:35</ref>; <ref loc="AMO 9:6">Amo 9:6</ref>. </char>
    </note> Ku acungira amaizi, gooma;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 12:15">Kandi ku agaigurira, ensi etabaarwa.<verse eid="JOB 12:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 12:16" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">12:16: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JOB 5:12">Yob 5:12</ref>. </char>
    </note> Niwe agira amaani n'obwengye;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 12:16">Abarikugobezibwa n'abarikugobya n'abe.<verse eid="JOB 12:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 12:17" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">12:17: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JOB 9:24">Yob 9:24</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 40:23">Isa 40:23</ref>; <ref loc="1CO 1:19">1 Kor 1:19</ref>; <ref loc="2SA 17:23">2 Sam 17:23</ref>. </char>
    </note> Atwara abahanuuzi banyagirwe,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 12:17">N'abaramuzi abahindura abashema.<verse eid="JOB 12:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 12:18" />Abagabe abaihaho obushoboorozi</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 12:18">Abazirika obutanda omunda.<verse eid="JOB 12:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 12:19" />Abanyamurwa abatwara banyagirwe,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 12:19">N'ab'amaani abamaraho.<verse eid="JOB 12:19" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 12:20" />Abarikwesigwa ababuza ebigambo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 12:20">Kandi abagurusi abaihaho okwetegyereza.<verse eid="JOB 12:20" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 12:21" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">12:21: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 107:40">Zab 107:40</ref>. </char>
    </note> Ashuka aha banyiginya okugaywa,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 12:21">Ayuzya orukoba rw'ab'amaani.<verse eid="JOB 12:21" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 12:22" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">12:22: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="DAN 2:22">Dan 2:22</ref>; <ref loc="1CO 4:5">1 Kor 4:5</ref>. </char>
    </note> Ashuuruura ebisherekirwe omu mwirima,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 12:22">N'omwirima ndindindi agujwisiza omushana.<verse eid="JOB 12:22" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOB 12:23" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">12:23: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="2KI 18:11">2 Bag 18:11</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 9:3">Isa 9:3</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 26:15">26:15</ref>. </char>
    </note> Akanyisa amahanga, kandi agacwekyereza;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 12:23">Ahangusya amahanga, kandi agatuubya.<verse eid="JOB 12:23" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOB 12:24" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">12:24: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JOB 6:18">Yob 6:18</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 107:40">Zab 107:40</ref>. </char>
    </note> Abategyeki b'amahanga g'omu nsi abaihaho okwetegyereza,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 12:24">Abazengyereza omu ihamba eritarimu mihanda.<verse eid="JOB 12:24" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOB 12:25" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">12:25: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JOB 5:14">Yob 5:14</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 107:27">Zab 107:27</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 19:14">Isa 19:14</ref>. </char>
    </note> Babandagira omu mwirima bataine ky'okubahwezesa.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 12:25">Bagwererana nk'omusinzi.<verse eid="JOB 12:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="JOB 13" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 13:1" />Reeba, eriisho ryangye rikareeba ebyo byona,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 13:1">N'okutu kwangye kwabihurira, naabimanya.<verse eid="JOB 13:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 13:2" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">13:2: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JOB 15:9">Yob 15:9</ref>. </char>
    </note> Ebi murikumanya, naanye nimbimanya;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 13:2">Timwine ki murikunkiza.<verse eid="JOB 13:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 13:3" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">13:3: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JOB 13:15">Yob 13:15</ref>, <ref loc="JOB 13:18">18</ref>; <ref loc="JOB 23:4">23:4</ref>. </char>
    </note> Buzima nkaayenzire kugamba n'Ow'obushoboorozi bwona,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 13:3">Kandi n'okwetonganira ahari Ruhanga.<verse eid="JOB 13:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 13:4" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">13:4: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 119:69">Zab 119:69</ref>. </char>
    </note> Imwe ahabwanyu muri abagunzi b'ebishuba,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 13:4">Mwena muri abafumu abataine mutambo.<verse eid="JOB 13:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 13:5" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">13:5: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PRO 17:28">Enf 17:28</ref>. </char>
    </note> Nkaabaasibwa ki, muhunamira kimwe!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 13:5">Obwo nibwo mwakuba ab'obwengye.<verse eid="JOB 13:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 13:6" />Mbwenu muhurire ebi ndikufa,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 13:6">Mutegye amatu ebi ndikwetonganira.<verse eid="JOB 13:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 13:7" />Nimwenda kutonganira Ruhanga nimubeiha,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 13:7">Kandi nimuryarya ahabwe?<verse eid="JOB 13:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 13:8" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">13:8: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JDG 6:31">Bar 6:31</ref>. </char>
    </note> Nimwija kugwera orubaju rwe?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 13:8">Nimwenda kurwanirira Ruhanga?<verse eid="JOB 13:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 13:9" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">13:9: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="GAL 6:7">Gal 6:7</ref>. </char>
    </note> Mbwenu ku yaakubacaaka, bikaabagyendera gye?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 13:9">Nimubaasa kumuryarya, nk'oku omuntu aryarya mugyenzi we?<verse eid="JOB 13:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 13:10" />Buzimazima aryabahana,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 13:10">Ku murigira orubaju oru mwagwera bwesherekye.<verse eid="JOB 13:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 13:11" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">13:11: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JOB 31:23">Yob 31:23</ref>. </char>
    </note> Ekitiinisa kye tikiribaitsa obwoba,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 13:11">N'okutiinisa kwe kukabagwaho?<verse eid="JOB 13:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 13:12" />Ebigambo ebi murikuhamya n'enfumu eziri nk'eiju;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 13:12">Ebi murikwerinza ni nk'eibumba.<verse eid="JOB 13:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 13:13" />Nimuhuname, ngambe;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 13:13">Ekirambeho kimbeho!<verse eid="JOB 13:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 13:14" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">13:14: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JDG 12:3">Bar 12:3</ref>. </char>
    </note> N'obu byakuba bita,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 13:14">Niinyija kwoga amagara.<verse eid="JOB 13:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 13:15" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">13:15: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JOB 13:3">Yob 13:3</ref>; <ref loc="JOB 14:14">14:14</ref>; <ref loc="PRO 14:32">Enf 14:32</ref>. </char>
    </note> N'obu araanyite, tiinyine gandi matsiko;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 13:15">Ndyayetonganira omu maisho ge, niinyoreka ebinaakozire.<verse eid="JOB 13:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 13:16" />Ekyo nakyo kiryambeera okujunwa,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 13:16">Ahabw'okuba tihariho otatiina Ruhanga orihika omu maisho ge.<verse eid="JOB 13:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 13:17" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">13:17: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JOB 21:2">Yob 21:2</ref>. </char>
    </note> Mute omutima aha bigambo byangye,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 13:17">Mutegye amatu ebi ndikubagambira.<verse eid="JOB 13:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 13:18" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">13:18: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JOB 23:4">Yob 23:4</ref>. </char>
    </note> Reeba, mperize kuteekateeka ebi ndaayetonganire,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 13:18">Nimmanya ku ndikwija kusinga orubanja.<verse eid="JOB 13:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 13:19" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">13:19: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 50:8">Isa 50:8</ref>. </char>
    </note> Oraatongane naanye n'oha?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 13:19">Ahabw'okuba ku akureebeka, nkaahunama, nfa.<verse eid="JOB 13:19" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 13:20" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">13:20: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="GEN 3:8">Kut 3:8</ref>. </char>
    </note> Onyikirize ebintu bibiri byonka;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 13:20">Obwo nibwo ntarikwija kukweshereka.<verse eid="JOB 13:20" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 13:21" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">13:21: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JOB 9:34">Yob 9:34</ref>. </char>
    </note> Onyiheho omukono gwawe, gunze hare;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 13:21">Kandi okutiinisa kwawe kurekye kuunyitsa obwoba.<verse eid="JOB 13:21" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 13:22" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">13:22: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JOB 14:15">Yob 14:15</ref>. </char>
    </note> Bwanyima onyete, nkwetabe;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 13:22">Nari shi onyikirize, ngambe, naiwe ongarukyemu.<verse eid="JOB 13:22" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOB 13:23" />Ebicumuro byangye n'ebibi byangye ni bingahi?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 13:23">Mmanyisa okushiisha kwangye n'ekibi kyangye.<verse eid="JOB 13:23" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOB 13:24" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">13:24: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JOB 19:11">Yob 19:11</ref>; <ref loc="JOB 33:10">33:10</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 31:17">Bir 31:17</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 44:24">Zab 44:24</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 88:14">88:14</ref>. </char>
    </note> Ahabw'enki noonyima amaisho,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 13:24">Okanteekateekaho nk'omuzigu waawe?<verse eid="JOB 13:24" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOB 13:25" />Nooyenda kutiinisa eibabi eririkutwarwa omuyaga,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 13:25">N'okuhiiga ebishushunga ebyomire?<verse eid="JOB 13:25" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JOB 13:26" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">13:26: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 25:7">Zab 25:7</ref>. </char>
    </note> Ahabw'okuba nompandikaho ebirikushaarira,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 13:26">Ongaruraho ebibi by'obutsigazi bwangye;<verse eid="JOB 13:26" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JOB 13:27" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">13:27: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JOB 10:14">Yob 10:14</ref>; <ref loc="JOB 33:11">33:11</ref>. </char>
    </note> Otaire ebigyere byangye omu nkomo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 13:27">Waagumya amaisho aha mihanda yangye yoona,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 13:27">Ebigyere byangye waabiteeraho obugarukiro.<verse eid="JOB 13:27" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JOB 13:28" />Omuntu weena ahwaho nk'ekintu ekijunzire,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 13:28">Nk'ekijwaro ekiriirwe ebiyenje.<verse eid="JOB 13:28" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 13" />
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="JOB 14" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 14:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">14:1: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="GEN 47:9">Kut 47:9</ref>; <ref loc="JOB 5:7">Yob 5:7</ref>; <ref loc="JOB 10:20">10:20</ref>; <ref loc="JOB 15:14">15:14</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 39:5">Zab 39:5</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 89:47">89:47</ref>. </char>
    </note> Omuntu ozairwe omukazi amara ebiro bikye,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 14:1">Aba ow'enaku nsha.<verse eid="JOB 14:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 14:2" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">14:2: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JOB 8:9">Yob 8:9</ref>; <ref loc="JOB 17:7">17:7</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 90:6">Zab 90:6</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 103:15">103:15</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 109:23">109:23</ref>; <ref loc="ECC 6:12">Mub 6:12</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 40:6">Isa 40:6</ref>, <ref loc="ISA 40:7">7</ref>; <ref loc="JAS 1:10">Yak 1:10</ref>; <ref loc="1PE 1:24">1 Pet 1:24</ref>. </char>
    </note> Arabya nk'ekirabyo, ayoma;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 14:2">Ahingura nk'ekicuucu, tagumaho.<verse eid="JOB 14:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 14:3" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">14:3: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 8:4">Zab 8:4</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 143:2">143:2</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 144:3">144:3</ref>. </char>
    </note> Mbwenu shi Iwe, omuntu ori otyo okaayerusya kumureeba,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 14:3">Nari nkaanye, okandeeta kutongana naiwe?<verse eid="JOB 14:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 14:4" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">14:4: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JOB 15:14">Yob 15:14</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 51:5">Zab 51:5</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 3:6">Yoh 3:6</ref>. </char>
    </note> N'oha owaakubaasa kwiha ekirungi omu kibi?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 14:4">Tihariho n'omwe.<verse eid="JOB 14:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 14:5" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">14:5: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JOB 7:1">Yob 7:1</ref>; <ref loc="JOB 21:21">21:21</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 39:4">Zab 39:4</ref>. </char>
    </note> Nk'oku ebiro bye byamugyereirwe,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 14:5">Omubaro gw'ameezi ge okagumanya,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 14:5">Okamuteeraho obugarukiro, obu atarikubaasa kurenga,<verse eid="JOB 14:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 14:6" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">14:6: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JOB 7:1">Yob 7:1</ref>, <ref loc="JOB 7:19">19</ref>. </char>
    </note> Omwiheho amaisho, abone kuhuumuraho,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 14:6">Okuhitsya obu ariheza ebiro bye, nk'orikukorera ebihembo.<verse eid="JOB 14:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 14:7" />Manya, hariho amatsiko ngu, ekiti ku kitemwa, kitooka,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 14:7">Kandi ngu emitwe y'amataagi mato gaakyo egumizamu neekura.<verse eid="JOB 14:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 14:8" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">14:8: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 11:1">Isa 11:1</ref>. </char>
    </note> N'obu emizi yaakyo yaakuguma omu itaka, ekakura,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 14:8">N'ekitsintsi kyakyo kikajundira aho,<verse eid="JOB 14:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 14:9" />Kwonka ku kihurira okufukiirira kw'amaizi, kitooka,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 14:9">Kimera amataagi nk'ekiti kito.<verse eid="JOB 14:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 14:10" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">14:10: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JOB 20:7">Yob 20:7</ref>. </char>
    </note> Kwonka omuntu we afa bwamperayo;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 14:10">Buzima omwitsyo gumuhwamu. Mbwenu obwo aba akirahi?<verse eid="JOB 14:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 14:11" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">14:11: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 19:5">Isa 19:5</ref>. </char>
    </note> Nk'oku amaizi g'omu kiyanja gaijururuka,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 14:11">N'omugyera gukatuuba, gukooma,<verse eid="JOB 14:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 14:12" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">14:12: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 72:5">Zab 72:5</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 89:29">89:29</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 11:11">Yoh 11:11</ref>. </char>
    </note> Nikwo n'omuntu abyama ataimukye;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 14:12">Tariimuka, n'obu kwakuba okusisiimurwa,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 14:12">Okuhitsya obu eiguru ririba ritakiriho.<verse eid="JOB 14:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 14:13" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">14:13: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JOB 21:13">Yob 21:13</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 26:20">Isa 26:20</ref>. </char>
    </note> Nkaabaasibwa ki, onshereka okuzimu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 14:13">Ondindira omu mubonano, okuhitsya ahu ekiniga kyawe kirihwera,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 14:13">Onteeraho obunaku, onyijuka!<verse eid="JOB 14:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 14:14" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">14:14: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JOB 7:1">Yob 7:1</ref>. </char>
    </note> (Omuntu ku afa, agaruka abaho?)</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 14:14">Ebiro byangye byona ebyanteereirweho nkaabigumisiririza,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 14:14">Ntegyereza obunaku bwangye bw'okurekurwa.<verse eid="JOB 14:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 14:15" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">14:15: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JOB 10:3">Yob 10:3</ref>; <ref loc="JOB 13:22">13:22</ref>. </char>
    </note> Ku waakuunyeta, nkaakwetaba;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 14:15">Kandi naiwe okaayetenga kureeba eki emikono yaawe yaakozire;<verse eid="JOB 14:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 14:16" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">14:16: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JOB 31:4">Yob 31:4</ref>. </char>
    </note> Ahabw'okuba hati noobara entambwe zangye,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 14:16">Kandi otaire eriisho aha kibi kyangye.<verse eid="JOB 14:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 14:17" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">14:17: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="DEU 32:34">Bir 32:34</ref>; <ref loc="HOS 13:12">Hos 13:12</ref>. </char>
    </note> Okushiisha kwangye kukomirwe omu nshaho,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 14:17">N'okutahikiirira kwangye kukomeirwe hamwe.<verse eid="JOB 14:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 14:18" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">14:18: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JOB 18:4">Yob 18:4</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 34:4">Isa 34:4</ref>. </char>
    </note> Kwonka orushozi orutuura nirugwa, ruguubwa rwahwaho;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 14:18">N'orukiri rwihwa omu mwanya gwarwo;<verse eid="JOB 14:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 14:19" />Amaizi gagyenda nigarya amabaare,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 14:19">N'emitunga etwara eitaka ry'ensi;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 14:19">Naiwe nikwo omaraho amatsiko g'omuntu.<verse eid="JOB 14:19" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 14:20" />Ebiro byona omusingura, nawe ahwaho;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 14:20">Aha maisho ge ohahindura okundi; omwohereza.<verse eid="JOB 14:20" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 14:21" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">14:21: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ECC 9:5">Mub 9:5</ref>. </char>
    </note> Abatabani batunga ekitiinisa, atakikimanya;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 14:21">Bagarurwa ahansi, kwonka tamanya byabo;<verse eid="JOB 14:21" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 14:22" />Kureka obusaasi obu ahurira, n'obw'omubiri gwe;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 14:22">Kandi amaganya agu agira, gaba age wenka.<verse eid="JOB 14:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 14" />
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="JOB 15" />
  <para style="s1">Elifaazi okugarukamu Yobu obwa kabiri</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 15:1" />Bwanyima Elifaazi Omutemaani yaagarukamu ati:<verse eid="JOB 15:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 15:2" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">15:2: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JOB 6:26">Yob 6:26</ref>; <ref loc="JOB 8:2">8:2</ref>; <ref loc="JOB 16:3">16:3</ref>; <ref loc="HOS 12:1">Hos 12:1</ref>. </char>
    </note> Noogira ngu omuntu w'obwengye ashemereire kugarukamu n'ebigambo ebitaine muhoho,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 15:2">N'okwijuza enda ye omuyaga gw'oburugwa-izooba?<verse eid="JOB 15:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 15:3" />Ashemereire kuteera empaka n'ebigambo ebitaine buryo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 15:3">Nari okugamba ebitaine ki birikugasira abandi?<verse eid="JOB 15:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 15:4" />Kwonka nooyenda kwihaho okutiina Ruhanga,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 15:4">N'okuzibira abantu kugira eki baateekateekaho bari omu maisho ge;<verse eid="JOB 15:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 15:5" />Ahabw'okuba okutahikiirira kwawe nikwo kwegyesa akanwa kaawe eby'okugamba,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 15:5">Naiwe okunda kugambisa orurimi rw'obugobya.<verse eid="JOB 15:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 15:6" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">15:6: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JOB 9:20">Yob 9:20</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 19:22">Luk 19:22</ref>; <ref loc="2SA 1:16">2 Sam 1:16</ref>. </char>
    </note> Akanwa kaawe niko karikukucwera orubanja, tiinye;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 15:6">N'eminwa yaawe yonka niyo erikukushinja.<verse eid="JOB 15:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 15:7" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">15:7: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JOB 38:21">Yob 38:21</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 90:2">Zab 90:2</ref>; <ref loc="PRO 8:25">Enf 8:25</ref>. </char>
    </note> Niiwe waabandiize abandi kuzaarwa?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 15:7">Nari okazaarwa, enshozi zitakabaireho?<verse eid="JOB 15:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 15:8" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">15:8: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JOB 29:4">Yob 29:4</ref>; <ref loc="JER 23:18">Yer 23:18</ref>; <ref loc="ROM 11:34">Rom 11:34</ref>; <ref loc="1CO 2:11">1 Kor 2:11</ref>. </char>
    </note> Orashutamire omu naama za Ruhanga ez'omu mubonano?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 15:8">Nooyenda kuba niiwe waagira obwengye wenka?<verse eid="JOB 15:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 15:9" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">15:9: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JOB 12:3">Yob 12:3</ref>; <ref loc="JOB 13:2">13:2</ref>. </char>
    </note> Eki orikumanya, itwe eki tutarikumanya, niki?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 15:9">Nooyetegyereza ki, itwe eki tutarikushoborokyerwa?<verse eid="JOB 15:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 15:10" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">15:10: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JOB 12:12">Yob 12:12</ref>; <ref loc="JOB 32:6">32:6</ref>, <ref loc="JOB 32:7">7</ref>. </char>
    </note> Omuriitwe harimu abamezire enju,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 15:10">N'abakuzire munonga abarikukira sho.<verse eid="JOB 15:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 15:11" />Okuhuumuriza kwa Ruhanga ahabwawe ni kukye,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 15:11">N'ebigambo ebi ogambiirwe gye, noobigaya?<verse eid="JOB 15:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 15:12" />Ahabw'enki omutima gwawe nigukubambaaza,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 15:12">Amaisho gakakutukura,<verse eid="JOB 15:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 15:13" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">15:13: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JOB 21:4">Yob 21:4</ref>. </char>
    </note> Kikareetera omutima gwawe kurwanisa Ruhanga,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 15:13">Okagamba ebigambo nk'ebyo?<verse eid="JOB 15:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 15:14" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">15:14: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JOB 25:4-6">Yob 25:4-6</ref>; <ref loc="PRO 20:9">Enf 20:9</ref>; <ref loc="1JN 1:8">1 Yoh 1:8</ref>, <ref loc="1JN 1:10">10</ref>. </char>
    </note> Omuntu ni kintu ki, kuba oshemeire,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 15:14">N'owaazairwe omukazi, kuba ohikiriire?<verse eid="JOB 15:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 15:15" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">15:15: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JOB 4:18">Yob 4:18</ref>. </char>
    </note> Reeba, Ruhanga tayesiga barikwera be,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 15:15">Nangwa n'eiguru tirishemeire mu maisho ge,<verse eid="JOB 15:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 15:16" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">15:16: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JOB 34:7">Yob 34:7</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 14:3">Zab 14:3</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 53:1">53:1</ref>. </char>
    </note> Kaashwa omuntu ekihagaro owaasiisikaire,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 15:16">Ogotomera okutahikiirira nk'amaizi.<verse eid="JOB 15:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 15:17" />Naaza kukushobororera, haza ompurire!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 15:17">Kandi ebi naareebire, nibyo ndikwija kukumanyisa,<verse eid="JOB 15:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 15:18" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">15:18: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JOB 8:8">Yob 8:8</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 44:1">Zab 44:1</ref>. </char>
    </note> (Ebyagambirwe abanyabwengye,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 15:18">Ebi baishebo batarasherekire,<verse eid="JOB 15:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 15:19" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">15:19: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JOL 3:17">Yoel 3:17</ref>. </char>
    </note> Abaaheirwe ensi bonka,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 15:19">Batagiibwemu munyamahanga weena)<verse eid="JOB 15:19" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 15:20" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">15:20: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JOB 27:13">Yob 27:13</ref>. </char>
    </note> Omusiisi atuura n'obusaasi ebiro byona,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 15:20">Niyo myaka eyateereirweho abarikuhata.<verse eid="JOB 15:20" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 15:21" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">15:21: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JOB 18:11">Yob 18:11</ref>; <ref loc="1TH 5:3">1 Tes 5:3</ref>. </char>
    </note> Ebirikutiinisa biteerera enduuru omu matu ge;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 15:21">N'obu ariba ari omu kugogyera,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 15:21">Omuhwerekyerezi aryamugwaho.<verse eid="JOB 15:21" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 15:22" />Taikiriza ngu aryagaruka arugye omu mwirima,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 15:22">Kandi ateekateekyeirwe rurara.<verse eid="JOB 15:22" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOB 15:23" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">15:23: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 59:15">Zab 59:15</ref>. </char>
    </note> Azengyerera hoona naaza kushaka, naagira ati: Eby'okushaka birahi?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 15:23">Naamanya ku ekiro ky'omwirima kiri haihi kumuhikaho.<verse eid="JOB 15:23" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOB 15:24" />Enaku n'obusaasi bimutiinisa,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 15:24">Bimusingura nk'omugabe oyeteekateekyeire orugamba;<verse eid="JOB 15:24" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOB 15:25" />Ahabw'okuba akabanga omukono kurwanisa Ruhanga,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 15:25">Yaahiga Ow'obushoboorozi bwona,<verse eid="JOB 15:25" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JOB 15:26" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">15:26: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 75:5">Zab 75:5</ref>. </char>
    </note> Yaamwegyemera agangaize ebitsya,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 15:26">Akingire engabo eine eiromba rihango.<verse eid="JOB 15:26" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JOB 15:27" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">15:27: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 17:10">Zab 17:10</ref>. </char>
    </note> Ahabw'okuba omugomoka gukamushweka aha maisho,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 15:27">N'ebigojo byahingamirana aha nyugunyu ze,<verse eid="JOB 15:27" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JOB 15:28" />Kandi yaatuura omu ndembo ezihindukire amatongo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 15:28">N'omu maju agatashemereire kutaahwamu muntu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 15:28">Agabaire gari haihi kuhinduka emungo z'amatongo.<verse eid="JOB 15:28" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JOB 15:29" />N'ahabw'ekyo taritunga, n'eitungo rye tiririgumaho,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 15:29">Kandi taritsimba mizi omu itaka.<verse eid="JOB 15:29" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JOB 15:30" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">15:30: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JOB 4:9">Yob 4:9</ref>. </char>
    </note> Tarikira mwirima,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 15:30">Endimi z'omuriro ziryayomya amataagi ge,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 15:30">Atwarwe omwitsyo gwa Ruhanga.<verse eid="JOB 15:30" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JOB 15:31" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">15:31: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 59:4">Isa 59:4</ref>. </char>
    </note> Arekye kwesiga ebitaine mugasho, naayebeiha;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 15:31">ahakuba ebitaine mugasho nibyo arizimuurirwa.<verse eid="JOB 15:31" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="JOB 15:32" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">15:32: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 55:23">Zab 55:23</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 102:24">102:24</ref>. </char>
    </note> Aryahembwa byona, obunaku bwe butakahikire,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 15:32">Amataagi agarikumutookaho gatakabaire kijubwe.<verse eid="JOB 15:32" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JOB 15:33" />Aryaba nk'omuzaabibu, ogu ebijuma byagwo biragarika bitakahiisize,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 15:33">Abe nk'omuzeituuni ogurikuragaza orurabyo.<verse eid="JOB 15:33" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="JOB 15:34" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">15:34: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JOB 20:26">Yob 20:26</ref>. </char>
    </note> Ahabw'okuba omutwe gw'abatarikutiina Ruhanga guryaba engumba,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 15:34">Kandi omuriro guryamaraho amahema g'abarikurya enguzi.<verse eid="JOB 15:34" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="JOB 15:35" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">15:35: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 7:14">Zab 7:14</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 59:4">Isa 59:4</ref>. </char>
    </note> Babaka enda z'eitima, bazaara obubi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 15:35">N'emitima yaabo eteekateeka obugobya.<verse eid="JOB 15:35" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 15" />
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="JOB 16" />
  <para style="s1">Okugarukamu kwa Yobu</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 16:1" />Bwanyima Yobu yaagarukamu ati:<verse eid="JOB 16:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 16:2" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">16:2: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JOB 13:4">Yob 13:4</ref>. </char>
    </note> Manya mpuriire bingi ebirikushusha bityo;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 16:2">Mwena muri abayaagi abarikurusya.<verse eid="JOB 16:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 16:3" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">16:3: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JOB 15:2">Yob 15:2</ref>. </char>
    </note> Ebigambo ebitaine mugasho biherera hi?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 16:3">Ekyakureetera kungarukamu niki?<verse eid="JOB 16:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 16:4" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">16:4: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="2KI 19:21">2 Bag 19:21</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 22:7">Zab 22:7</ref>; <ref loc="JER 18:16">Yer 18:16</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 27:39">Mat 27:39</ref>. </char>
    </note> Kuri noogira ngu niimwe muri nkaanye,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 16:4">Nkaabaasize kugamba nkaimwe;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 16:4">Nyungayunga ebigambo by'okubapaatiika,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 16:4">Mbazongoreza omutwe;<verse eid="JOB 16:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 16:5" />Kwonka nkaabagumize n'akanwa kangye,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 16:5">N'ebigambo by'orurimi rwangye bibatuubiza aha busaasi.<verse eid="JOB 16:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 16:6" />N'obu ndaagambe, obusaasi bwangye tiburikutuuba,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 16:6">Nari shi bwo ku ndaayegumye, niinyija kutuubizibwa ki?<verse eid="JOB 16:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 16:7" />Mbwenu ho Ruhanga andembize,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 16:7">Ammazireho abangye boona.<verse eid="JOB 16:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 16:8" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">16:8: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JOB 10:17">Yob 10:17</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 109:24">Zab 109:24</ref>; <ref loc="RUT 1:21">Rus 1:21</ref>. </char>
    </note> Ankwatsire; nikyo kirikunshinja,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 16:8">Okuhwa aha magufa kwangye kuunyimukiriire;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 16:8">Nikwo kurikuunyomesereza.<verse eid="JOB 16:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 16:9" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">16:9: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JOB 18:4">Yob 18:4</ref>; <ref loc="JOB 30:21">30:21</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 35:16">Zab 35:16</ref>; <ref loc="LAM 2:16">Tonz 2:16</ref>; <ref loc="HOS 6:1">Hos 6:1</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 7:54">Byak 7:54</ref>. </char>
    </note> Antaanyagwize anyiniire ekiniga, yaanyita kubi;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 16:9">Anneneire amaino,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 16:9">Ogwo mubisha wangye anzooreire amaisho.<verse eid="JOB 16:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 16:10" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">16:10: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="1KI 22:24">1 Bag 22:24</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 3:7">Zab 3:7</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 22:13">22:13</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 35:15">35:15</ref>; <ref loc="LAM 3:30">Tonz 3:30</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 23:2">Byak 23:2</ref>. </char>
    </note> Abantu baanyashamiire,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 16:10">Banteera aha itama nibanjuma;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 16:10">Nibateeranira hamwe kunteera.<verse eid="JOB 16:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 16:11" />Ruhanga nampayo omu mikono y'abarikumutiina,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 16:11">Yannaga omu mikono y'enkozi z'ebibi.<verse eid="JOB 16:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 16:12" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">16:12: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JOB 7:20">Yob 7:20</ref>. </char>
    </note> Nkaba ndi aho ngaramisiriize, yampendagura;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 16:12">Yankwata aha bitsya, yancwa obusaasingo;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 16:12">Bwanyima yangira ekimaasho kye.<verse eid="JOB 16:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 16:13" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">16:13: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JOB 6:4">Yob 6:4</ref>; <ref loc="JOB 27:22">27:22</ref>; <ref loc="LAM 2:11">Tonz 2:11</ref>. </char>
    </note> Abarasi be bangotsire,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 16:13">Anteire aha ntsigo, zaashohora, tiyansaasira,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 16:13">Yaasheesha endurwe yangye aha nsi.<verse eid="JOB 16:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 16:14" />Anfumagwire,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 16:14">Yaanyegyemera nk'emanzi.<verse eid="JOB 16:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 16:15" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">16:15: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 7:5">Zab 7:5</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 75:10">75:10</ref>. </char>
    </note> Omubiri gwangye ngubaziireho ebiguniya,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 16:15">N'eihembe ryangye naaritabika omu itaka.<verse eid="JOB 16:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 16:16" />Amaisho gangye gahonoirwe okurira,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 16:16">N'ebitsigye byangye byairirimba,<verse eid="JOB 16:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 16:17" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">16:17: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 53:9">Isa 53:9</ref>. </char>
    </note> N'obu engaro zangye ziraabe zitaine itima,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 16:17">N'okushaba kwangye kushemeire.<verse eid="JOB 16:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 16:18" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">16:18: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="GEN 4:10">Kut 4:10</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 26:21">Isa 26:21</ref>. </char>
    </note> Iwe nsi 'we, otataba eshagama yangye,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 16:18">Kandi okutaka kwangye kurekye kugira ahu kwatuuriza.<verse eid="JOB 16:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 16:19" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">16:19: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 89:37">Zab 89:37</ref>; <ref loc="ROM 1:9">Rom 1:9</ref>. </char>
    </note> Na mbwenu, reeba, omujurizi wangye ari omu iguru,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 16:19">N'omwema wangye ari ahaiguru;<verse eid="JOB 16:19" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 16:20" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">16:20: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JOB 12:5">Yob 12:5</ref>. </char>
    </note> Banywani bangye nibangaya,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 16:20">amaisho gangye nigashuka amarira ahari Ruhanga,<verse eid="JOB 16:20" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 16:21" />Ngu aikirize omuntu kumwetonganiraho,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 16:21">Nk'omuntu na mutaahi we.<verse eid="JOB 16:21" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 16:22" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">16:22: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JOB 10:21">Yob 10:21</ref>. </char>
    </note> Ahabw'okuba emyaka mikye ku erihwa,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 16:22">Ndyatoora omuhanda ogu ntarigaruka kureetwa.<verse eid="JOB 16:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 16" />
  <chapter number="17" style="c" sid="JOB 17" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 17:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">17:1: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 88:3">Zab 88:3</ref>, <ref loc="PSA 88:4">4</ref>. </char>
    </note> Omutima gwangye gucwekire, ebiro byangye bihwire,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 17:1">Ekituuro kintegyereize.<verse eid="JOB 17:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 17:2" />Buzimazima nyehinguririziibwe abarikunteerera enaku;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 17:2">Eriisho ryangye nditaire aha bi barikundahuza.<verse eid="JOB 17:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 17:3" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">17:3: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 119:122">Zab 119:122</ref>; <ref loc="PRO 6:1">Enf 6:1</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 38:14">Isa 38:14</ref>; <ref loc="HEB 7:22">Heb 7:22</ref>. </char>
    </note> Mbwenu taho omusingo, onyemererere;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 17:3">Ori aho orikwija kuunyemerera n'oha?<verse eid="JOB 17:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 17:4" />Nk'oku ozibiire emitima yaabo kwetegyereza,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 17:4">Nikyo otarikubaikiririza kusingura.<verse eid="JOB 17:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 17:5" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">17:5: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JOB 11:20">Yob 11:20</ref>. </char>
    </note> Orikurega banywani be, ngu abagane aha bintu byabo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 17:5">Amaisho g'abaana be garyabwerabwera.<verse eid="JOB 17:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 17:6" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">17:6: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JOB 30:9">Yob 30:9</ref>, <ref loc="JOB 30:10">10</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 28:37">Bir 28:37</ref>. </char>
    </note> Ampindwire eky'okucweraho enfumu omu mahanga,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 17:6">Mpindukire ou abantu barikunuga butunu.<verse eid="JOB 17:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 17:7" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">17:7: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JOB 14:2">Yob 14:2</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 6:7">Zab 6:7</ref>. </char>
    </note> Ahabw'obusaasi amaisho gangye garimu oruho,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 17:7">N'engingo zangye zoona ziri nk'ekibunda.<verse eid="JOB 17:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 17:8" />Abantu abagororokire nibakitangaarira,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 17:8">Kandi abatariho rubanja nibeezirika kurwanisa abatarikutiina Ruhanga;<verse eid="JOB 17:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 17:9" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">17:9: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JOB 22:30">Yob 22:30</ref>. </char>
    </note> Kwonka ohikiriire ahamiire omu muhanda gwe,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 17:9">Kandi oine engaro zishemeire naayeyongyera kugira amaani.<verse eid="JOB 17:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 17:10" />Mbwenu imwe mwena, mugarukye mwije;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 17:10">Tihariho munyabwengye n'omwe ou ndikwija kushanga omuriimwe.<verse eid="JOB 17:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 17:11" />Ebiro byangye bihwire,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 17:11">Ebi mbaire niinyenda kukora bifiire,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 17:11">Nibyo byetengo by'omutima gwangye.<verse eid="JOB 17:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 17:12" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">17:12: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JOB 11:17">Yob 11:17</ref>. </char>
    </note> Ekiro nibakihindura nyomushana,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 17:12">Nibagira ngu omushana guri haihi kuba nk'omwirima.<verse eid="JOB 17:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 17:13" />Ku naakwenda okuzimu ku eba eka yangye,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 17:13">Naayara ekitabo kyangye omu mwirima,<verse eid="JOB 17:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 17:14" />Naagira ekiina nti: Niiwe tata,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 17:14">N'enyogori nti: Ori maawe, nari munyaanyazi,<verse eid="JOB 17:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 17:15" />Mbwenu obwo amatsiko gangye gakaaba gakirahi?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 17:15">Kandi ago matsiko garyareebwa oha?<verse eid="JOB 17:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 17:16" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">17:16: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JOB 3:17-19">Yob 3:17-19</ref>; <ref loc="JOB 21:26">21:26</ref>. </char>
    </note> Garyashuuma naanye, tuhikye aha mpimbi z'okuzimu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 17:16">Ku ndiba naahumwire nago omu mucuucu.<verse eid="JOB 17:16" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 17" />
  <chapter number="18" style="c" sid="JOB 18" />
  <para style="s1">Biludaadi okugarukamu Yobu obwa kabiri</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 18:1" />Bwanyima Biludaadi Omushuuhi yaagarukamu ati:<verse eid="JOB 18:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 18:2" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">18:2: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MRK 12:13">Mak 12:13</ref>. </char>
    </note> Muryahitsya hi okutegana n'empaka z'ebigambo?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 18:2">Nimuteekateekye, haza tubone kugamba.<verse eid="JOB 18:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 18:3" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">18:3: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 73:22">Zab 73:22</ref>. </char>
    </note> Ahabw'enki nitutwazibwa nk'ente,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 18:3">Okatuteekateekaho nk'abataine bwengye?<verse eid="JOB 18:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 18:4" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">18:4: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JOB 14:18">Yob 14:18</ref>; <ref loc="JOB 16:9">16:9</ref>. </char>
    </note> Iwe orikwetaagura ahabw'ekiniga,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 18:4">Noogira ngu ensi neija kutsigwaho ahabwawe,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 18:4">Nari orukiri rwihwe omu mwanya gwarwo?<verse eid="JOB 18:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 18:5" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">18:5: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JOB 21:17">Yob 21:17</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 18:28">Zab 18:28</ref>; <ref loc="PRO 13:9">Enf 13:9</ref>. </char>
    </note> Eego, etabaaza y'omunyabibi eryaraazibwa,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 18:5">N'endimi z'omuriro gwe tiziryaka;<verse eid="JOB 18:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 18:6" />Okuhweza kw'omu nju ye kuryaba omwirima,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 18:6">N'etabaaza emuri ahaiguru eryaraazibwa.<verse eid="JOB 18:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 18:7" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">18:7: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JOB 5:13">Yob 5:13</ref>. </char>
    </note> Entambwe ze endaingwa ziryahindurwa ngufu.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 18:7">N'enaama ze ziryamugwisa;<verse eid="JOB 18:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 18:8" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">18:8: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 9:15">Zab 9:15</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 140:5">140:5</ref>. </char>
    </note> Ahabw'okuba ebigyere bye nibyo birimunaga omu kigoye,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 18:8">Akagyendera aha busya.<verse eid="JOB 18:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 18:9" />Omuriiti guryamukwata ekitsintsino,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 18:9">N'omwiniko gumukwate, gumuhamye.<verse eid="JOB 18:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 18:10" />Aryategwa omurunga omu itaka,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 18:10">Omutego gumukwatire omu kahanda.<verse eid="JOB 18:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 18:11" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">18:11: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JOB 20:25">Yob 20:25</ref>; <ref loc="JER 6:25">Yer 6:25</ref>. </char>
    </note> Ebirikutiinisa biryamwitsa obwoba embaju zoona,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 18:11">Bimubingye bimuhambize.<verse eid="JOB 18:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 18:12" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">18:12: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 38:17">Zab 38:17</ref>. </char>
    </note> Amaani ge garyatuubibwa enjara;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 18:12">Ku ariza kuteera entsibo, aryashanga akagwe kamugwereire.<verse eid="JOB 18:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 18:13" />Omubiri gwe guryamirwa kwo;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 18:13">Eego, omujigaijo gwa rufu guryamira engingo ze.<verse eid="JOB 18:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 18:14" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">18:14: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="REV 9:11">Kush 9:11</ref>. </char>
    </note> Aryahuruuturwa omu ihema rye, eri yaabaire ayesiga,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 18:14">Atwarwe aha mukama w'ebirikutiinisa.<verse eid="JOB 18:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 18:15" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">18:15: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 11:6">Zab 11:6</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 38:22">Ezk 38:22</ref>. </char>
    </note> Abatari be baryatuura omu ihema rye;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 18:15">Obuganga buryabuga ahu atwire hoona,<verse eid="JOB 18:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 18:16" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">18:16: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JOB 14:2">Yob 14:2</ref>; <ref loc="HOS 9:16">Hos 9:16</ref>; <ref loc="MAL 4:1">Mal 4:1</ref>. </char>
    </note> Emizi ye eyomere okuzimu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 18:16">N'amataagi ge goomere eruguru.<verse eid="JOB 18:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 18:17" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">18:17: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JOB 30:8">Yob 30:8</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 34:16">Zab 34:16</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 109:13">109:13</ref>, <ref loc="PSA 109:15">15</ref>. </char>
    </note> Aryayebera kimwe omu nsi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 18:17">N'eiziina rye tiririgaruka kugambwa mu mihanda.<verse eid="JOB 18:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 18:18" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">18:18: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JOB 10:21">Yob 10:21</ref>, <ref loc="JOB 10:22">22</ref>. </char>
    </note> Aryabingwa, arugye omu mushana, aze omu mwirima,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 18:18">Kandi acwerwe kimwe omu nsi.<verse eid="JOB 18:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 18:19" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">18:19: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 14:22">Isa 14:22</ref>. </char>
    </note> Tarigira mwana nari mwijukuru omu baabo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 18:19">N'obu yaakuba emponoka y'okutsigara ahu yaabaire atwire.<verse eid="JOB 18:19" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 18:20" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">18:20: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JOB 21:6">Yob 21:6</ref>; <ref loc="JER 50:27">Yer 50:27</ref>; <ref loc="1SA 26:10">1 Sam 26:10</ref>. </char>
    </note> Abarimukurata baryatangaarira ekiro kye,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 18:20">Nk'oku abaamubandiize baagizire obwoba.<verse eid="JOB 18:20" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 18:21" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">18:21: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JDG 2:10">Bar 2:10</ref>; <ref loc="JER 9:3">Yer 9:3</ref>; <ref loc="2TH 1:8">2 Tes 1:8</ref>. </char>
    </note> Buzimazima obwo nibwo butaaho bw'abatahikiriire,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 18:21">Kandi ogwo nigwo mwanya gw'abatarikutiina Ruhanga.<verse eid="JOB 18:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 18" />
  <chapter number="19" style="c" sid="JOB 19" />
  <para style="s1">Okugarukamu kwa Yobu</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 19:1" />Bwanyima Yobu yaagarukamu ati:<verse eid="JOB 19:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 19:2" />Muryahitsya hi okuunyita kubi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 19:2">N'okumpendagura n'ebigambo?<verse eid="JOB 19:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 19:3" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">19:3: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="GEN 31:7">Kut 31:7</ref>. </char>
    </note> Ogu n'omurundi gwa ikumi nimunjuma.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 19:3">Tikirikubaitsa enshoni kunkora kubi?<verse eid="JOB 19:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 19:4" />Hoona, n'obu naakubaire nsiisire,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 19:4">Ekicumuro kyangye niinye kyakubaireho.<verse eid="JOB 19:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 19:5" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">19:5: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 35:26">Zab 35:26</ref>. </char>
    </note> Ku muraabe nimwenda kuunyehimbisizaho</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 19:5">N'okuunyomesereza ahabw'enaku zangye,<verse eid="JOB 19:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 19:6" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">19:6: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JOB 8:3">Yob 8:3</ref>; <ref loc="JOB 34:12">34:12</ref>; <ref loc="LAM 3:36">Tonz 3:36</ref>. </char>
    </note> Mumanye ngu Ruhanga niwe aitsire orubanja rwangye,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 19:6">akankubaakuba n'ekigoye kye.<verse eid="JOB 19:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 19:7" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">19:7: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="HAB 1:2">Hab 1:2</ref>. </char>
    </note> Reeba, nintaka nti: Baanyita! Kwonka timpairwe mikono;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 19:7">Niinyeta munonga, kwonka mbura ow'okuncwera orubanja rw'oburyo.<verse eid="JOB 19:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 19:8" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">19:8: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JOB 3:23">Yob 3:23</ref>; <ref loc="LAM 3:7">Tonz 3:7</ref>, <ref loc="LAM 3:9">9</ref>; <ref loc="HOS 2:6">Hos 2:6</ref>. </char>
    </note> Aitsire omuhanda gwangye, tiinyine burabo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 19:8">N'emihanda yangye yaagitamu omwirima.<verse eid="JOB 19:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 19:9" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">19:9: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 89:39">Zab 89:39</ref>; <ref loc="LAM 5:16">Tonz 5:16</ref>. </char>
    </note> Anjwire ekitiinisa kyangye,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 19:9">Yaanyiha ekirunga aha mutwe.<verse eid="JOB 19:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 19:10" />Ansheenyagwire embaju zoona, mpweireho,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 19:10">N'amatsiko gangye agarandwire nk'ekiti.<verse eid="JOB 19:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 19:11" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">19:11: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JOB 13:24">Yob 13:24</ref>. </char>
    </note> Angiriire ekiniga kingi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 19:11">Yanteekateekaho nk'omubisha we,<verse eid="JOB 19:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 19:12" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">19:12: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JOB 10:17">Yob 10:17</ref>; <ref loc="JOB 30:12">30:12</ref>. </char>
    </note> Engabo ze zihururiire hamwe,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 19:12">Zaarunda eby'okungotesa,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 19:12">Zaateera orusiisira okwehinguririza eihema ryangye.<verse eid="JOB 19:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 19:13" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">19:13: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 69:8">Zab 69:8</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 88:8">88:8</ref>. </char>
    </note> Antaanise na bagyenzi bangye,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 19:13">N'abamanyi bambeera kimwe abanyamahanga;<verse eid="JOB 19:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 19:14" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">19:14: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 38:11">Zab 38:11</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 55:13">55:13</ref>. </char>
    </note> Abaitu na banywani bangye bampemukireho,<verse eid="JOB 19:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 19:15" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">19:15: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="GEN 17:27">Kut 17:27</ref>. </char>
    </note> Abagyenyi b'omu nju yangye baanyebirwe,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 19:15">Abazaana bangye nibanteekateekaho nk'omunyaihanga,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 19:15">Mbahindukiire omwijaija.<verse eid="JOB 19:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 19:16" />Niinyeta omuheereza wangye, tarikuunyetaba,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 19:16">N'obu ndikumweshengyereza.<verse eid="JOB 19:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 19:17" />Ntamirwe omukazi wangye,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 19:17">N'abaana ba maawe nibannuga.<verse eid="JOB 19:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 19:18" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">19:18: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="2KI 2:23">2 Bag 2:23</ref>. </char>
    </note> Nangwa n'abaana bato nibangaya; Ku ndikwimuka, bangambuura.<verse eid="JOB 19:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 19:19" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">19:19: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 41:9">Zab 41:9</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 55:13">55:13</ref>. </char>
    </note> Banywani bangye boona ab'aha mara nibannyangira kimwe,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 19:19">N'abo abu mbaire ninkunda baanyehindukiriize.<verse eid="JOB 19:19" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 19:20" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">19:20: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 102:5">Zab 102:5</ref>; <ref loc="LAM 4:8">Tonz 4:8</ref>. </char>
    </note> Amagufa gangye garamataine n'oruhu n'enyama,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 19:20">Ntsigaize amaino gonka.<verse eid="JOB 19:20" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 19:21" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">19:21: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 53:4">Isa 53:4</ref>. </char>
    </note> Mungirire esaasi, imwe bagyenzi bangye; mungirire esaasi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 19:21">Ahabw'okuba omukono gwa Ruhanga gumpikireho.<verse eid="JOB 19:21" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 19:22" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">19:22: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 69:26">Zab 69:26</ref>. </char>
    </note> Nimumpiigira ki nka Ruhanga?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 19:22">Oku ndikushusha, tikurikubamara?<verse eid="JOB 19:22" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOB 19:23" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">19:23: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JOB 31:35">Yob 31:35</ref>. </char>
    </note> Nangwa kuri ebigambo byangye bihandiikirwe,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 19:23">Bikahandiikwa omu kitabo!<verse eid="JOB 19:23" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOB 19:24" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">19:24: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JER 17:1">Yer 17:1</ref>. </char>
    </note> Bikasharurwa aha rukiri n'akacumu k'ekyoma na rusasi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 19:24">Bikagumaho ebiro byona!<verse eid="JOB 19:24" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOB 19:25" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">19:25: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 19:14">Zab 19:14</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 103:4">103:4</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 43:14">Isa 43:14</ref>. </char>
    </note> Ahakuba nimmanya ku Omucunguzi wangye abaho,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 19:25">Kandi ku aryemera aha nsi aha muheru;<verse eid="JOB 19:25" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JOB 19:26" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">19:26: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 17:15">Zab 17:15</ref>; <ref loc="1CO 13:12">1 Kor 13:12</ref>; <ref loc="1JN 3:2">1 Yoh 3:2</ref>. </char>
    </note> Omubiri gwangye ku guriba gwamazirweho gutyo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 19:26">Bwanyima ndyareeba Ruhanga ntakigwine,<verse eid="JOB 19:26" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JOB 19:27" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">19:27: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 73:26">Zab 73:26</ref>. </char>
    </note> Ou ndyereebera nyenka,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 19:27">Eriisho ryangye, eritari ry'ondiijo, rikamwetegyereza.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 19:27">Na mbwenu omutima gwangye nigugwa enshazi.<verse eid="JOB 19:27" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JOB 19:28" />Ku muraabe nimugira ngu: Nitwija kumuhiiga,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 19:28">Kandi ngu, enaku ze niwe zaakomookireho,<verse eid="JOB 19:28" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JOB 19:29" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">19:29: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 58:11">Zab 58:11</ref>; <ref loc="ECC 12:14">Mub 12:14</ref>. </char>
    </note> Mwerinde rurara,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 19:29">Ahabw'okuba ekiniga kireeta ekifubiro kya rurara,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 19:29">Ngu mubone kuhamya ku hariho okucwa orubanja.<verse eid="JOB 19:29" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 19" />
  <chapter number="20" style="c" sid="JOB 20" />
  <para style="s1">Zofari okugarukamu Yobu obwa kabiri</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 20:1" />Bwanyima Zofari Omunaamasi yaagarukamu ati:<verse eid="JOB 20:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 20:2" />Mbwenu ebiteekateeko byangye nibingarukamu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 20:2">Ahabw'obwire obu nyine;<verse eid="JOB 20:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 20:3" />Nimpurira okuhana okurikunkwatsa enshoni;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 20:3">Kwonka oku ndikureeba, hariho omwoyo ogurikungarukamu.<verse eid="JOB 20:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 20:4" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">20:4: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="DEU 4:32">Bir 4:32</ref>. </char>
    </note> Torikumanya okuruga ira ryona,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 20:4">Omuntu yaaba kuteebwa aha nsi,<verse eid="JOB 20:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 20:5" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">20:5: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 37:35">Zab 37:35</ref>. </char>
    </note> Ngu okwesiima kw'ababi kuhwaho juba,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 20:5">N'okushemererwa kw'abatarikutiina Ruhanga kuba okw'akaanya kakye?<verse eid="JOB 20:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 20:6" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">20:6: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 14:13">Isa 14:13</ref>, <ref loc="ISA 14:14">14</ref>; <ref loc="OBA 1:3">Oba 3</ref>, <ref loc="OBA 1:4">4</ref>. </char>
    </note> N'obu yaakutunguuka, akahika ahaiguru munonga,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 20:6">Omutwe gwe gukaza omubicu,<verse eid="JOB 20:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 20:7" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">20:7: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JOB 14:10">Yob 14:10</ref>; <ref loc="1KI 14:10">1 Bag 14:10</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 83:10">Zab 83:10</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 90:5">90:5</ref>. </char>
    </note> Kwonka aryacwekyererera kimwe nk'eishaazi rye,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 20:7">Abaamureebire baryagira bati: Mbwenu shi arahi?<verse eid="JOB 20:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 20:8" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">20:8: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 73:20">Zab 73:20</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 90:5">90:5</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 29:7">Isa 29:7</ref>. </char>
    </note> Aryagaruka nk'ekirooto, tarireebwa;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 20:8">Ahiigwe nk'okworekwa kwa nyekiro.<verse eid="JOB 20:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 20:9" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">20:9: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JOB 7:8">Yob 7:8</ref>, <ref loc="JOB 7:10">10</ref>. </char>
    </note> Eriisho eryamureebire tiririgaruka kumureeba,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 20:9">N'omwanya gwe tigurimureeba bundi.<verse eid="JOB 20:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 20:10" />Abaana be baryayekundisa abooro,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 20:10">N'engaro ze ziryagarura eitungo rye;<verse eid="JOB 20:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 20:11" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">20:11: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JOB 21:26">Yob 21:26</ref>. </char>
    </note> Amagufa ge gaijwire amaani g'obutsigazi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 20:11">Kwonka aryaziikwa nago omu mucuucu.<verse eid="JOB 20:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 20:12" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">20:12: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 10:7">Zab 10:7</ref>. </char>
    </note> N'obu araabe naanurirwa obubi omu kanwa ke,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 20:12">Akaguma naabunuriiriza ahansi y'orurimi rwe,<verse eid="JOB 20:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 20:13" />Akanga kubureka,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 20:13">Kureka akaguma abuhunikire omu kanwa,<verse eid="JOB 20:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 20:14" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">20:14: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="DEU 32:33">Bir 32:33</ref>. </char>
    </note> Kwonka omunda ye eby'okurya bye biryahinduka,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 20:14">Bimubeere obushegu bw'encwera.<verse eid="JOB 20:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 20:15" />Amira obutungi, agaruka abutanaka,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 20:15">Ruhanga abwiha omunda ye.<verse eid="JOB 20:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 20:16" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">20:16: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PRO 23:32">Enf 23:32</ref>. </char>
    </note> Aryanyuunyuuta obushegu bw'encwera,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 20:16">Aitwe orurimi rw'empiri,<verse eid="JOB 20:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 20:17" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">20:17: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JOB 29:6">Yob 29:6</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 36:8">Zab 36:8</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 32:13">Bir 32:13</ref>, <ref loc="DEU 32:14">14</ref>. </char>
    </note> Tarireeba migyera,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 20:17">Nari otugyera otwijwire obwoki n'amakamo;<verse eid="JOB 20:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 20:18" />Ebi yaafeereire kubi aryabigarura, taribimira,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 20:18">amagoba g'obushuubuzi bwe tarigashemerererwa;<verse eid="JOB 20:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 20:19" />Ahabw'okuba akaita kubi abooro, yaabatsigaho;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 20:19">Yaanyaga enju, ei atarombekire.<verse eid="JOB 20:19" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 20:20" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">20:20: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PRO 17:1">Enf 17:1</ref>; <ref loc="ECC 5:13">Mub 5:13</ref>, <ref loc="ECC 5:14">14</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 59:8">Isa 59:8</ref>. </char>
    </note> Ahabw'okugira omururu ogutarikuhwa,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 20:20">Tarirokora kintu na kimwe aha bi akunda.<verse eid="JOB 20:20" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 20:21" />Ku yaariire, taine ki yatsigire;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 20:21">N'ahabw'ekyo okugogyera kwe tikurigumaho.<verse eid="JOB 20:21" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 20:22" />Omu bunaku obu ariba aijwize ebintu bingi ebirikumumara, aryakyena;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 20:22">Emikono y'abaine obujune boona eryamuteeraniraho.<verse eid="JOB 20:22" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOB 20:23" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">20:23: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="NUM 11:33">Kub 11:33</ref>. </char>
    </note> Ku ariba ari haihi kwigutsa enda ye,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 20:23">Ruhanga aryamushukaho ekiniga kye kingi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 20:23">Akimugwiseho nk'enjura naarya.<verse eid="JOB 20:23" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOB 20:24" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">20:24: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="2SA 22:35">2 Sam 22:35</ref>; <ref loc="AMO 5:19">Amo 5:19</ref>. </char>
    </note> Aryahunga eky'okurwanisa ky'ekyoma,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 20:24">Omwambi gw'omuringa gumucumite, gumwogyemu;<verse eid="JOB 20:24" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOB 20:25" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">20:25: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JOB 18:11">Yob 18:11</ref>. </char>
    </note> Agwekuure, gumurugyemu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 20:25">Omunwa gwagwo ogurikumurinkana gurugye omu ndurwe ye,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 20:25">Eby'okutiinisa bimuhikyeho.<verse eid="JOB 20:25" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JOB 20:26" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">20:26: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JOB 15:34">Yob 15:34</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 21:9">Zab 21:9</ref>. </char>
    </note> Obutungi bwe bubiikiirwe omwirima ndindindi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 20:26">Omurimo ogutaakibwa bantu guryamumaraho,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 20:26">Kandi ebitsigaire omu ihema rye ryona gubitookyeze.<verse eid="JOB 20:26" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JOB 20:27" />Eiguru riryashuuruura okutahikiirira kwe,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 20:27">N'ensi emwimukirire.<verse eid="JOB 20:27" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JOB 20:28" />Eby'omu nju ye biryanyagwa,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 20:28">Bitwarwe aha izooba ry'ekiniga kya Ruhanga.<verse eid="JOB 20:28" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JOB 20:29" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">20:29: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JOB 27:13">Yob 27:13</ref>; <ref loc="JOB 31:2">31:2</ref>, <ref loc="JOB 31:3">3</ref>. </char>
    </note> Ogwo nigwo mugabo gw'enkozi y'ebibi ogurikuruga ahari Ruhanga,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 20:29">N'obuhunguzi obu Ruhanga yaamuteereireho.<verse eid="JOB 20:29" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 20" />
  <chapter number="21" style="c" sid="JOB 21" />
  <para style="s1">Okugarukamu kwa Yobu</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 21:1" />Bwanyima Yobu yaagarukamu ati:<verse eid="JOB 21:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 21:2" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">21:2: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JOB 13:17">Yob 13:17</ref>. </char>
    </note> Nimuhuguukye, muhurire ebi ndikugamba,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 21:2">Haza obwo nimuba muunyaagiire.<verse eid="JOB 21:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 21:3" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">21:3: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JOB 16:10">Yob 16:10</ref>, <ref loc="JOB 16:20">20</ref>; <ref loc="JOB 17:2">17:2</ref>. </char>
    </note> Mungumisiririze, naanye ngambe;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 21:3">Ku ndaaheze, mugumizemu nimusheka.<verse eid="JOB 21:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 21:4" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">21:4: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JOB 10:1">Yob 10:1</ref>; <ref loc="JOB 23:2">23:2</ref>; <ref loc="EXO 6:9">Kur 6:9</ref>. </char>
    </note> Nimugira ngu niinyetomboitera omuntu?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 21:4">Mbwenu ekyakunzibira kugumisiriza niki?<verse eid="JOB 21:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 21:5" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">21:5: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JOB 29:9">Yob 29:9</ref>; <ref loc="JDG 18:19">Bar 18:19</ref>. </char>
    </note> Mundeebe, mushoberwe,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 21:5">Engaro muzite aha munwa.<verse eid="JOB 21:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 21:6" />Ku ndikwijuka oku ndi, ngira obwoba,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 21:6">Omubiri gwangye gutetema.<verse eid="JOB 21:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 21:7" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">21:7: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JOB 12:6">Yob 12:6</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 73:3">Zab 73:3</ref>; <ref loc="ECC 8:14">Mub 8:14</ref>; <ref loc="JER 12:1">Yer 12:1</ref>, <ref loc="JER 12:2">2</ref>; <ref loc="HAB 1:13">Hab 1:13</ref>, <ref loc="HAB 1:16">16</ref>; <ref loc="MAL 3:14">Mal 3:14</ref>, <ref loc="MAL 3:15">15</ref>. </char>
    </note> Ahabw'enki enkozi z'ebibi zigumaho, zikakura,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 21:7">Zikahika omu ngingo zaabukuru,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 21:7">Zikagira obushoboorozi bw'amaani?<verse eid="JOB 21:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 21:8" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">21:8: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JOB 5:25">Yob 5:25</ref>. </char>
    </note> Abaana baazo bahama zikiriho,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 21:8">N'oruzaaro rwazo rugumaho nizirureeba.<verse eid="JOB 21:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 21:9" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">21:9: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JOB 9:34">Yob 9:34</ref>. </char>
    </note> Amaka gaazo tigagira ki gatiina,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 21:9">N'enkoni ya Ruhanga tegahikaho.<verse eid="JOB 21:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 21:10" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">21:10: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EXO 23:26">Kur 23:26</ref>. </char>
    </note> Enimi yaabo eyemya, teremwa;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 21:10">Ente yaabo ezaara, tetorooga;<verse eid="JOB 21:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 21:11" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">21:11: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 17:14">Zab 17:14</ref>. </char>
    </note> Abaana baabo abato babaseetura nk'obusyo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 21:11">N'abandi baana baabo bagyenda nibatara.<verse eid="JOB 21:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 21:12" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">21:12: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JOB 30:31">Yob 30:31</ref>; <ref loc="EXO 15:20">Kur 15:20</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 5:12">Isa 5:12</ref>. </char>
    </note> Beeshongorera aha mataari n'endingiri.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 21:12">Bashemerererwa okugamba kw'emikuri.<verse eid="JOB 21:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 21:13" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">21:13: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JOB 24:19">Yob 24:19</ref>; <ref loc="JOB 34:20">34:20</ref>; <ref loc="JOB 36:11">36:11</ref>. </char>
    </note> Ebiro byabo babimara omu kugogyeera,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 21:13">Bashuuma okuzimu bagwirwe gye.<verse eid="JOB 21:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 21:14" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">21:14: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JOB 22:17">Yob 22:17</ref>. </char>
    </note> Bagira Ruhanga bati: Turugyeho!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 21:14">Titurikwenda kumanya muhanda yaawe.<verse eid="JOB 21:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 21:15" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">21:15: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JOB 34:9">Yob 34:9</ref>; <ref loc="EXO 5:2">Kur 5:2</ref>. </char>
    </note> Ow'obushoboorozi bwona nikyo ki, itwe kumuheereza?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 21:15">Kandi ku turikumushaba, nikitugasira ki?<verse eid="JOB 21:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 21:16" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">21:16: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JOB 22:18">Yob 22:18</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 1:1">Zab 1:1</ref>. </char>
    </note> Reeba, okugwa gye kwabo tikuri mu mikono yaabo;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 21:16">Enaama z'enkozi z'ebibi zindi hare.<verse eid="JOB 21:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 21:17" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">21:17: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JOB 18:5">Yob 18:5</ref>, <ref loc="JOB 18:6">6</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 1:4">Zab 1:4</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 83:13">83:13</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 17:13">Isa 17:13</ref>. </char>
    </note> Ni kangahi obu etabaaza y'ababi eraaziibwe,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 21:17">Bakaguubwaho akabi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 21:17">Ruhanga akabaha obusaasi abainiire ekiniga?<verse eid="JOB 21:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 21:18" />Kandi ni kangahi obu babaire nk'ebinyaatsi birikutwarwa omuyaga,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 21:18">Nari nk'ebishushunga ebirikutwarwa akasooroora?<verse eid="JOB 21:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 21:19" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">21:19: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EXO 20:5">Kur 20:5</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 25:14">Ezk 25:14</ref>; <ref loc="HOS 9:7">Hos 9:7</ref>. </char>
    </note> Imwe nimugira ngu Ruhanga abiikira abaana b'omusiisi ekifubiro ahabw'okutahikiirira kwe.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 21:19">Ka Ruhanga abe niwe yaahana, abone kumanya ekibi kye!<verse eid="JOB 21:19" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 21:20" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">21:20: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 75:8">Zab 75:8</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 51:17">Isa 51:17</ref>; <ref loc="JER 25:15">Yer 25:15</ref>; <ref loc="REV 14:10">Kush 14:10</ref>. </char>
    </note> Ka amaisho ge geereebere okucwekyerera kwe,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 21:20">Anywe ekiniga ky'Ow'obushoboorozi bwona!<verse eid="JOB 21:20" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 21:21" />Nimugira ngu, ebiriba aha b'enju ye abarimukurata aryaba naakibyetaho,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 21:21">Haza ebiro by'emyaka byacwirweho?<verse eid="JOB 21:21" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 21:22" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">21:22: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JOB 4:18">Yob 4:18</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 40:14">Isa 40:14</ref>; <ref loc="ROM 11:34">Rom 11:34</ref>; <ref loc="1CO 2:16">1 Kor 2:16</ref>. </char>
    </note> Hariho oryegyesa Ruhanga obwengye?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 21:22">Haza kunu niwe acwera ab'ekitiinisa emanja.<verse eid="JOB 21:22" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOB 21:23" />Omwe afa akiine amaani ge goona,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 21:23">Aine obusingye, agaramisiriize;<verse eid="JOB 21:23" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOB 21:24" />Omubiri gwe gugomokire, guriitiraine,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 21:24">N'omushokooro gw'omu magufa ge niguyagayaga.<verse eid="JOB 21:24" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOB 21:25" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">21:25: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JOB 7:11">Yob 7:11</ref>. </char>
    </note> Ondiijo afa n'obusaasi bw'aha mutima,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 21:25">Atakarozaga ha kirungi;<verse eid="JOB 21:25" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JOB 21:26" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">21:26: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JOB 20:11">Yob 20:11</ref>; <ref loc="ECC 9:2">Mub 9:2</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 14:11">Isa 14:11</ref>. </char>
    </note> Kwonka bombi babyama omu mucuucu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 21:26">Bashwekwa enyogori.<verse eid="JOB 21:26" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JOB 21:27" />Reeba, nimmanya ebi murikuteekateeka,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 21:27">N'enaama mbi ezi muunyiniire;<verse eid="JOB 21:27" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JOB 21:28" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">21:28: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JOB 8:22">Yob 8:22</ref>; <ref loc="JOB 20:6">20:6</ref>, <ref loc="JOB 20:7">7</ref>. </char>
    </note> Ahakuba nimugira muti: Enju y'omunyiginya erahi?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 21:28">Enju ei abasiisi baabaire batuuramu erahi?<verse eid="JOB 21:28" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JOB 21:29" />Beitu shi, timukabuuzaga abagyenzi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 21:29">Kandi timurikwikiriza ebi bahamya,<verse eid="JOB 21:29" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JOB 21:30" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">21:30: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PRO 16:4">Enf 16:4</ref>; <ref loc="2PE 2:9">2 Pet 2:9</ref>. </char>
    </note> Ku omusiisi ahonoka aha kiro ky'akabi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 21:30">Akajunwa aha kiro ky'okugirirwaho ekiniga?<verse eid="JOB 21:30" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JOB 21:31" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">21:31: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="DEU 7:10">Bir 7:10</ref>. </char>
    </note> N'oha owaakumugambira butunu omuhanda gwe?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 21:31">Kandi n'oha owaakumuzimuurira ebi yaakozire?<verse eid="JOB 21:31" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="JOB 21:32" />Ku aritwarwa kuziikwa omu kiina,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 21:32">Ekituuro kye kiryarindwa;<verse eid="JOB 21:32" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JOB 21:33" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">21:33: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JOB 30:23">Yob 30:23</ref>; <ref loc="HEB 9:27">Heb 9:27</ref>. </char>
    </note> Ebitsinde by'omu ruhanga biryamunurira,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 21:33">Abantu boona baryamukurata,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 21:33">Ahakuba abaamubandiize bakaba batarikubarwa.<verse eid="JOB 21:33" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="JOB 21:34" />Mbwenu imwe nimubaasa muta kungumya n'ebitaine muhoho?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 21:34">Ahakuba tihaine kindi ekitsigaire omu kugarukamu kwanyu kureka ebishuba.<verse eid="JOB 21:34" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 21" />
  <chapter number="22" style="c" sid="JOB 22" />
  <para style="s1">Elifaazi okugarukamu Yobu omurundi gwa kashatu</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 22:1" />Bwanyima Elifaazi Omutemaani yaagarukamu ati:<verse eid="JOB 22:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 22:2" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">22:2: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JOB 35:7">Yob 35:7</ref>. </char>
    </note> Omuntu aine eki yaakugasira Ruhanga?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 22:2">N'eky'amazima omunyabwengye obwengye bwe niwe bugasira.<verse eid="JOB 22:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 22:3" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">22:3: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 18:32">Zab 18:32</ref>. </char>
    </note> Noogira ngu iwe okuba ohikiriire, kiine eki kirikushemeza Ow'obushoboorozi bwona,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 22:3">Nari shi okushemeza emitwarize yaawe kiine eki kirikumwongyeraho?<verse eid="JOB 22:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 22:4" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">22:4: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JOB 14:3">Yob 14:3</ref>. </char>
    </note> Noogira ngu okumutiina kwawe nikwo kumureeteire kukuhana?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 22:4">Nikyo arikutonganira naiwe?<verse eid="JOB 22:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 22:5" />Ebibi byawe ti bingi?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 22:5">Eby'okutahikiirira byawe tibiine bugarukiro;<verse eid="JOB 22:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 22:6" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">22:6: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JOB 24:3">Yob 24:3</ref>, <ref loc="JOB 24:9">9</ref>; <ref loc="EXO 22:26">Kur 22:26</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 18:12">Ezk 18:12</ref>, <ref loc="EZK 18:16">16</ref>. </char>
    </note> Ahabw'okuba okaihira busha omukwato ahari beene waanyu;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 22:6">Otaine ki ajwaire, waamujuura akajwaro ke.<verse eid="JOB 22:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 22:7" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">22:7: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 58:7">Isa 58:7</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 25:42">Mat 25:42</ref>. </char>
    </note> Orikukooza okaba otamuha twizi tw'okunywa.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 22:7">N'oine enjara omwima eby'okurya.<verse eid="JOB 22:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 22:8" />Haza ow'obushoboorozi yaaba niwe yaatunga ensi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 22:8">Kandi ow'ekitiinisa yaagituuramu.<verse eid="JOB 22:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 22:9" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">22:9: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JOB 31:21">Yob 31:21</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 10:2">Isa 10:2</ref>. </char>
    </note> Abafaakazi okababinga emikono misha,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 22:9">N'emikono y'abataine baishebo yaahendagurwa.<verse eid="JOB 22:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 22:10" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">22:10: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JOB 18:8-11">Yob 18:8-11</ref>. </char>
    </note> Nikyo emitego ekwehinguriririze,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 22:10">Ebihikiirizi ebirikutiinisa bikakutuntuza;<verse eid="JOB 22:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 22:11" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">22:11: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JOB 27:20">Yob 27:20</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 69:1">Zab 69:1</ref>; <ref loc="LAM 3:54">Tonz 3:54</ref>; <ref loc="JON 2:3">Yon 2:3</ref>, <ref loc="JON 2:5">5</ref>. </char>
    </note> Okuhweza kwawe kuhindwirwe omwirima; nikyo otarikubaasiza kureeba,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 22:11">N'omwegyemure gw'amaizi gukushwekire.<verse eid="JOB 22:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 22:12" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">22:12: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JOB 11:8">Yob 11:8</ref>. </char>
    </note> Ruhanga tari omu iguru ahaiguru?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 22:12">Reeba, enyonyoozi z'ahaiguru munonga oku ziri hare omu rya nyakacu!<verse eid="JOB 22:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 22:13" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">22:13: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 59:7">Zab 59:7</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 73:11">73:11</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 29:15">Isa 29:15</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 8:12">Ezk 8:12</ref>. </char>
    </note> Haza ogira oti: Ruhanga naamanya ki?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 22:13">Naabasa kucwa orubanja, naayozya amaisho omu mwirima ndindindi?<verse eid="JOB 22:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 22:14" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">22:14: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 139:11">Zab 139:11</ref>, <ref loc="PSA 139:12">12</ref>. </char>
    </note> Oti: Ebicu ebikwaitse bimuturukire oku n'oku, byamuzibira kureeba,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 22:14">Kandi naagyendera aha iguru eriri ahaiguru y'ensi.<verse eid="JOB 22:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 22:15" />Nooyenda kugumizamu omu muhanda ogwa ira,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 22:15">Ogu abantu babi baatoiremu?<verse eid="JOB 22:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 22:16" />Bakabakurwa, baatwarwa obunaku bwabo butakahikire,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 22:16">Omusingi gwabo gwatwarwa amaizi.<verse eid="JOB 22:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 22:17" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">22:17: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JOB 21:14">Yob 21:14</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 4:6">Zab 4:6</ref>. </char>
    </note> Baagira Ruhanga bati: Turugyeho!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 22:17">Kandi bati: Ow'obushoboorozi bwona naabaasa kutugira ata?<verse eid="JOB 22:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 22:18" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">22:18: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JOB 21:16">Yob 21:16</ref>. </char>
    </note> N'obu baraabe baagizire batyo, Ruhanga akaijuza amaju gaabo ebirungi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 22:18">(Kwonka nyowe enaama z'ababi zindi hare!)<verse eid="JOB 22:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 22:19" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">22:19: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 2:4">Zab 2:4</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 52:6">52:6</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 58:10">58:10</ref>. </char>
    </note> Abahikiriire babireeba, beesiima;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 22:19">Abataine rubanja babashekyerera, babagaya,<verse eid="JOB 22:19" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 22:20" />Nibagira bati: Buzimazima ababisha baitu bacwekyereziibwe,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 22:20">Kandi n'ebi batsigireho omuriro gwabimaraho.<verse eid="JOB 22:20" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 22:21" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">22:21: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PRO 3:2">Enf 3:2</ref>. </char>
    </note> Garukana na Ruhanga, obone kugira obusingye;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 22:21">Obwo nibwo ebirungi biriija ahariiwe.<verse eid="JOB 22:21" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 22:22" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">22:22: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 119:11">Zab 119:11</ref>; <ref loc="PRO 2:6">Enf 2:6</ref>. </char>
    </note> Ikiriza okuhabura okurikuruga omu kanwa ke,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 22:22">N'ebigambo bye obigumye aha mutima.<verse eid="JOB 22:22" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOB 22:23" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">22:23: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JOB 8:5">Yob 8:5</ref>, <ref loc="JOB 8:6">6</ref>; <ref loc="JOB 11:13">11:13</ref>, <ref loc="JOB 11:14">14</ref>; <ref loc="JER 24:6">Yer 24:6</ref>; <ref loc="MAL 3:7">Mal 3:7</ref>. </char>
    </note> Ku oraagarukire Ow'obushoboorozi bwona, waayecureeza,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 22:23">Waata okutahikiirira hare n'amahema gaawe;<verse eid="JOB 22:23" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOB 22:24" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">22:24: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="1KI 9:28">1 Bag 9:28</ref>. </char>
    </note> Kandi ku oraate eitungo ryawe omu mucuucu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 22:24">N'ezaabu ya Ofiri waagita omu mabaare g'omu kagyera,<verse eid="JOB 22:24" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOB 22:25" />N'Ow'obushoboorozi bwona yaaba eitungo ryawe,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 22:25">Yaakubeera efeeza y'obuguzi bwingi,<verse eid="JOB 22:25" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JOB 22:26" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">22:26: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JOB 11:15">Yob 11:15</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 37:4">Zab 37:4</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 58:14">Isa 58:14</ref>. </char>
    </note> Obwo nibwo orishemerererwa omu W'obushoboorozi bwona,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 22:26">Okaimutsya amaisho gaawe ahari Ruhanga.<verse eid="JOB 22:26" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JOB 22:27" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">22:27: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JOB 33:26">Yob 33:26</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 50:14">Zab 50:14</ref>, <ref loc="PSA 50:15">15</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 58:9">Isa 58:9</ref>. </char>
    </note> Oryamushaba, akuhurire,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 22:27">Kandi ohikiirize ebi waahigire nooraganisa;<verse eid="JOB 22:27" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JOB 22:28" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">22:28: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PRO 4:18">Enf 4:18</ref>. </char>
    </note> Oryagira eki waihamu kukora, kibe nk'oku orikwenda,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 22:28">N'omushana guryajwera emihanda yaawe.<verse eid="JOB 22:28" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JOB 22:29" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">22:29: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 138:6">Zab 138:6</ref>; <ref loc="PRO 3:34">Enf 3:34</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 23:12">Mat 23:12</ref>; <ref loc="JAS 4:6">Yak 4:6</ref>; <ref loc="1PE 5:5">1 Pet 5:5</ref>. </char>
    </note> Abantu ku barikugwisa, oryagira oti: Hariho orikuunyimutsya,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 22:29">Kandi omucureezi Ruhanga aryamujuna.<verse eid="JOB 22:29" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JOB 22:30" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">22:30: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="GEN 18:26">Kut 18:26</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 18:20">Zab 18:20</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 24:4">24:4</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 26:6">26:6</ref>. </char>
    </note> Aryajuna otaine rubanja,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 22:30">Kandi oryajunwa ahabw'okushemera kw'engaro zaawe.<verse eid="JOB 22:30" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 22" />
  <chapter number="23" style="c" sid="JOB 23" />
  <para style="s1">Okugarukamu kwa Yobu</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 23:1" />Bwanyima Yobu yaagarukamu ati:<verse eid="JOB 23:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 23:2" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">23:2: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JOB 10:1">Yob 10:1</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 32:4">Zab 32:4</ref>. </char>
    </note> Na hati amaganya gangye n'obugomi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 23:2">Okuteerwa kwangye nikuremeera okukira okutsinda kwangye,<verse eid="JOB 23:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 23:3" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">23:3: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 9:7">Zab 9:7</ref>, <ref loc="PSA 9:8">8</ref>. </char>
    </note> Nangwa ku naakumanya ahu naakumushanga,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 23:3">Nkahika aha kitebe kye!<verse eid="JOB 23:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 23:4" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">23:4: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JOB 13:3">Yob 13:3</ref>; <ref loc="JOB 33:5">33:5</ref>. </char>
    </note> Nkaata orubanja rwangye omu maisho ge,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 23:4">Nyijuza akanwa kangye eby'okwetonganira.<verse eid="JOB 23:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 23:5" />Obwo mmanya eki arangarukyemu</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 23:5">Nshoborokyerwa eki arangambire;<verse eid="JOB 23:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 23:6" />Akaantonganiise nk'omukuru ow'obushoboorozi bwingi?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 23:6">Ngaaha! Kureka akaanyetaireho.<verse eid="JOB 23:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 23:7" />Okwo niyo oine omutima ogugororokire yaakutonganira nawe;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 23:7">Orikuncwera orubanja akarucwa, nkarusingira kimwe.<verse eid="JOB 23:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 23:8" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">23:8: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JOB 9:11">Yob 9:11</ref>; <ref loc="JOB 35:14">35:14</ref>. </char>
    </note> Reeba, ku ndikuza omu maisho, nshanga atariyo;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 23:8">Nkigaruka enyima, amburira;<verse eid="JOB 23:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 23:9" />Nkitoora aha rubaju rwa bumosho ndemwa kumureeba;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 23:9">Nkihindukira aha rwa buryo, nabwo ndemwa kumubona.<verse eid="JOB 23:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 23:10" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">23:10: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 66:10">Zab 66:10</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 139:1-3">139:1-3</ref>, <ref loc="PSA 139:24">24</ref>; <ref loc="ZEC 13:9">Zek 13:9</ref>; <ref loc="1PE 1:7">1 Pet 1:7</ref>. </char>
    </note> Kwonka We naamanya omuhanda ogu ndikutoora;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 23:10">Ku ariheza kungyeza, ndyarugamu ninshusha ezaabu.<verse eid="JOB 23:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 23:11" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">23:11: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 17:5">Zab 17:5</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 44:18">44:18</ref>. </char>
    </note> Ekigyere kyangye kihamiire omu kirari kye,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 23:11">Omuhanda gwe ngugumiremu, tinaaguteishuka.<verse eid="JOB 23:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 23:12" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">23:12: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 119:11">Zab 119:11</ref>, <ref loc="PSA 119:103">103</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 4:32">Yoh 4:32</ref>, <ref loc="JHN 4:34">34</ref>. </char>
    </note> Tindagarukire nyima kuruga omu biragiro ebi yaaragiire,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 23:12">N'ebigambo by'omu kanwa ke mbikunzire okukira eby'okurya ebi ncumiirwe.<verse eid="JOB 23:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 23:13" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">23:13: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JOB 9:12">Yob 9:12</ref>; <ref loc="JOB 12:14">12:14</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 115:3">Zab 115:3</ref>. </char>
    </note> Kwonka We tahinduka. Owaakumuhindura n'oha?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 23:13">Eki ayenda, nikyo akora.<verse eid="JOB 23:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 23:14" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">23:14: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JOB 10:13">Yob 10:13</ref>; <ref loc="1TH 3:3">1 Tes 3:3</ref>. </char>
    </note> Mbwenu naija kuhikiiriza eki anteekateekyeire,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 23:14">Kandi ebigambo bingi nk'ebyo abiine aha mutima.<verse eid="JOB 23:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 23:15" />Nikyo nyiniire obwoba omu maisho ge;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 23:15">Ku ndikuteekateeka, mmutiina.<verse eid="JOB 23:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 23:16" />Ruhanga agwisize omutima gwangye enshazi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 23:16">Ow'obushoboorozi bwona antuntwize,<verse eid="JOB 23:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 23:17" />Ahabw'okuba nyehinguririziibwe omwirima,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 23:17">Kandi omwirima ndindindi gwanshwenka aha maisho.<verse eid="JOB 23:17" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 23" />
  <chapter number="24" style="c" sid="JOB 24" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 24:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">24:1: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ECC 9:12">Mub 9:12</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 2:12">Isa 2:12</ref>; <ref loc="JOL 1:15">Yoel 1:15</ref>; <ref loc="JOL 2:1">2:1</ref>; <ref loc="AMO 5:18">Amo 5:18</ref>. </char>
    </note> Ahabw'enki Ow'obushoboorozi bwona tataho bunaku bw'okucweraho emanja?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 24:1">Kandi ahabw'enki abarikumumanya batabureeba?<verse eid="JOB 24:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 24:2" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">24:2: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="DEU 19:14">Bir 19:14</ref>. </char>
    </note> Hariho abakuura ebiti by'emyatano,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 24:2">Bakanyagisa amaani amasyo, bakagariisa;<verse eid="JOB 24:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 24:3" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">24:3: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JOB 22:6">Yob 22:6</ref>. </char>
    </note> Bakafunya endogoya y'abataine baishebo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 24:3">N'ente y'omufaakazi bakagikwatiriza;<verse eid="JOB 24:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 24:4" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">24:4: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PRO 28:28">Enf 28:28</ref>; <ref loc="AMO 5:12">Amo 5:12</ref>; <ref loc="ZEP 2:3">Zef 2:3</ref>. </char>
    </note> Bakabinga abakyene omu muhanda,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 24:4">N'abooro b'omu nsi boona bakeeshereka.<verse eid="JOB 24:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 24:5" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">24:5: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 104:21">Zab 104:21</ref>, <ref loc="PSA 104:23">23</ref>. </char>
    </note> Reeba, ni nk'enturegye z'omu ihamba, bashohora, baza aha murimo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 24:5">Nibasherura omu ihamba eky'okwita, kuba eby'okurya by'abaana baabo;<verse eid="JOB 24:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 24:6" />Batema obunyaatsi oburiibwa enyamaishwa omu ishwa.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 24:6">Bahumba omu musiri gw'emizaabibu y'omusiisi;<verse eid="JOB 24:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 24:7" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">24:7: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EXO 22:26">Kur 22:26</ref>, <ref loc="EXO 22:27">27</ref>. </char>
    </note> Baraara batajwaire burugaho busheesha,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 24:7">Tibagira ky'okwefubika omu mbeho;<verse eid="JOB 24:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 24:8" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">24:8: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="LAM 4:5">Tonz 4:5</ref>. </char>
    </note> Bajubibwa enjura y'omu bibungo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 24:8">Beekinga omu mabaare babuzire obwegamo.<verse eid="JOB 24:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 24:9" />Hariho abashahura abataine baishebo, bakabaiha aha mabeere,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 24:9">Bakakwatiriza omwereere w'omukyene;<verse eid="JOB 24:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 24:10" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">24:10: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JAS 5:4">Yak 5:4</ref>. </char>
    </note> Bagyendagyenda bataine ki bajwaire,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 24:10">Beekorera ebiba baine enjara;<verse eid="JOB 24:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 24:11" />Banyuukira majuta g'emizeituuni omu misiri y'ababi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 24:11">Banyuukira omu manyuukiro gaabo ga viinyo baine eiriho.<verse eid="JOB 24:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 24:12" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">24:12: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JER 51:52">Yer 51:52</ref>. </char>
    </note> Omu rurembo abarikuga batsinda,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 24:12">Nibataka ngu baheebwe emikono,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 24:12">Kwonka Ruhanga tayeta ha kutaka kwabo.<verse eid="JOB 24:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 24:13" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">24:13: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JHN 3:19">Yoh 3:19</ref>, <ref loc="JHN 3:20">20</ref>. </char>
    </note> Abo n'ab'omuri abo abagomera omushana,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 24:13">Tibamanya mihanda yaagwo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 24:13">N'obu kwakuba okuguma omu tuhanda twagwo.<verse eid="JOB 24:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 24:14" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">24:14: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 10:8">Zab 10:8</ref>. </char>
    </note> Omwitsi aimuka omu kairima kwita omworo n'omukyene,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 24:14">Kandi nyekiro aba nk'omushuma.<verse eid="JOB 24:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 24:15" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">24:15: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PRO 7:9">Enf 7:9</ref>. </char>
    </note> Eriisho ry'enshambani ritegyereza orwita-waabo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 24:15">Neegira eti, tihaine orandeebe;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 24:15">Ayetwekyerera ahamaisho.<verse eid="JOB 24:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 24:16" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">24:16: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EXO 22:2">Kur 22:2</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 6:20">Mat 6:20</ref>. </char>
    </note> Omu mwirima barimiirira amaju,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 24:16">Nyomushana beekingirana, tibamanya kashana.<verse eid="JOB 24:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 24:17" />Ahabw'okuba aharibo omwirima ndindindi ni nk'akasheeshe,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 24:17">Kandi ebitiinisa abantu omu mwirima ndindindi bo bakabimanyiira.<verse eid="JOB 24:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 24:18" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">24:18: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JOB 9:26">Yob 9:26</ref>; <ref loc="HOS 10:7">Hos 10:7</ref>. </char>
    </note> Imwe nimugira ngu, Batwarwa juba omwegyemure gw'amaizi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 24:18">Omugabo gwabo omu nsi n'omukyeeno,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 24:18">Tihariho munyuuki wa viinyo oza omu misiri yaabo y'emizaabibu.<verse eid="JOB 24:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 24:19" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">24:19: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JOB 21:13">Yob 21:13</ref>. </char>
    </note> Ekyanda n'omushana bimaraho amaizi g'ebirika,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 24:19">Kandi n'Okuzimu nikwo egira abasiisire.<verse eid="JOB 24:19" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 24:20" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">24:20: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JOB 18:16">Yob 18:16</ref>; <ref loc="PRO 10:7">Enf 10:7</ref>. </char>
    </note> Enda eyaamuzire eryamwebwa,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 24:20">Enyogori zimurye nizimunuriiriza,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 24:20">Tarigaruka kwijukwa bundi;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 24:20">Okutahikiirira kwona kuryahendagurwa nk'ekiti.<verse eid="JOB 24:20" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 24:21" />Barya eby'engumba ezitakazaaraga,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 24:21">Tibagira ki bagasira abafaakazi.<verse eid="JOB 24:21" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 24:22" />N'obu kiraabe kiri kityo, abo bantu b'amaani Ruhanga abagumyaho n'amaani ge;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 24:22">Ku baba beehweire amatsiko, abaimutsya;<verse eid="JOB 24:22" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOB 24:23" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">24:23: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 11:4">Zab 11:4</ref>; <ref loc="PRO 15:3">Enf 15:3</ref>. </char>
    </note> Abarinda baguma bari buhooro, bagira obwegamo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 24:23">amaisho ge tigaruga ha mihanda yaabo.<verse eid="JOB 24:23" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOB 24:24" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">24:24: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JOB 14:2">Yob 14:2</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 37:10">Zab 37:10</ref>. </char>
    </note> Batunguurwa; ku hahwaho akaanya kakye, bahwaho;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 24:24">Bagarurwa ahansi, baihwa omu muhanda nk'abandi boona,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 24:24">Bagyeshwa nk'obushiisha bw'engano.<verse eid="JOB 24:24" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOB 24:25" />Ku biraabe bitari kwo, n'oha oraanyomesereze ekishuba,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 24:25">akahamya ku ebi ndikugamba bitaine ku biri?<verse eid="JOB 24:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 24" />
  <chapter number="25" style="c" sid="JOB 25" />
  <para style="s1">Biludaadi okugarukamu Yobu obwa kashatu</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 25:1" />Bwanyima Biludaadi Omushuuhi yaagarukamu ati:<verse eid="JOB 25:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 25:2" />Obutegyeki n'ekitiinisa biinwe Ruhanga,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 25:2">Kandi areeta obusingye omu myanya ye ey'omu iguru.<verse eid="JOB 25:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 25:3" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">25:3: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JOB 19:12">Yob 19:12</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 103:21">Zab 103:21</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 5:45">Mat 5:45</ref>; <ref loc="JAS 1:17">Yak 1:17</ref>. </char>
    </note> Amahe ge nigabaasa kubarwa?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 25:3">N'oha otajwerwa mushana gwe?<verse eid="JOB 25:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 25:4" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">25:4: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JOB 4:17">Yob 4:17</ref>; <ref loc="JOB 14:4">14:4</ref>; <ref loc="JOB 15:14">15:14</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 143:2">Zab 143:2</ref>. </char>
    </note> Omuntu naabaasa ata kuba ohikiriire omu maisho ga Ruhanga?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 25:4">Owaazairwe omukazi naabaasa ata kuba oshemeire?<verse eid="JOB 25:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 25:5" />Reeba, n'okwezi tikurikumurinkana,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 25:5">N'enyonyoozi tizishemeire mu maisho ge;<verse eid="JOB 25:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 25:6" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">25:6: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 22:6">Zab 22:6</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 41:14">Isa 41:14</ref>. </char>
    </note> Reero kaashwa omuntu enyogori,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 25:6">N'omwana w'omuntu omunyongororwa!<verse eid="JOB 25:6" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 25" />
  <chapter number="26" style="c" sid="JOB 26" />
  <para style="s1">Okugarukamu kwa Yobu</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 26:1" />Bwanyima Yobu yaagarukamu ati:<verse eid="JOB 26:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 26:2" />Eshi waamanya kuhwera otaine bushoboorozi!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 26:2">Omukono ogutaine maani waamanya kugujuna!<verse eid="JOB 26:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 26:3" />Otaine bwengye waamanya kumuhabura,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 26:3">Kandi waagamba ebigambo bingi ebirimu okumanya okuhikire!<verse eid="JOB 26:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 26:4" />Owaakugambisa ebyo bigambo n'oha?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 26:4">Kandi omwoyo ogwakugambisa n'ogw'oha?<verse eid="JOB 26:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 26:5" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">26:5: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 88:10">Zab 88:10</ref>. </char>
    </note> Abaafiire nibatetemera ahansi y'amaizi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 26:5">Hamwe n'ebituurayo.<verse eid="JOB 26:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 26:6" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">26:6: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JOB 28:22">Yob 28:22</ref>; <ref loc="JOB 31:12">31:12</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 139:8">Zab 139:8</ref>; <ref loc="PRO 15:11">Enf 15:11</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 14:9">Isa 14:9</ref>; <ref loc="REV 9:11">Kush 9:11</ref>. </char>
    </note> Okuzimu eri omu maisho ga Ruhanga ejwaire busha,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 26:6">kandi n'owa nyamuteza taine ky'okweshweka.<verse eid="JOB 26:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 26:7" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">26:7: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JOB 9:8">Yob 9:8</ref>; <ref loc="GEN 1:2">Kut 1:2</ref>. </char>
    </note> Akabamba obukiizi-bwa-bumosho omu mwanya kwonka,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 26:7">N'ensi yaagihanika ahari busha.<verse eid="JOB 26:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 26:8" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">26:8: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PRO 30:4">Enf 30:4</ref>. </char>
    </note> Yaakoma amaizi omu bicu bikwataine,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 26:8">Ebiro tibyataaguka.<verse eid="JOB 26:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 26:9" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">26:9: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JOB 36:29">Yob 36:29</ref>. </char>
    </note> Ekitebe kye atuura akikingiire,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 26:9">Akishwekire ekicu kye.<verse eid="JOB 26:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 26:10" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">26:10: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JOB 38:8-11">Yob 38:8-11</ref>; <ref loc="PRO 8:29">Enf 8:29</ref>; <ref loc="JER 5:22">Yer 5:22</ref>. </char>
    </note> Amaizi akagateeraho obugarukiro,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 26:10">Ahu omushana n'omwirima byatanira.<verse eid="JOB 26:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 26:11" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">26:11: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JOB 9:6">Yob 9:6</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 75:3">Zab 75:3</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 104:7">104:7</ref>. </char>
    </note> Enyomyo z'eiguru zitetema,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 26:11">Zitangaarira okuhana kwe.<verse eid="JOB 26:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 26:12" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">26:12: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JOB 9:13">Yob 9:13</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 51:15">Isa 51:15</ref>; <ref loc="JER 31:35">Yer 31:35</ref>. </char>
    </note> Ahabw'obushoboorozi bwe acureeza enyanja,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 26:12">N'ahabw'obwengye bwe akacumita <note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">26:12 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Rahabu amakuru, Omugoye ogutuura omu nyanja. </char></note>Rahabu.<verse eid="JOB 26:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 26:13" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">26:13: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 27:1">Isa 27:1</ref>. </char>
    </note> Omwitsyo gwe gureetera eiguru entsya nungi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 26:13">N'omukono gwe agucumitisa ekijoka ekirikuhunga.<verse eid="JOB 26:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 26:14" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">26:14: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JOB 4:12">Yob 4:12</ref>; <ref loc="JOB 40:19">40:19</ref>. </char>
    </note> Reeba, ebyo nibyo, kwonka n'otw'aha rubaju omu mitwarize ye,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 26:14">Kandi n'ebi tumuhuriraho ni bikye munonga nk'okugambirana omu kutu;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 26:14">Kwonka okuhinda kw'obushoboorozi bwe n'oha orikubaasa kukwetegyereza?<verse eid="JOB 26:14" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 26" />
  <chapter number="27" style="c" sid="JOB 27" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 27:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">27:1: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="NUM 23:7">Kub 23:7</ref>. </char>
    </note> Bwanyima Yobu yaagumizamu naacwa enfumu ze naagira ati:<verse eid="JOB 27:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 27:2" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">27:2: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JOB 34:5">Yob 34:5</ref>; <ref loc="2KI 4:27">2 Bag 4:27</ref>; <ref loc="RUT 1:20">Rus 1:20</ref>. </char>
    </note> Nindahira Ruhanga otahwaho, ogwo onyimire ebyabaire binshemereire,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 27:2">Ow'obushoboorozi bwona otuntwize amagara gangye,<verse eid="JOB 27:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 27:3" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">27:3: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JOB 33:4">Yob 33:4</ref>; <ref loc="GEN 2:7">Kut 2:7</ref>. </char>
    </note> Nk'oku nkiri ohuriire,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 27:3">N'omwoyo gwa Ruhanga oku gukirikumpa okwitsya,<verse eid="JOB 27:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 27:4" />Eminwa yangye teribeiha,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 27:4">N'orurimi rwangye tiruriryarya.<verse eid="JOB 27:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 27:5" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">27:5: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JOB 2:3">Yob 2:3</ref>, <ref loc="JOB 2:9">9</ref>; <ref loc="JOB 13:15">13:15</ref>. </char>
    </note> Nikikabure nyowe okugira nti: Muhikire.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 27:5">Okuhitsya obu ndifa, tindireka kuguma ndi omwesigwa;<verse eid="JOB 27:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 27:6" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">27:6: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ACT 23:1">Byak 23:1</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 24:16">24:16</ref>; <ref loc="1CO 4:4">1 Kor 4:4</ref>. </char>
    </note> Okuhikiirira kwangye nkuhamiireho, tindikwija kukurekura;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 27:6">Ahi naahika, omutima gwangye tigwine ki gurikunshinja omu bi ndakozire.<verse eid="JOB 27:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 27:7" />Omuzigu wangye abe nk'ababi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 27:7">N'orikuunyimukiirira abe nk'abatahikiriire.<verse eid="JOB 27:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 27:8" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">27:8: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JOB 8:13">Yob 8:13</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 16:26">Mat 16:26</ref>. </char>
    </note> Mbwenu amatsiko g'otarikutiina Ruhanga garahi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 27:8">Ruhanga ku araabe ari ow'okumucwekyereza, akaihaho amagara ge?<verse eid="JOB 27:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 27:9" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">27:9: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 18:41">Zab 18:41</ref>; <ref loc="PRO 1:28">Enf 1:28</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 1:15">Isa 1:15</ref>; <ref loc="JER 11:11">Yer 11:11</ref>; <ref loc="JER 14:12">14:12</ref>. </char>
    </note> Enaku ku zirimuteera,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 27:9">Ruhanga aryahurira okutaka kwe?<verse eid="JOB 27:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 27:10" />Aryashemerererwa omu W'obushoboorozi bwona,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 27:10">Agume naatakira Ruhanga ebiro byona?<verse eid="JOB 27:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 27:11" />Niinyija kubeegyesa aha by'omukono gwa Ruhanga,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 27:11">Tindikwija kubashereka by'Ow'obushoboorozi bwona.<verse eid="JOB 27:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 27:12" />Reeba, mwena mukabyereebeera;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 27:12">Mbwenu shi, ahabw'enki mwena mubeereire kimwe abataine mugasho?<verse eid="JOB 27:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 27:13" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">27:13: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JOB 15:20">Yob 15:20</ref>; <ref loc="JOB 20:29">20:29</ref>. </char>
    </note> Ogu nigwo mugabo ogu omubi aine ahari Ruhanga;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 27:13">Obu nibwo buhunguzi obu abarikuhata baheebwa Ow'obushoboorozi bwona.<verse eid="JOB 27:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 27:14" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">27:14: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="DEU 28:41">Bir 28:41</ref>; <ref loc="HOS 9:12">Hos 9:12</ref>. </char>
    </note> Abaana be ku barikanya, baryakanyira rurara,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 27:14">Kandi oruzaaro rwe tiruritunga by'okurya eby'okuruhaazya.<verse eid="JOB 27:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 27:15" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">27:15: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 78:64">Zab 78:64</ref>. </char>
    </note> Abarihonokaho, rufu eryabamira,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 27:15">N'abafaakazi be tibaribacurira.<verse eid="JOB 27:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 27:16" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">27:16: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ZEC 9:3">Zek 9:3</ref>. </char>
    </note> N'obu arirunda efeeza nk'omucuucu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 27:16">Akeegirira ebijwaro ebirikwingana eitaka,<verse eid="JOB 27:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 27:17" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">27:17: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PRO 13:22">Enf 13:22</ref>; <ref loc="ECC 2:26">Mub 2:26</ref>. </char>
    </note> Abirunde, kwonka abahikiriire nibo baribijwara,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 27:17">N'efeeza ze ziryabaganwa abataine rubanja.<verse eid="JOB 27:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 27:18" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">27:18: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JOB 8:14">Yob 8:14</ref>, <ref loc="JOB 8:15">15</ref>; <ref loc="SNG 1:6">Kyesh 1:6</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 1:8">Isa 1:8</ref>. </char>
    </note> Enju ei arikwombeka ni nk'orububi rw'orutangura,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 27:18">Nk'akaju akasharabagwa omurinzi.<verse eid="JOB 27:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 27:19" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">27:19: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JOB 24:24">Yob 24:24</ref>; <ref loc="JER 8:2">Yer 8:2</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 29:5">Ezk 29:5</ref>. </char>
    </note> Aza kubyama ari omutungi, kwonka tariba atyo obundi;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 27:19">Ku aza kubuuruura ati amaisho, ashanga obutungi bwe bwagyenzire.<verse eid="JOB 27:19" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 27:20" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">27:20: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JOB 18:11">Yob 18:11</ref>; <ref loc="JOB 22:11">22:11</ref>; <ref loc="JOB 34:20">34:20</ref>. </char>
    </note> Ebirikutiinisa bimweshukaho nk'omwegyemure,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 27:20">Akasooroora kamutwara nyekiro;<verse eid="JOB 27:20" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 27:21" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">27:21: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JOB 30:22">Yob 30:22</ref>. </char>
    </note> Omuyaga gw'oburugwa-izooba gumutuntumura, agyenderayo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 27:21">Gumwihira kimwe ahu yaaba ari.<verse eid="JOB 27:21" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 27:22" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">27:22: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JOB 16:13">Yob 16:13</ref>. </char>
    </note> Ruhanga amuteera atarikumusaasira,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 27:22">N'obu yaakwenda kumwoga omu mikono kuhunga.<verse eid="JOB 27:22" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOB 27:23" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">27:23: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="2CH 29:8">2 Bus 29:8</ref>; <ref loc="LAM 2:15">Tonz 2:15</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 25:6">Ezk 25:6</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 27:36">27:36</ref>; <ref loc="ZEP 2:15">Zef 2:15</ref>. </char>
    </note> Abantu baryamubinga nibamwemaamaatira,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 27:23">Nibeeshaanya ngu arugye omu ka ye.<verse eid="JOB 27:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 27" />
  <chapter number="28" style="c" sid="JOB 28" />
  <para style="s1">Yobu okugamba aha bwengye obw'amazima, ku nikwo kutiina Ruhanga</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 28:1" />Buzimazima efeeza egira ekiina eki etimbwamu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 28:1">N'ezaabu ei bashemeza egira omwanya gwayo;<verse eid="JOB 28:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 28:2" />Ekyoma kiihwa omu itaka,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 28:2">N'omuringa guyagibwa omu butare.<verse eid="JOB 28:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 28:3" />Abantu tibeeta ha mwirima,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 28:3">Bagwogamu, bahika aha muheru gwagwo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 28:3">Nibasherura obutare omu mwirima gw'ekibunda kya rufu.<verse eid="JOB 28:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 28:4" />Batimba ebiina hare n'ahu abantu batwire;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 28:4">Beebwa abagyenzi, barereetera hare n'abantu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 28:4">Beecunda nibakora oku n'oku.<verse eid="JOB 28:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 28:5" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">28:5: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 104:14">Zab 104:14</ref>. </char>
    </note> Eitaka ryo rirugwamu eby'okurya,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 28:5">Kwonka okuzimu oshusha oti eitaka ryayo niritabuurwa omuriro.<verse eid="JOB 28:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 28:6" />Amabaare gaayo garugwamu safiro,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 28:6">Kandi egira ezaabu y'omucuucu.<verse eid="JOB 28:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 28:7" />Ogwo muhanda tigumanywa mpungu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 28:7">N'eriisho ry'eishamba tirikagureebaga;<verse eid="JOB 28:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 28:8" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">28:8: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JOB 41:34">Yob 41:34</ref>. </char>
    </note> Enyamaishwa z'amaryo tizikaguribatamuga,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 28:8">N'entare enshaarizi tekagurabamuga.<verse eid="JOB 28:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 28:9" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">28:9: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="DEU 8:15">Bir 8:15</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 32:13">32:13</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 114:8">Zab 114:8</ref>. </char>
    </note> Omuntu akununkirira eibaare ry'enkangabuye,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 28:9">Arimiirira emizi y'enshozi, azijuumika;<verse eid="JOB 28:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 28:10" />Acwa emikura omu nkiri,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 28:10">Kandi eriisho rye rireeba ekintu kyona eky'obuguzi bwingi;<verse eid="JOB 28:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 28:11" />Aigarira amaizi ngu garekye kujwa,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 28:11">Kandi ekituura kisherekirwe, akiihayo kireebwa.<verse eid="JOB 28:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 28:12" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">28:12: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ECC 7:24">Mub 7:24</ref>. </char>
    </note> Mbwenu obwengye bukaazoorwa hi?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 28:12">Nari shi okwetegyereza kukaaboneka hi?<verse eid="JOB 28:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 28:13" />Tihariho orikumanya omuhanda ogurikuza ei buri,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 28:13">Tibuzoorwa mu nsi y'abahuriire.<verse eid="JOB 28:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 28:14" />Okuzimu neegira eti: Tiburi muriinye,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 28:14">N'enyanja eti: Tiinye mbwine.<verse eid="JOB 28:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 28:15" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">28:15: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PRO 3:14">Enf 3:14</ref>; <ref loc="PRO 8:10">8:10</ref>, <ref loc="PRO 8:11">11</ref>, <ref loc="PRO 8:19">19</ref>; <ref loc="PRO 16:16">16:16</ref>. </char>
    </note> Tiburikubaasa kutungwa ahabw'ezaabu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 28:15">Kandi tihariho feeza erikupimwa ekahitsya obuguzi bwabwo.<verse eid="JOB 28:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 28:16" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">28:16: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="1KI 9:28">1 Bag 9:28</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 13:12">Isa 13:12</ref>. </char>
    </note> Tiburikubaasa kwinganisibwa na zaabu ya Ofiri,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 28:16">Nari shohamu ey'obuguzi bwingi, n'obu yaakuba safiro.<verse eid="JOB 28:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 28:17" />Ezaabu n'ebirahuri tibirikwingana nabwo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 28:17">Kandi tiburikubaasa kuhingisibwa bintu by'ezaabu eshemeziibwe;<verse eid="JOB 28:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 28:18" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">28:18: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PRO 3:15">Enf 3:15</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 27:16">Ezk 27:16</ref>. </char>
    </note> Korali na kristalo nabyo tibikaagambwaho,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 28:18">Obuguzi bwabwo nibukira obw'eruuru.<verse eid="JOB 28:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 28:19" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">28:19: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EXO 28:17">Kur 28:17</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 28:13">Ezk 28:13</ref>. </char>
    </note> Topazi ya Esiopia terikubaasa kugyeranisibwa nabwo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 28:19">Kandi tiburikubaasa kwinganisibwa n'ezaabu enungi.<verse eid="JOB 28:19" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 28:20" />Mbwenu shi obwengye buruga hi?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 28:20">N'omwanya gw'okumanya gurahi?<verse eid="JOB 28:20" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 28:21" />Ahakuba busherekirwe abahuriire boona,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 28:21">Kandi bushwekirwe ngu enyonyi z'omu mwanya zitabureeba.<verse eid="JOB 28:21" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 28:22" />Okuzimu na Rufu nibigira biti:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 28:22">Tuhuriire nibabugambaho.<verse eid="JOB 28:22" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOB 28:23" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">28:23-28: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PRO 8:22-31">Enf 8:22-31</ref>. </char>
    </note> Ruhanga niwe arikumanya omuhanda ogurikuza ei buri,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 28:23">Kandi naamanya ahu butaaha;<verse eid="JOB 28:23" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOB 28:24" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">28:24: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PRO 15:3">Enf 15:3</ref>; <ref loc="ZEC 4:10">Zek 4:10</ref>. </char>
    </note> Ahabw'okuba anaga amaisho aha muheru gw'ensi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 28:24">Kandi ebiri ahansi y'eiguru byona abireeba.<verse eid="JOB 28:24" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOB 28:25" />Obu yaaha omuyaga ekiragiro,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 28:25">Akarengyesa amaizi endengo,<verse eid="JOB 28:25" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JOB 28:26" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">28:26: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JOB 38:25">Yob 38:25</ref>. </char>
    </note> Obu yaateeraho enjura ekiragiro,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 28:26">Akateeraho emirabyo emihanda,<verse eid="JOB 28:26" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JOB 28:27" />Obwo nibwo yaabureeba, akabumanyisa,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 28:27">Akabuhamya, akabucondooza,<verse eid="JOB 28:27" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JOB 28:28" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">28:28: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 111:10">Zab 111:10</ref>; <ref loc="PRO 1:7">Enf 1:7</ref>; <ref loc="PRO 3:7">3:7</ref>; <ref loc="PRO 14:16">14:16</ref>; <ref loc="PRO 16:6">16:6</ref>; <ref loc="ECC 12:13">Mub 12:13</ref>. </char>
    </note> Akagira omuntu ati: Reeba, okutiina MUKAMA nibwo bwengye,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 28:28">N'okutaana n'ekibi nikwo kwetegyereza.<verse eid="JOB 28:28" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 28" />
  <chapter number="29" style="c" sid="JOB 29" />
  <para style="s1">Yobu okwijuka obusingye obu yaabaire aine</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 29:1" />Bwanyima Yobu yaagumizamu naacwa enfumu ze, naagira ati:<verse eid="JOB 29:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 29:2" />Nkaabaasibwa ki, mba nk'oku naabaire ndi omu meezi agaahingwire,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 29:2">Nk'omu biro ebi Ruhanga yaabaire andindiramu,<verse eid="JOB 29:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 29:3" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">29:3: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JOB 18:6">Yob 18:6</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 18:28">Zab 18:28</ref>. </char>
    </note> Etabaaza ye neeyakira aha mutwe gwangye,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 29:3">Nindaba omu mwirima ahabw'okuhwezesa kwe,<verse eid="JOB 29:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 29:4" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">29:4: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JOB 15:8">Yob 15:8</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 25:14">Zab 25:14</ref>; <ref loc="PRO 3:32">Enf 3:32</ref>. </char>
    </note> Nk'oku naabaire ndi, ndi omushaija waahamya,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 29:4">Obu Ruhanga yaabaire akiine omukago n'eka yangye.<verse eid="JOB 29:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 29:5" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">29:5: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 128:3">Zab 128:3</ref>. </char>
    </note> Obwo Ow'obushoboorozi bwona akaba ari hamwe naanye,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 29:5">Abaana bangye bankiikize;<verse eid="JOB 29:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 29:6" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">29:6: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JOB 20:17">Yob 20:17</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 32:13">Bir 32:13</ref>, <ref loc="DEU 32:14">14</ref>. </char>
    </note> Ebigyere byangye nibinaabisibwa n'amate,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 29:6">N'orukiri niruunyitururira emigyera y'amajuta.<verse eid="JOB 29:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 29:7" />Ku naabaire nza aha irembo ry'orurembo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 29:7">Naata ekitebe kyangye omu mbuga,<verse eid="JOB 29:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 29:8" />Abatsigazi bakaba bandeeba, bampigiza,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 29:8">N'abagurusi baimuka, beemerera;<verse eid="JOB 29:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 29:9" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">29:9: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JOB 21:5">Yob 21:5</ref>. </char>
    </note> Abanyiginya baceceka, bafa mamigye,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 29:9">Bataire engaro aha munwa;<verse eid="JOB 29:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 29:10" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">29:10: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EZK 3:26">Ezk 3:26</ref>. </char>
    </note> Eiraka ry'abakungu rihunamisibwa,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 29:10">Endimi zibaramata omu nkanka.<verse eid="JOB 29:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 29:11" />Okutu kwona okwabaire kumpurira,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 29:11">kuunyeta ohiiriirwe,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 29:11">N'eriisho eryabaire rindeeba, rikihamya;<verse eid="JOB 29:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 29:12" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">29:12: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 72:12">Zab 72:12</ref>. </char>
    </note> Ahabw'okuba nkaba njuna omworo</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 29:12">owaabaire ataka,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 29:12">N'efuuzi etaine kihwera;<verse eid="JOB 29:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 29:13" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">29:13: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JOB 31:20">Yob 31:20</ref>; <ref loc="RUT 2:20">Rus 2:20</ref>. </char>
    </note> Orikwenda kufa anshabira omugisha,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 29:13">Kandi nkaba ndeetera omutima gw'omufaakazi kweshongora ahabw'okushemererwa.<verse eid="JOB 29:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 29:14" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">29:14: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 132:9">Zab 132:9</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 59:17">Isa 59:17</ref>; <ref loc="ZEC 3:5">Zek 3:5</ref>; <ref loc="EPH 6:14">Efe 6:14</ref>. </char>
    </note> Nkaba njwara okuhikiirira, kumpika;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 29:14">Obwinganisa bwangye bukaba buri nk'omunagiro n'ekikwemba.<verse eid="JOB 29:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 29:15" />Empumi nkaba nzibeera amaisho,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 29:15">N'ebirema mbibeera amaguru;<verse eid="JOB 29:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 29:16" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">29:16: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PRO 29:7">Enf 29:7</ref>. </char>
    </note> Nkaba ndi ishe w'abooro,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 29:16">N'abu ntarikumanya, mbuuririza ekirikubasaasa;<verse eid="JOB 29:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 29:17" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">29:17: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 3:7">Zab 3:7</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 58:6">58:6</ref>. </char>
    </note> Nkaba mpigura emba z'abasiisi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 29:17">Mbanagisa ebi baine omu maino.<verse eid="JOB 29:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 29:18" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">29:18: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 30:6">Zab 30:6</ref>. </char>
    </note> Omu biro ebyo nkaba ngira nti: Ndyagwa omu kyashuri kyangye,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 29:18">Nkanyise ebiro byangye bibe nk'omusheenyi;<verse eid="JOB 29:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 29:19" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">29:19: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JOB 18:16">Yob 18:16</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 1:3">Zab 1:3</ref>. </char>
    </note> Emizi yangye erandire omu maizi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 29:19">N'amataagi gangye gatondweho orume, burugyeho busheeshe,<verse eid="JOB 29:19" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 29:20" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">29:20: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="GEN 49:24">Kut 49:24</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 40:31">Isa 40:31</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 41:1">41:1</ref>. </char>
    </note> Ekitiinisa kyangye kigume kibe kisya,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 29:20">N'obuta bwangye bugume buri busya omu ngaro zangye.<verse eid="JOB 29:20" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 29:21" />Obwo abantu bakaba bantega okutu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 29:21">Bategyereza eki ndaahanuure bahunami.<verse eid="JOB 29:21" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 29:22" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">29:22: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="DEU 32:2">Bir 32:2</ref>. </char>
    </note> Ku naabaire mpeza kugamba, bakaba batagarukamu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 29:22">Ebigambo byangye bibatoonyereraho.<verse eid="JOB 29:22" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOB 29:23" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">29:23: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="DEU 11:14">Bir 11:14</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 119:131">Zab 119:131</ref>; <ref loc="PRO 16:15">Enf 16:15</ref>; <ref loc="ZEC 10:1">Zek 10:1</ref>. </char>
    </note> Bakaba bantegyereza nk'abategyereize enjura,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 29:23">Baashama nk'abategyereize enjura ya katumba.<verse eid="JOB 29:23" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOB 29:24" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">29:24: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="GEN 4:5">Kut 4:5</ref>; <ref loc="PRO 16:15">Enf 16:15</ref>. </char>
    </note> Nkaba mbasherekyera, beehweire amatsiko,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 29:24">Kandi bakaba batammaraho kushemuuka.<verse eid="JOB 29:24" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOB 29:25" />Nkaba mbaihiramu ebi baraakore, nshutama nabo nk'omukuru waabo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 29:25">Mbatuuramu nk'omugabe omu ngabo ze,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 29:25">Kandi nk'orikugumya abarikucura.<verse eid="JOB 29:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 29" />
  <chapter number="30" style="c" sid="JOB 30" />
  <para style="s1">Yobu okugamba aha busaasi obu aine</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 30:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">30:1: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JOB 12:4">Yob 12:4</ref>. </char>
    </note> Kwonka mbwenu abu ndikukira obukuru,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 30:1">Abu naakugayire baishebo ngu batahika embwa ezirinda obusyo bwangye,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 30:1">Nibanteerera enaku.<verse eid="JOB 30:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 30:2" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">30:2-8: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JOB 24:4-8">Yob 24:4-8</ref>. </char>
    </note> Abo bantu abahweirwemu amaani,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 30:2">Emikono yaabo ekaangasira ki?<verse eid="JOB 30:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 30:3" />Bahweire aha magufa ahabw'obukyene n'enjara,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 30:3">Nibaguga eitaka ryomire ery'aha mbuga,<verse eid="JOB 30:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 30:4" />Nibashoroma emifura n'amababi g'ebindi bishaka,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 30:4">N'enkonya z'ebinyagashani nibyo by'okurya byabo.<verse eid="JOB 30:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 30:5" />Nibacuubwa omu bantu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 30:5">Enduuru neebajuga enyima nk'abashuma.<verse eid="JOB 30:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 30:6" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">30:6: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="1SA 13:6">1 Sam 13:6</ref>; <ref loc="JER 4:29">Yer 4:29</ref>. </char>
    </note> Obutaaho bwabo n'ensa z'emitunga,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 30:6">N'amaaya g'omu itaka, n'enyanga z'omu mabaare.<verse eid="JOB 30:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 30:7" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">30:7: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JOB 6:5">Yob 6:5</ref>; <ref loc="ZEP 2:9">Zef 2:9</ref>. </char>
    </note> Nibaririra omu bishaka nk'endogoya,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 30:7">Beeteeranira omu bicuragyenyi;<verse eid="JOB 30:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 30:8" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">30:8: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JOB 18:17">Yob 18:17</ref>. </char>
    </note> N'abaana b'abashema, b'abantu abataine ku bari,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 30:8">Nibabingwa omu nsi n'enkoba.<verse eid="JOB 30:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 30:9" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">30:9: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JOB 17:6">Yob 17:6</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 69:12">Zab 69:12</ref>; <ref loc="LAM 3:14">Tonz 3:14</ref>, <ref loc="LAM 3:63">63</ref>. </char>
    </note> Mbwenu hati mpindukire ekyeshongoro kyabo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 30:9">Buzima mbabeereire eky'okucweraho enfumu;<verse eid="JOB 30:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 30:10" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">30:10: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 50:6">Isa 50:6</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 26:67">Mat 26:67</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 27:30">27:30</ref>. </char>
    </note> Bantamirwe, baanyetantara,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 30:10">Kandi tibarikutiina kuncwera mu maisho;<verse eid="JOB 30:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 30:11" />Ahabw'okuba Ruhanga ayugize omurunga gwangye, yancureeza.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 30:11">Tibakingirira kashoni.<verse eid="JOB 30:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 30:12" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">30:12: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JOB 19:12">Yob 19:12</ref>. </char>
    </note> Aha rubaju rwangye rwa buryo haimukire omutwe gw'abantu abataine ku bari,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 30:12">Bambinga, bamburabuza,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 30:12">Barunda eby'okutemberaho ngu bancwekyereze;<verse eid="JOB 30:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 30:13" />Baita omuhanda gwangye, bakanyisa enaku zangye;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 30:13">Tihaine orikubazibira.<verse eid="JOB 30:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 30:14" />Baija nk'abarikuraba ahasheenyukire ahahango,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 30:14">Baayekumbagariza aha rugo rugwire, bangwaho.<verse eid="JOB 30:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 30:15" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">30:15: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JOB 7:9">Yob 7:9</ref>; <ref loc="JOB 18:11">18:11</ref>. </char>
    </note> Ebirikutiinisa biinyehindukiriize,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 30:15">Ekitiinisa kyangye kibingirwe nk'ekirikubingwa omuyaga;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 30:15">Okugogyera kwangye nikuyaayuuka nk'ekicu.<verse eid="JOB 30:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 30:16" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">30:16: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="1SA 1:15">1 Sam 1:15</ref>. </char>
    </note> Kandi hati omutima gumpwire omunda,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 30:16">Ebiro by'obusaasi bimbumbatiire;<verse eid="JOB 30:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 30:17" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">30:17: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JOB 7:3">Yob 7:3</ref>; <ref loc="JOB 33:19">33:19</ref>. </char>
    </note> Nyekiro amagufa gangye nigaanyogamu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 30:17">Obuhuruzi oburikunsaasa tiburikutuuza;<verse eid="JOB 30:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 30:18" />Ahabw'amaani gaabwo ekijwaro kyangye nikisiisikara,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 30:18">Nibunniga nk'ebitsya by'ekanzu.<verse eid="JOB 30:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 30:19" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">30:19: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JOB 42:6">Yob 42:6</ref>; <ref loc="GEN 18:27">Kut 18:27</ref>. </char>
    </note> Ruhanga annagire omu byondo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 30:19">Naahinduka nk'omucuucu n'eiju.<verse eid="JOB 30:19" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 30:20" />Ninkutakira, torikungarukamu;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 30:20">Nyemereire, torikuunyetaho.<verse eid="JOB 30:20" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 30:21" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">30:21: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JOB 16:9">Yob 16:9</ref>. </char>
    </note> Ompindukiire enshaarizi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 30:21">Nompiiga n'omukono gwawe ogw'amaani.<verse eid="JOB 30:21" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 30:22" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">30:22: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JOB 27:21">Yob 27:21</ref>. </char>
    </note> Nontumuura n'omuyaga oguntembesaho,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 30:22">Onnaga oku n'oku n'eihunga ry'amaani;<verse eid="JOB 30:22" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOB 30:23" />Eego nimmanya ku orimpitsya ha kufa,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 30:23">N'omu nju eyaateereirweho abahuriire boona.<verse eid="JOB 30:23" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOB 30:24" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">30:24: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MIC 1:6">Mik 1:6</ref>; <ref loc="MIC 3:12">3:12</ref>. </char>
    </note> Beitu shi, omuntu obandamiirwe enju, taimutsya omukono,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 30:24">N'omu kabi ke tateera enduuru?<verse eid="JOB 30:24" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOB 30:25" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">30:25: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 35:13">Zab 35:13</ref>, <ref loc="PSA 35:14">14</ref>; <ref loc="ROM 12:15">Rom 12:15</ref>. </char>
    </note> Tindariire owaabaire ari omu busaasi?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 30:25">Omutima gwangye tigurasaasiibwe omworo?<verse eid="JOB 30:25" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JOB 30:26" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">30:26: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JER 8:15">Yer 8:15</ref>; <ref loc="JER 14:19">14:19</ref>. </char>
    </note> Kwonka nyowe, ku naabaire ntegyereza ebirungi, haija ebibi;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 30:26">Nkitegyereza omushana, haija omwirima.<verse eid="JOB 30:26" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JOB 30:27" />Omutima gwangye nigurabanamu tigutuurize;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 30:27">Ebiro by'okubonabona byampikaho.<verse eid="JOB 30:27" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JOB 30:28" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">30:28: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 38:6">Zab 38:6</ref>. </char>
    </note> Ningyenda nyiragwire, ntairaguziibwe mushana,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 30:28">Nyemerera omu iteeraniro, ninteera enduuru.<verse eid="JOB 30:28" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JOB 30:29" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">30:29: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 13:21">Isa 13:21</ref>; <ref loc="MIC 1:8">Mik 1:8</ref>. </char>
    </note> Ndi ishe-emwe na zaamuha,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 30:29">Mugyenzi wa zaamaaya.<verse eid="JOB 30:29" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JOB 30:30" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">30:30: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 102:3">Zab 102:3</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 119:83">119:83</ref>; <ref loc="LAM 4:8">Tonz 4:8</ref>; <ref loc="LAM 5:10">5:10</ref>. </char>
    </note> Omubiri gwangye gwiragwire, gwayonoka,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 30:30">N'amagufa gangye gucumikirwemu omuriro.<verse eid="JOB 30:30" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JOB 30:31" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">30:31: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 33:15">Isa 33:15</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 5:28">Mat 5:28</ref>. </char>
    </note> Nikyo enanga yangye ehinduriirwe ey'okucura,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 30:31">N'omukuri gwangye gukateererwa abarikurira.<verse eid="JOB 30:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 30" />
  <chapter number="31" style="c" sid="JOB 31" />
  <para style="s1">Yobu okwetonganira ku ataine kibi</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 31:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">31:1: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 33:15">Isa 33:15</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 5:28">Mat 5:28</ref>. </char>
    </note> Nkaragaana endagaano n'amaisho gangye;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 31:1">Mbwenu nimbaasa nta kureeba omwishiki, nkamwetenga?<verse eid="JOB 31:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 31:2" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">31:2: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JOB 20:29">Yob 20:29</ref>. </char>
    </note> Nkaatunga mugabo ki ahari Ruhanga?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 31:2">Kandi obuhunguzi bwangye oburikuruga aha W'obushoboorozi bwona ahaiguru bukaba ki?<verse eid="JOB 31:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 31:3" />Ebihikiirizi tibigwera abatahikiriire,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 31:3">N'akagwe kakagwera enkozi z'ebibi?<verse eid="JOB 31:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 31:4" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">31:4: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JOB 14:16">Yob 14:16</ref>; <ref loc="JOB 34:21">34:21</ref>; <ref loc="2CH 16:9">2 Bus 16:9</ref>; <ref loc="PRO 15:3">Enf 15:3</ref>; <ref loc="JER 32:19">Yer 32:19</ref>. </char>
    </note> Ruhanga tarikureeba emihanda yangye,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 31:4">Akabara entambwe zangye zoona?<verse eid="JOB 31:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 31:5" />Ku ndaabe ndagyenzire nimbeiha,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 31:5">Ebigyere byangye bikeehuuta kuza kugobya,<verse eid="JOB 31:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 31:6" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">31:6: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="DAN 5:27">Dan 5:27</ref>. </char>
    </note> (Ka mpimwe omu minzaani ey'amazima,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 31:6">Ruhanga amanye obwesigwa bwangye!)<verse eid="JOB 31:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 31:7" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">31:7: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JOB 11:15">Yob 11:15</ref>; <ref loc="ECC 11:9">Mub 11:9</ref>; <ref loc="NUM 15:39">Kub 15:39</ref>. </char>
    </note> Ekigyere kyangye ku kiraabe kirateishukire omuhanda,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 31:7">N'omutima gwangye gukakurata ebi amaisho gangye geetenga,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 31:7">Nari engaro zangye ku ziraabe ziragiirweho akabara koona,<verse eid="JOB 31:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 31:8" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">31:8: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="LEV 26:16">Lev 26:16</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 28:30">Bir 28:30</ref>. </char>
    </note> Ninkabibe, ondiijo akarya,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 31:8">N'ebi naahingire omu musiri gwangye bikakuurwamu.<verse eid="JOB 31:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 31:9" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">31:9: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JOB 24:15">Yob 24:15</ref>. </char>
    </note> Omutima gwangye ku guraabe guratwairwe omukazi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 31:9">Nkagwera aha rwigi rwa mutaahi wangye,<verse eid="JOB 31:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 31:10" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">31:10: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="2SA 12:11">2 Sam 12:11</ref>. </char>
    </note> Omukazi wangye naakaseere ondiijo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 31:10">N'abandi bakamujuumarira;<verse eid="JOB 31:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 31:11" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">31:11: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="LEV 20:10">Lev 20:10</ref>. </char>
    </note> Ahabw'okuba ekyo kikaabaire ekicumuro kihango munonga;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 31:11">Eego, kikaabaire ekibi ky'okufubirwa abaramuzi.<verse eid="JOB 31:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 31:12" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">31:12: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PRO 6:27-29">Enf 6:27-29</ref>. </char>
    </note> Ahakuba ekyo kibi n'omuriro ogurikwokyeza kimwe, gukamaraho,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 31:12">Kandi ekirikubaasa kurandura ebi mpingire byona.<verse eid="JOB 31:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 31:13" />Ku ndaabe ndagayire orubanja rw'omuhuuku wangye, nari orw'omuzaana wangye,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 31:13">Obu bantonganisa,<verse eid="JOB 31:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 31:14" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">31:14: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 17:3">Zab 17:3</ref>. </char>
    </note> Ndyagira nta, Ruhanga ku ariimuka?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 31:14">Nari shi, ku yaakubimbuuza, nkaamugarukamu ki?<verse eid="JOB 31:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 31:15" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">31:15: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JOB 34:19">Yob 34:19</ref>; <ref loc="PRO 22:2">Enf 22:2</ref>; <ref loc="EPH 6:9">Efe 6:9</ref>. </char>
    </note> Owampangire omunda ya maawe, tiwe yaahangire n'ogwo?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 31:15">Owaatuhangire omunda t'omwe?<verse eid="JOB 31:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 31:16" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">31:16: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JOB 22:7">Yob 22:7</ref>. </char>
    </note> Hariho obu ndaimire omworo eki arikwetenga,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 31:16">Nari shi, okumara amatsiko amaisho g'omufaakazi?<verse eid="JOB 31:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 31:17" />Nari hariho obu ndariire ak'okurya kangye nyenka,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 31:17">Efuuzi etakaboneho?<verse eid="JOB 31:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 31:18" />Kureka okuruga omu butsigazi bwangye nkarera ogwo mworo nka ishe,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 31:18">N'omufaakazi nkamureeberera, okwiha obu naaruga omunda ya maawe.<verse eid="JOB 31:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 31:19" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">31:19: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JOB 24:7">Yob 24:7</ref>, <ref loc="JOB 24:10">10</ref>. </char>
    </note> Ku ndaabe ndareebire omuntu naafa ahabw'okubura ekijwaro,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 31:19">Nari enshoberwa ebuzire eky'okweshweka,<verse eid="JOB 31:19" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 31:20" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">31:20: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="DEU 24:13">Bir 24:13</ref>. </char>
    </note> Nari obwezirikiro bwe butaransiimire,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 31:20">Kandi atamarwe mbeho oruhu rw'entaama zangye;<verse eid="JOB 31:20" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 31:21" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">31:21: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JOB 22:9">Yob 22:9</ref>. </char>
    </note> Ku ndaabe ndabangiire efuuzi omukono,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 31:21">Ahabw'okureeba aha irembo orikugwera orubaju rwangye,<verse eid="JOB 31:21" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 31:22" />Eibega ryangye nirikataane n'orwano,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 31:22">N'omukono gwangye gukanyukuka omu ngingo!<verse eid="JOB 31:22" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOB 31:23" />Ahabw'okuba ebihikiirizi ebirikuruga ahari Ruhanga bikaba biinyitsa obwoba,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 31:23">Kandi ndemwa kugumisiririza ekitiinisa kye ekingi.<verse eid="JOB 31:23" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOB 31:24" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">31:24: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JOB 4:6">Yob 4:6</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 10:24">Mak 10:24</ref>. </char>
    </note> Ku ndaabe ndahindwire ezaabu amatsiko gangye,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 31:24">Nkagira ezaabu eshemeziibwe nti, Niiwe bwesigye bwangye,<verse eid="JOB 31:24" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOB 31:25" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">31:25: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="DEU 8:17">Bir 8:17</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 62:10">Zab 62:10</ref>. </char>
    </note> Ku ndaabe ndeesiimire ahabw'okugira eitungo ringi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 31:25">Nari ahabw'omukono gwangye kutunga bingi;<verse eid="JOB 31:25" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JOB 31:26" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">31:26: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="DEU 4:19">Bir 4:19</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 17:3">17:3</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 8:16">Ezk 8:16</ref>. </char>
    </note> Ku ndaabe ndahangire eizooba amaisho niryaka,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 31:26">Nari okwezi nikugyenda nikumurinkana,<verse eid="JOB 31:26" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JOB 31:27" />Kandi omutima gwangye gukabeihwabeihwa bwesherekye,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 31:27">Akanwa kangye kakanywegyera engaro zangye,<verse eid="JOB 31:27" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JOB 31:28" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">31:28: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JOS 24:27">Yos 24:27</ref>. </char>
    </note> Ekyo nakyo kikaabaire ekibi eky'okufubirwa mpemukire ahari Ruhanga ow'ahaiguru munonga.<verse eid="JOB 31:28" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JOB 31:29" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">31:29: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PRO 17:5">Enf 17:5</ref>. </char>
    </note> Hariho obu ndashemerereirwe okucwekyerera kw'orikuunyanga,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 31:29">Nari shi nkeesiima habw'akagwe akaamugwaho?<verse eid="JOB 31:29" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JOB 31:30" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">31:30: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 5:44">Mat 5:44</ref>; <ref loc="ROM 12:14">Rom 12:14</ref>. </char>
    </note> (Ngaaha! Tindarekire kanwa kangye kucumura,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 31:30">Ngu mmushabire okufa nimmukyeena.)<verse eid="JOB 31:30" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JOB 31:31" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">31:31: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="1SA 25:11">1 Sam 25:11</ref>. </char>
    </note> Hariho obu ab'omu ka yangye batagira bati:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 31:31">N'oha omuriimwe otaarya nyama, akahaaga?<verse eid="JOB 31:31" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="JOB 31:32" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">31:32: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="GEN 19:2">Kut 19:2</ref>, <ref loc="GEN 19:3">3</ref>; <ref loc="JDG 19:20">Bar 19:20</ref>, <ref loc="JDG 19:21">21</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 25:35">Mat 25:35</ref>; <ref loc="HEB 13:2">Heb 13:2</ref>. </char>
    </note> (Tihariho mushuhuuki ou ndaraarize omu muhanda;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 31:32">Kureka nkaba nyigurira omuhinguzi weena.)<verse eid="JOB 31:32" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JOB 31:33" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">31:33: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="GEN 3:8">Kut 3:8</ref>, <ref loc="GEN 3:12">12</ref>; <ref loc="PRO 28:13">Enf 28:13</ref>. </char>
    </note> Ku ndaabe ndasherekire abantu okushiisha kwangye,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 31:33">Nkashereka omu kifuba okutahikiirira kwangye,<verse eid="JOB 31:33" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="JOB 31:34" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">31:34: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EXO 23:2">Kur 23:2</ref>. </char>
    </note> Ahabw'okutiina munonga omutwe muhango gw'abantu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 31:34">N'okutiina okugaywa ab'emiryango yaitu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 31:34">Kikandeetera kuhunama n'okutashohora;<verse eid="JOB 31:34" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="JOB 31:35" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">31:35: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JOB 13:22">Yob 13:22</ref>; <ref loc="JOB 19:23">19:23</ref>. </char>
    </note> Nkaabasibwa ki, hagira owampurira!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 31:35">(Reeba, akamanyiso kangye nkaka! Ow'obushoboorozi bwona angarukyemu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 31:35">Naanye ndeebe ebirego ebihandiikirwe omubisha wangye.)<verse eid="JOB 31:35" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="JOB 31:36" />Buzimazima nkaabiheeka aha mabega,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 31:36">Mbijwara nk'ekirunga,<verse eid="JOB 31:36" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="JOB 31:37" />Nkaamumanyisa ebi naakozire byona omu mitwarize yangye,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 31:37">Mmuhika haihi nk'omunyiginya.<verse eid="JOB 31:37" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="JOB 31:38" />Ekyaro kyangye ku kiraabe kirantabaarize,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 31:38">Entabire zaakyo zikaririra hamwe,<verse eid="JOB 31:38" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="JOB 31:39" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">31:39: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="GEN 4:12">Kut 4:12</ref>; <ref loc="1KI 21:16">1 Bag 21:16</ref>, <ref loc="1KI 21:19">19</ref>; <ref loc="2TI 2:6">2 Tim 2:6</ref>; <ref loc="JAS 5:4">Yak 5:4</ref>. </char>
    </note> Ku ndaabe ndariire omweru gwakyo ntaine u mpaire ebihembo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 31:39">Nari shi nkareetera bakama baakyo kufa,<verse eid="JOB 31:39" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="JOB 31:40" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">31:40: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="GEN 3:18">Kut 3:18</ref>. </char>
    </note> Amatojo nigakamere omu mwanya gw'engano,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 31:40">N'orumbugu rukamera omuri sayiri.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 31:40">Ebigambo bya Yobu byagarukira aha.<verse eid="JOB 31:40" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 31" />
  <chapter number="32" style="c" sid="JOB 32" />
  <para style="s1">Ebigambo bya Elihu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 32:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">32:1: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JOB 33:9">Yob 33:9</ref>. </char>
    </note> Batyo abo bantu bonshatu baarekyera aho kugarukamu Yobu, ahabw'okuba akaba naayemanya ku ahikiriire. <verse eid="JOB 32:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 32:2" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">32:2: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 14:17">Yob 14:17</ref>; <ref loc="JOB 34:5">34:5</ref>. </char></note> Bwanyima Elihu mwene Barakeeli, Omubuuzi ow'omu muryango gwa Raamu, yaagira ekiniga. Yaagirira Yobu ekiniga ahabw'okweyeta ohikiriire okukira Ruhanga; <verse eid="JOB 32:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 32:3" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">32:3: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 22:5">Yob 22:5</ref>. </char></note> kandi yaakigirira na bagyenzi ba Yobu abo bonshatu, ahabw'okubura eky'okumugarukamu, n'obu baraabe bahamize ku ari omusiisi. <verse eid="JOB 32:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 32:4" />Kwonka Elihu akaba ategyereize kugamba na Yobu, ahabw'okuba abo bakaba nibamukira obukuru. <verse eid="JOB 32:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 32:5" />Elihu ku yaareebire abo bonshatu baabura eky'okugarukamu, yaagira ekiniga.<verse eid="JOB 32:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 32:6" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">32:6: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JOB 15:10">Yob 15:10</ref>. </char>
    </note> Atyo Elihu mwene Barakeeli Omubuuzi yaagira ati:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 32:6">Ndi muto; imwe muri abagurusi;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 32:6">Nikyo kindeeteire kutiina, ntarahukye kubamanyisa eki ndikuteekateeka;<verse eid="JOB 32:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 32:7" />Nkagira nti: Ka hagambe abaine ebiro bingi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 32:7">Abamazire emyaka mingi babe nibo baayegyesa obwengye.<verse eid="JOB 32:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 32:8" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">32:8: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="GEN 2:7">Kut 2:7</ref>; <ref loc="1KI 3:12">1 Bag 3:12</ref>; <ref loc="JOB 33:4">Yob 33:4</ref>; <ref loc="JOB 38:36">38:36</ref>; <ref loc="PRO 2:6">Enf 2:6</ref>; <ref loc="DAN 1:17">Dan 1:17</ref>; <ref loc="JAS 1:5">Yak 1:5</ref>. </char>
    </note> Kwonka ekihaisa omuntu okwetegyereza</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 32:8">N'omwoyo oguri omuriwe, omwitsyo gw'Ow'obushoboorozi bwona.<verse eid="JOB 32:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 32:9" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">32:9: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 11:25">Mat 11:25</ref>; <ref loc="1CO 1:26">1 Kor 1:26</ref>. </char>
    </note> Abahikire omu ngingo zaabukuru tibo baine bwengye,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 32:9">N'abagurusi tibo barikumanya by'oburyo.<verse eid="JOB 32:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 32:10" />Nikyo ndikugirira nti: Muntegye amatu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 32:10">Naanye mbagambire ebi ndikuteekateeka.<verse eid="JOB 32:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 32:11" />Reeba, mbaire ntegyereize ebigambo byanyu;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 32:11">Obu mubaire nimuteekateeka eby'okugamba,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 32:11">Naagira ngu, mpurire ebi muraagambe.<verse eid="JOB 32:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 32:12" />Buzimazima ntaireho omutima kubahurira,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 32:12">Kwonka tihariho n'omwe omuriimwe oyemeize Yobu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 32:12">N'obu kwakuba okugarukamu ebigambo bye.<verse eid="JOB 32:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 32:13" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">32:13: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JER 9:23">Yer 9:23</ref>. </char>
    </note> Mwerinde, mutakaayekwatsa mukagira ngu: Niitwe tuzoirwe obwengye;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 32:13">Tihariho muntu owaakumubaasa, kureka akaabaasibwa Ruhanga.<verse eid="JOB 32:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 32:14" />Manya, ebi agambire, tiinye ahakaniise;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 32:14">Naanye tindikwija kumugarukisamu ebyanyu.<verse eid="JOB 32:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 32:15" />Bashobeirwe, tibakigarukamu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 32:15">Tibaine ky'okugamba.<verse eid="JOB 32:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 32:16" />Mbwenu mpuname, ngu niho batakiine ky'okugamba,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 32:16">Kureka okwemerera aho, bakabura eky'okugarukamu?<verse eid="JOB 32:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 32:17" />Naanye niinyija kugira eki naagarukamu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 32:17">Ngambe eki ndikuteekateeka;<verse eid="JOB 32:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 32:18" />Ahabw'okuba nyine bingi munonga eby'okugamba;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 32:18">Omwoyo oguri omuriinye nigwo gurikungyema.<verse eid="JOB 32:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 32:19" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">32:19: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 9:17">Mat 9:17</ref>. </char>
    </note> Reeba, omutima gwangye nigushusha viinyo etaine bwikizo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 32:19">Nigwenda kubaruka nk'efurebe za viinyo y'omutahe.<verse eid="JOB 32:19" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 32:20" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">32:20: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 39:3">Zab 39:3</ref>. </char>
    </note> Ka ngambe, nyitsye;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 32:20">Nyashame, mbone kugarukamu.<verse eid="JOB 32:20" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 32:21" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">32:21: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="LEV 19:15">Lev 19:15</ref>. </char>
    </note> Tindikwija kugwera rubaju rw'omuntu weena,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 32:21">N'obu kwakuba okugira ou naashunga;<verse eid="JOB 32:21" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 32:22" />Ahabw'okuba timmanya kushunga;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 32:22">ku naakukikora, Omuhangi wangye akaanyita kitaraariire.<verse eid="JOB 32:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 32" />
  <chapter number="33" style="c" sid="JOB 33" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 33:1" />Mbwenu, Yobu, ninkweshengyereza, hurira ebi ndikugamba;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 33:1">Ote omutima aha bigambo byangye byona.<verse eid="JOB 33:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 33:2" />Reeba naayashama,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 33:2">Orurimi rw'omu kanwa kangye nirugamba;<verse eid="JOB 33:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 33:3" />Ebigambo byangye nibyoreka ku omutima gwangye gugororokire,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 33:3">Kandi ebi ndikumanya nibyo eminwa yangye eraagambe etaine buryarya.<verse eid="JOB 33:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 33:4" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">33:4: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="GEN 2:7">Kut 2:7</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 37:9">Ezk 37:9</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 17:25">Byak 17:25</ref>. </char>
    </note> Omwoyo wa Ruhanga niwe yampangire,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 33:4">N'omwityso gw'Ow'obushoboorozi bwona nigwo gumpa amagara.<verse eid="JOB 33:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 33:5" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">33:5: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JOB 23:4">Yob 23:4</ref>. </char>
    </note> Ku oraabe noobaasa, ngarukamu;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 33:5">Tebeekanisa gye ebigambo byawe omu maisho gangye, oyemerere aho.<verse eid="JOB 33:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 33:6" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">33:6: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JOB 4:19">Yob 4:19</ref>; <ref loc="JOB 9:34">9:34</ref>; <ref loc="JOB 13:21">13:21</ref>. </char>
    </note> Reeba, omu maisho ga Ruhanga nyowe naiwe nitwingana;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 33:6">Naanye nkahangwa omu itaka.<verse eid="JOB 33:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 33:7" />Reeba, omuriinye tiharimu kirikutiinisa ekishemereire kukwitsa obwoba;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 33:7">Tindikwija kukurusya.<verse eid="JOB 33:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 33:8" />Buzimazima, ebi obaire noogamba, mbihuriire,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 33:8">N'eiraka ryabyo ryampika omu matu.<verse eid="JOB 33:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 33:9" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">33:9: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JOB 13:18">Yob 13:18</ref>; <ref loc="JOB 27:5">27:5</ref>; <ref loc="JOB 29:14">29:14</ref>. </char>
    </note> Noogira oti: Ndi mwere, tiinyine ki nshobize;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 33:9">Ndi oshemeire, kandi omuriinye tiharimu kutahikiirira;<verse eid="JOB 33:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 33:10" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">33:10: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JOB 13:24">Yob 13:24</ref>. </char>
    </note> Kwonka Ruhanga aine ahu aihire kundwanisa,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 33:10">Nanteekateekaho nk'omuzigu we;<verse eid="JOB 33:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 33:11" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">33:11: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JOB 13:27">Yob 13:27</ref>. </char>
    </note> Ata ebigyere byangye omu nkomo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 33:11">Aguma ataire eriisho aha mihanda yangye yoona.<verse eid="JOB 33:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 33:12" />Reeba, ka nkugarukyemu, omuri ebyo tohikire;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 33:12">ahakuba Ruhanga ni mukuru okukira omuntu.<verse eid="JOB 33:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 33:13" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">33:13: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JOB 9:12">Yob 9:12</ref>; <ref loc="JOB 40:2">40:2</ref>. </char>
    </note> Ahabw'enki noomuhakanisa, noogira oti:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 33:13">Tarikwija kugarukamu kigambo kyangye na kimwe?<verse eid="JOB 33:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 33:14" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">33:14: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JOB 33:29">Yob 33:29</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 62:11">Zab 62:11</ref>; <ref loc="1SA 3:4">1 Sam 3:4</ref>, <ref loc="1SA 3:6">6</ref>. </char>
    </note> Ahakuba Ruhanga agamba omu muringo gumwe nari ebiri,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 33:14">N'obu omuntu araabe atakyetaho,<verse eid="JOB 33:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 33:15" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">33:15: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JOB 4:13">Yob 4:13</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 17:3">Zab 17:3</ref>; <ref loc="NUM 12:6">Kub 12:6</ref>. </char>
    </note> Omu kirooto, omu kworekwa nyekiro,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 33:15">Abantu bahirwayo, bagwejegyereire omu bitanda byabo.<verse eid="JOB 33:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 33:16" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">33:16: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JOB 36:10">Yob 36:10</ref>, <ref loc="JOB 36:15">15</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 40:6">Zab 40:6</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 43:27">Isa 43:27</ref>; <ref loc="1SA 9:15">1 Sam 9:15</ref>. </char>
    </note> Obwo nibwo aigura amatu g'abantu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 33:16">akabatiinisa naabahana,<verse eid="JOB 33:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 33:17" />Ngu abone kuzibira omuntu ebi arikwenda kukora,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 33:17">N'okumumaramu amaryo.<verse eid="JOB 33:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 33:18" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">33:18: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JOB 36:12">Yob 36:12</ref>. </char>
    </note> Ruhanga azibira omutima gwe kugwa omu Kiina,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 33:18">N'amagara ge kumarwaho rurara.<verse eid="JOB 33:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 33:19" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">33:19: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JOB 30:17">Yob 30:17</ref>. </char>
    </note> Kandi omuntu ahanwa obusaasi ari aha kitanda kye,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 33:19">N'omu magufa ge haguma harimu orugamba,<verse eid="JOB 33:19" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 33:20" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">33:20: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 107:18">Zab 107:18</ref>. </char>
    </note> Bireetera amagara ge kutamwa eby'okurya;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 33:20">N'obu byakuba ebirikunura munonga tabigirira ifa.<verse eid="JOB 33:20" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 33:21" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">33:21: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 22:17">Zab 22:17</ref>. </char>
    </note> Enyama zimuhwa aha magufa, zibura kureebwa;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 33:21">N'amagufa ge, agaabaire gatarikureebwa, gatunama.<verse eid="JOB 33:21" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 33:22" />Omwoyo gwe gwiririra Ekiina,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 33:22">N'amagara ge gairirira abahwerekyerezi.<verse eid="JOB 33:22" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOB 33:23" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">33:23: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="GEN 16:7">Kut 16:7</ref>; <ref loc="GEN 22:11">22:11</ref>; <ref loc="GEN 42:23">42:23</ref>; <ref loc="GEN 48:16">48:16</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 34:7">Zab 34:7</ref>; <ref loc="MAL 3:1">Mal 3:1</ref>. </char>
    </note> Ku akubonekyerwa maraika w'okumutonganira,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 33:23">Nangwa omwe wenka omuri rukumi ow'okumumanyisa ebimushemereire,<verse eid="JOB 33:23" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOB 33:24" />Yaamugirira embabazi naagira ati:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 33:24">Mujune, atagwa omu Kiina; ndeebire, eky'okumucungura.<verse eid="JOB 33:24" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOB 33:25" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">33:25: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="2KI 5:14">2 Bag 5:14</ref>. </char>
    </note> Omubiri gwe gugarukye gube muto nk'ogw'omwana,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 33:25">Agire amaani nk'agu yaabaire aine omu butsigazi bwe.<verse eid="JOB 33:25" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JOB 33:26" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">33:26: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JOB 22:27">Yob 22:27</ref>; <ref loc="2SA 12:13">2 Sam 12:13</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 17:15">Zab 17:15</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 15:21-24">Luk 15:21-24</ref>; <ref loc="1JN 1:9">1 Yoh 1:9</ref>. </char>
    </note> Obwo nibwo omuntu yaakushaba Ruhanga, akamwakiira,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 33:26">Akaija ah'ari n'okushemererwa,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 33:26">Akagambira abantu eby'okujuna kwe,<verse eid="JOB 33:26" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JOB 33:27" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">33:27: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ROM 6:21">Rom 6:21</ref>. </char>
    </note> Akeeshongorera omu maisho g'abantu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 33:27">Akagira ati: Nkashiisha, naakiikamya ebyabaire bihikire, tinaabiturwa;<verse eid="JOB 33:27" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JOB 33:28" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">33:28: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 38:17">Isa 38:17</ref>. </char>
    </note> Kureka yaacungura omwoyo gwangye, tigwaza mu Kiina;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 33:28">N'amagara gangye garyareeba omushana.<verse eid="JOB 33:28" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JOB 33:29" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">33:29: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JOB 33:14">Yob 33:14</ref>. </char>
    </note> Reeba, Ruhanga akora ebyo byona,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 33:29">Naatwaza atyo omuntu kabiri nari kashatu,<verse eid="JOB 33:29" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JOB 33:30" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">33:30: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 56:13">Zab 56:13</ref>. </char>
    </note> Ngu abone kwiha omwoyo gwe omu Kiina,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 33:30">Ngu areebe omushana gw'amagara.<verse eid="JOB 33:30" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JOB 33:31" />Nyaabura 'we, Yobu, tega amatu, ompurire;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 33:31">Ohuname, ngambe.<verse eid="JOB 33:31" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="JOB 33:32" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">33:32: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JOB 34:33">Yob 34:33</ref>. </char>
    </note> Ku oraabe oine eki orikugamba, ngarukamu;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 33:32">Gamba; ahabw'okuba niinyenda kukwihaho orubanja.<verse eid="JOB 33:32" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JOB 33:33" />Ku oraabe otakiine, ntega okutu;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 33:33">Ohuname, nkuhabure obwengye.<verse eid="JOB 33:33" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 33" />
  <chapter number="34" style="c" sid="JOB 34" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 34:1" />Bwanyima Elihu yaagaruka yaagira ati:<verse eid="JOB 34:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 34:2" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">34:2: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JOB 12:11">Yob 12:11</ref>. </char>
    </note> Imwe banyabwengye 'mwe, nimuhurire ebigambo byangye;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 34:2">Imwe abaine okumanya, muntegye amatu;<verse eid="JOB 34:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 34:3" />Ahabw'okuba okutu kutaanisa ebigambo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 34:3">Nk'oku orurimi rumanya eby'okurya.<verse eid="JOB 34:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 34:4" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">34:4: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="1TH 5:21">1 Tes 5:21</ref>. </char>
    </note> Ka tutoorane ebihikire,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 34:4">Tweyihiremu ekirungi;<verse eid="JOB 34:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 34:5" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">34:5: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JOB 27:2">Yob 27:2</ref>; <ref loc="JOB 33:9">33:9</ref>. </char>
    </note> Ahakuba Yobu agizire ati: Ndi ohikiriire,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 34:5">Ruhanga anyihireho ebinshemereire.<verse eid="JOB 34:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 34:6" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">34:6: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JOB 6:4">Yob 6:4</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 38:2">Zab 38:2</ref>. </char>
    </note> N'obu ndaabe mpikiriire, niinyetwa omunyakishuba,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 34:6">Obuhuta bwangye tiburikutambwa, n'obu ndaabe ntaine kicumuro.<verse eid="JOB 34:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 34:7" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">34:7: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JOB 15:16">Yob 15:16</ref>. </char>
    </note> Ni muntu ki ori nka Yobu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 34:7">Orikugotomera okugaya nk'amaizi,<verse eid="JOB 34:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 34:8" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">34:8: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 1:1">Zab 1:1</ref>. </char>
    </note> Akagyenda n'ebigombe by'enkozi z'ebibi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 34:8">Naakwatanisa n'abantu babi.<verse eid="JOB 34:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 34:9" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">34:9: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JOB 9:22">Yob 9:22</ref>; <ref loc="JOB 21:15">21:15</ref>; <ref loc="JOB 35:3">35:3</ref>; <ref loc="MAL 3:14">Mal 3:14</ref>. </char>
    </note> Ahakuba agizire ati: okushemerererwa omuri Ruhanga</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 34:9">Tikwine ki kurikugasira omuntu.<verse eid="JOB 34:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 34:10" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">34:10: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="GEN 18:25">Kut 18:25</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 32:4">Bir 32:4</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 92:15">Zab 92:15</ref>; <ref loc="ROM 9:14">Rom 9:14</ref>. </char>
    </note> N'ahabw'ekyo mumpurire, imwe bantu abarikwetegyereza 'mwe,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 34:10">Nikikabure Ruhanga okukora ebitahikire,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 34:10">O'owobushoboorozi bwona okukora kubi!<verse eid="JOB 34:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 34:11" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">34:11: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 62:12">Zab 62:12</ref>; <ref loc="JER 17:10">Yer 17:10</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 33:20">Ezk 33:20</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 16:27">Mat 16:27</ref>; <ref loc="ROM 2:6">Rom 2:6</ref>; <ref loc="2CO 5:10">2 Kor 5:10</ref>; <ref loc="1PE 1:17">1 Pet 1:17</ref>; <ref loc="REV 22:12">Kush 22:12</ref>. </char>
    </note> Ahakuba aryazimuurira omuntu, nk'oku emirimo ye eri,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 34:11">Kandi amureetere okuhikwaho ebishemereire emitwarize ye.<verse eid="JOB 34:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 34:12" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">34:12: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JOB 8:3">Yob 8:3</ref>. </char>
    </note> Buzimazima Ruhanga tarikora kubi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 34:12">Ow'obushoboorozi bwona tariita manja.<verse eid="JOB 34:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 34:13" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">34:13: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JOB 38:4-7">Yob 38:4-7</ref>. </char>
    </note> N'oha owaamukwatsize ensi kugitegyeka?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 34:13">Nari shi n'oha owaamwekoreize ensi yoona?<verse eid="JOB 34:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 34:14" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">34:14: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 104:29">Zab 104:29</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 146:4">146:4</ref>. </char>
    </note> Ku yaakwaka abantu omwoyo gwe,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 34:14">Yaayegarurira omwitsyo gwe,<verse eid="JOB 34:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 34:15" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">34:15: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="GEN 2:7">Kut 2:7</ref>; <ref loc="GEN 3:19">3:19</ref>. </char>
    </note> Abaine omubiri boona bakaacwekyererera hamwe,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 34:15">Omuntu agaruka omu mucuucu.<verse eid="JOB 34:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 34:16" />Ku oraabe nooyetegyereza, hurira eki,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 34:16">Otegye okutu eki ndikugamba.<verse eid="JOB 34:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 34:17" />Noogira ngu orikwanga obwinganisa, aryategyeka?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 34:17">Okaacwera Ohikiriire kandi Ow'obushoboorozi orubanja kumusinga,<verse eid="JOB 34:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 34:18" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">34:18: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EXO 22:28">Kur 22:28</ref>. </char>
    </note> Kihikire okugira omugabe oti: Toine mugasho,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 34:18">N'abakungu oti: Muri babi!<verse eid="JOB 34:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 34:19" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">34:19: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JOB 31:15">Yob 31:15</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 10:17">Bir 10:17</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 10:34">Byak 10:34</ref>; <ref loc="EPH 6:9">Efe 6:9</ref>; <ref loc="COL 3:25">Kol 3:25</ref>; <ref loc="JAS 2:5">Yak 2:5</ref>; <ref loc="1PE 1:17">1 Pet 1:17</ref>. </char>
    </note> Otagwera orubaju rw'abanyiginya,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 34:19">N'obu kwakuba okweta aha batungi okukira abooro,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 34:19">Haza boona yaabahangire n'emikono ye?<verse eid="JOB 34:19" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 34:20" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">34:20: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JOB 21:13">Yob 21:13</ref>; <ref loc="JOB 27:20">27:20</ref>; <ref loc="LAM 4:6">Tonz 4:6</ref>; <ref loc="DAN 8:25">Dan 8:25</ref>. </char>
    </note> Bafa omu kaanya kakye,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 34:20">N'omu itumbi abantu batema, bagyenderayo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 34:20">Ab'amaani baihwaho, bataihirweho mukono gw'omuntu.<verse eid="JOB 34:20" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 34:21" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">34:21: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JOB 31:4">Yob 31:4</ref>. </char>
    </note> Manya, amaisho ge atuura agataire aha mitwarize y'omuntu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 34:21">Kandi ayetegyereza emigyendere ye yoona.<verse eid="JOB 34:21" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 34:22" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">34:22: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 139:12">Zab 139:12</ref>; <ref loc="AMO 9:2">Amo 9:2</ref>, <ref loc="AMO 9:3">3</ref>; <ref loc="HEB 4:13">Heb 4:13</ref>. </char>
    </note> Tihariho mwirima, n'obu kyakuba ekibunda kya rufu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 34:22">Ahu enkozi z'ebibi zaakubaasa kweshereka.<verse eid="JOB 34:22" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOB 34:23" />Ahabw'okuba Ruhanga tarikwetenga kugaruka kwetegyereza omuntu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 34:23">Atakaizire mu maisho ge kucwerwa orubanja.<verse eid="JOB 34:23" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOB 34:24" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">34:24: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JOB 5:9">Yob 5:9</ref>; <ref loc="JOB 8:19">8:19</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 2:9">Zab 2:9</ref>. </char>
    </note> Ahendagura ab'amaani atabuurize,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 34:24">Ata abandi omu myanya yaabo.<verse eid="JOB 34:24" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOB 34:25" />Ahabw'okumanya atyo ebi barikukora,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 34:25">Abajuumika nyekiro, bacwekyerera.<verse eid="JOB 34:25" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JOB 34:26" />Abateerera omu maisho g'abantu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 34:26">Naabatura obubi bwabo,<verse eid="JOB 34:26" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JOB 34:27" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">34:27: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="1SA 15:11">1 Sam 15:11</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 28:5">Zab 28:5</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 5:12">Isa 5:12</ref>. </char>
    </note> Ahabw'okuba bakateishuka, baareka kumukurata,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 34:27">Baayanga kuta omutima aha mihanda ye yoona.<verse eid="JOB 34:27" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JOB 34:28" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">34:28: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JOB 35:9">Yob 35:9</ref>; <ref loc="JAS 5:4">Yak 5:4</ref>; <ref loc="EXO 3:7">Kur 3:7</ref>; <ref loc="EXO 22:23">22:23</ref>. </char>
    </note> Batyo baamuhitsyaho okutaka kw'abooro,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 34:28">Yaahurira okutaka kw'abarikubonabonesibwa.<verse eid="JOB 34:28" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JOB 34:29" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">34:29: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 94:13">Zab 94:13</ref>. </char>
    </note> Ku yaakuha obusingye, n'oha owaakureeta okujagarara?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 34:29">Ku yaakushereka ah'amaisho ge, n'oha owaakumureeba,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 34:29">Yaaba ihanga, nari omuntu?<verse eid="JOB 34:29" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JOB 34:30" />Ngu omuntu otarikutiina Ruhanga arekye kutegyeka,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 34:30">Akanaga abantu omu mutego.<verse eid="JOB 34:30" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JOB 34:31" />Mbwenu hariho oragizire Ruhanga ati:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 34:31">Mpanirwe; tindigaruka kucumura;<verse eid="JOB 34:31" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="JOB 34:32" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">34:32: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JOB 35:11">Yob 35:11</ref>; <ref loc="JOB 36:22">36:22</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 86:11">Zab 86:11</ref>. </char>
    </note> Eki ntarikureeba, kiinyegyese;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 34:32">Ku ndaabe naakozire kubi, tindigarukira?<verse eid="JOB 34:32" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JOB 34:33" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">34:33: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JOB 33:32">Yob 33:32</ref>. </char>
    </note> Noogira ngu ahabw'okwanga ekifubiro kya Ruhanga,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 34:33">Aryakuzimuurira nk'oku orikwenda?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 34:33">Manya niiwe oshemereire kwihamu eki orikwenda, tiinye.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 34:33">N'ahabw'ekyo gamba eki orikumanya.<verse eid="JOB 34:33" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="JOB 34:34" />Abantu abarikwetegyereza, n'omunyabwengye weena orikumpurira,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 34:34">Nabaija kugira bati:<verse eid="JOB 34:34" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="JOB 34:35" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">34:35: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JOB 35:16">Yob 35:16</ref>. </char>
    </note> Yobu naagamba ebi atarikumanya,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 34:35">Ebigambo bye tibirimu bwengye.<verse eid="JOB 34:35" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="JOB 34:36" />Nkaahenwa ki, Yobu agyezibwa okuhika aha muheru,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 34:36">Ahakuba naagarukamu nk'oku ababi bagarukamu.<verse eid="JOB 34:36" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="JOB 34:37" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">34:37: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JOB 27:23">Yob 27:23</ref>. </char>
    </note> Ahabw'okuba naayongyera obugomi aha kibi kye,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 34:37">Atuteerera engaro naatuhena,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 34:37">Agamba ebigambo bingi eby'okuhakanisa Ruhanga.<verse eid="JOB 34:37" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 34" />
  <chapter number="35" style="c" sid="JOB 35" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 35:1" />Elihu yaagaruka yaagira ati:<verse eid="JOB 35:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 35:2" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">35:2: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JOB 32:2">Yob 32:2</ref>. </char>
    </note> Noogira ngu ekigambo eki kihikire,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 35:2">Iwe okugira oti: Okuhikiirira kwangye nikukira okwa Ruhanga,<verse eid="JOB 35:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 35:3" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">35:3: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JOB 34:9">Yob 34:9</ref>. </char>
    </note> N'okubuuza okabuuza oti: Nikingasira ki?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 35:3">Noogira ngu hati ndi gye okukira oku naakubaire ndi, kuri naasiisire?<verse eid="JOB 35:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 35:4" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">35:4: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JOB 34:8">Yob 34:8</ref>, <ref loc="JOB 34:36">36</ref>. </char>
    </note> Naaza kukugarukamu hamwe na bagyenzi baawe.<verse eid="JOB 35:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 35:5" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">35:5: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JOB 22:12">Yob 22:12</ref>. </char>
    </note> Ta amaisho ahaiguru, oreebe,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 35:5">Oyetegyereze ebicu, ebiri ahaiguru munonga okukukira.<verse eid="JOB 35:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 35:6" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">35:6: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JER 7:19">Yer 7:19</ref>; <ref loc="PRO 8:36">Enf 8:36</ref>. </char>
    </note> Ku oraabe waasiisire, oine eki omwitsize?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 35:6">N'eby'okushiisha byawe, ku biraabe bikanyire, biine oku bimugizire?<verse eid="JOB 35:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 35:7" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">35:7: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JOB 22:2">Yob 22:2</ref>, <ref loc="JOB 22:3">3</ref>; <ref loc="JOB 41:11">41:11</ref>; <ref loc="ROM 11:35">Rom 11:35</ref>. </char>
    </note> Ku ohikiriire, omuhaire ki?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 35:7">Nari shi, ahairwe ki ekirugire omu ngaro zaawe?<verse eid="JOB 35:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 35:8" />Ebibi byawe nibisaasa omuntu-buntu nkaiwe,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 35:8">Kandi okuhikiirira kwawe nikugasira omwana w'omuntu.<verse eid="JOB 35:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 35:9" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">35:9: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JOB 22:8">Yob 22:8</ref>; <ref loc="JOB 34:28">34:28</ref>; <ref loc="EXO 2:23">Kur 2:23</ref>. </char>
    </note> Abantu batakisibwa okwitwa kubi okurengyesereize,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 35:9">Bashaba kuheebwa emikono ahabw'okuhata ab'obushoboorozi.<verse eid="JOB 35:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 35:10" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">35:10: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="DEU 32:6">Bir 32:6</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 42:8">Zab 42:8</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 77:6">77:6</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 149:5">149:5</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 51:13">Isa 51:13</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 16:25">Byak 16:25</ref>. </char>
    </note> Kwonka tihariho orikugira ati: Ruhanga Omuhangi wangye arahi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 35:10">Oreetera abantu kweshongora nyekiro,<verse eid="JOB 35:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 35:11" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">35:11: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 28:26">Isa 28:26</ref>. </char>
    </note> Otwegyesa bingi tukakira enyamaishwa z'omu nsi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 35:11">Kandi otuha obwengye okukira enyonyi z'omu mwanya?<verse eid="JOB 35:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 35:12" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">35:12: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JOB 27:9">Yob 27:9</ref>. </char>
    </note> Okwo niyo batakira, kwonka atabagarukyemu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 35:12">Ahabw'amaryo g'abantu babi.<verse eid="JOB 35:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 35:13" />N'ekya buzima Ruhanga tahurira barikurizibwa busha,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 35:13">Kandi Ow'obushoboorozi bwona tabyetaho;<verse eid="JOB 35:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 35:14" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">35:14: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JOB 9:11">Yob 9:11</ref>; <ref loc="JOB 13:15">13:15</ref>; <ref loc="JOB 23:8">23:8</ref>, <ref loc="JOB 23:9">9</ref>. </char>
    </note> Kaashwa iwe orikugira ngu tomureeba,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 35:14">Orubanja rwawe ruri omu maisho ge,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 35:14">Kandi ngu omutegyereize!<verse eid="JOB 35:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 35:15" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">35:15: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 89:32">Zab 89:32</ref>. </char>
    </note> Mbwenu, nk'oku atahanisa kiniga,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 35:15">Kandi nk'oku ateeta ha banyamaryo,<verse eid="JOB 35:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 35:16" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">35:16: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JOB 34:35">Yob 34:35</ref>, <ref loc="JOB 34:37">37</ref>; <ref loc="JOB 38:2">38:2</ref>. </char>
    </note> Nikyo Yobu arikugambira busha,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 35:16">Akafukunkuka ebigambo bitarimu bwengye.<verse eid="JOB 35:16" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 35" />
  <chapter number="36" style="c" sid="JOB 36" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 36:1" />Kandi Elihu yaagumizamu naagira ati:<verse eid="JOB 36:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 36:2" />Ngumisiririza kakye, nkworekye,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 36:2">Ahakuba nkiine ebi ndikwenda kugamba ahabwa Ruhanga.<verse eid="JOB 36:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 36:3" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">36:3: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="REV 15:3-4">Kush 15:3-4</ref>. </char>
    </note> Niinyija kureeta obwengye bwangye, mbwihe hare,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 36:3">Ngambe nimpamya ku Omuhangi wangye ahikiriire;<verse eid="JOB 36:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 36:4" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">36:4: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JOB 37:16">Yob 37:16</ref>. </char>
    </note> Ahabw'okuba buzima ebigambo byangye ti bishuba;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 36:4">Oine okumanya okuhikire ari hamwe naiwe.<verse eid="JOB 36:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 36:5" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">36:5: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JOB 8:20">Yob 8:20</ref>; <ref loc="JOB 9:4">9:4</ref>; <ref loc="JOB 12:13">12:13</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 138:8">Zab 138:8</ref>. </char>
    </note> Reeba, Ruhanga n'ow'amaani, kandi tagira u agaya;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 36:5">N'ow'obushoboorozi, kandi amaani ge gari omu kwetegyereza.<verse eid="JOB 36:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 36:6" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">36:6: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JOB 34:28">Yob 34:28</ref>. </char>
    </note> Tagumyaho mubi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 36:6">Kwonka abarikubonabona abaha ebibashemereire.<verse eid="JOB 36:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 36:7" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">36:7: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 33:18">Zab 33:18</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 34:15">34:15</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 113:8">113:8</ref>. </char>
    </note> Taiha maisho ge aha bahikiriire,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 36:7">Kureka abashutamya n'abagabe aha bitebe obutarugaho, batunguuka.<verse eid="JOB 36:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 36:8" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">36:8: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 107:10">Zab 107:10</ref>. </char>
    </note> Kandi ku bakomwa omu mihama,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 36:8">Baakwatwa emirunga y'okubonabona,<verse eid="JOB 36:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 36:9" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">36:9: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JOB 15:25">Yob 15:25</ref>. </char>
    </note> Atyo abooreka ebi baakozire n'ebicumuro byabo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 36:9">Kuhamya ku baabikoreise amaryo.<verse eid="JOB 36:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 36:10" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">36:10: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JOB 33:16">Yob 33:16</ref>; <ref loc="JER 18:11">Yer 18:11</ref>. </char>
    </note> Aigura amatu gaabo, kuhurira ebirikwegyesibwa,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 36:10">Abaragiira kuruga omu kutahikiirira.<verse eid="JOB 36:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 36:11" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">36:11, 12: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 1:19">Isa 1:19</ref>, <ref loc="ISA 1:20">20</ref>. </char>
    </note> Ku bamuhurira, baamuheereza,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 36:11">Bamara ebiro byabo omu kugogyera,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 36:11">N'emyaka yaabo bagimara bagwirwe gye.<verse eid="JOB 36:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 36:12" />Kwonka ku banga kuhurira, bamarwaho na rurara,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 36:12">Bafa bataine kibamanyire.<verse eid="JOB 36:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 36:13" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">36:13: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ROM 2:5">Rom 2:5</ref>. </char>
    </note> Abatatiina Ruhanga mu mitima yaabo beebiikira ekiniga,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 36:13">Ku ababoha, tibataka ngu bahwerwe.<verse eid="JOB 36:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 36:14" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">36:14: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 55:23">Zab 55:23</ref>. </char>
    </note> Bafa bahenderwa omunyeeto,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 36:14">N'omuheru gw'amagara gaabo guba okuhemuka.<verse eid="JOB 36:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 36:15" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">36:15: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JOB 33:15-28">Yob 33:15-28</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 119:67">Zab 119:67</ref>, <ref loc="PSA 119:71">71</ref>. </char>
    </note> Ruhanga ajuna abarikubonabonesibwa naaraba omu kubonabona kwabo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 36:15">Aigura amatu gaabo ahabw'okureeba enaku.<verse eid="JOB 36:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 36:16" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">36:16: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 18:19">Zab 18:19</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 23:5">23:5</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 36:8">36:8</ref>. </char>
    </note> N'ekya buzima, akaabaire akwihire omu naku,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 36:16">Akutaire ahagarami ahatafunzire,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 36:16">Haza ebyakutairwe ahameeza yaawe biba eby'ebishaju.<verse eid="JOB 36:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 36:17" />Kwonka omutima gwawe tigubamu kindi kureka okucwera ababi emanja;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 36:17">Mbwenu orubanja rw'oburyo orukushemereire rwakukwata.<verse eid="JOB 36:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 36:18" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">36:18: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JOB 33:24">Yob 33:24</ref>. </char>
    </note> Oyerinde ekiniga kitakaakureetera okwemanya;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 36:18">
    <note caller="+" style="f">
      <char style="fr" closed="false">36:18 </char>
      <char style="ft" closed="false">Nari, Ekicunguro kihango kikakuteishura omuhanga. </char>
    </note>Okubonabona kwawe kwingi kukakuteishura omuhanda.<verse eid="JOB 36:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 36:19" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">36:19: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PRO 11:4">Enf 11:4</ref>. </char>
    </note> Noogira ngu obutungi bwawe n'obushoboorozi bw'amaani gaawe bwona</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 36:19">Nibiija kukumara, bikuzibire kureeba enaku?<verse eid="JOB 36:19" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 36:20" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">36:20: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JOB 34:20">Yob 34:20</ref>, <ref loc="JOB 34:25">25</ref>; <ref loc="JOB 40:12">40:12</ref>. </char>
    </note> Oteetenga ekyo kiro kuhika,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 36:20">Eki amahanga gaihirwaho, gakacwekyerezibwa.<verse eid="JOB 36:20" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 36:21" />Oyerinde, orekye kuta amaisho aha kutahikiirira;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 36:21">Ahakuba otooraine kutwaza otyo, okukira okubonabona.<verse eid="JOB 36:21" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 36:22" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">36:22: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JOB 34:32">Yob 34:32</ref>. </char>
    </note> Reeba, Ruhanga ahimbisibwa ahabw'obushoboorozi bwe.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 36:22">N'oha oyegyesa nkawe?<verse eid="JOB 36:22" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOB 36:23" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">36:23: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JOB 34:10">Yob 34:10</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 40:13">Isa 40:13</ref>, <ref loc="ISA 40:14">14</ref>; <ref loc="ROM 11:34">Rom 11:34</ref>; <ref loc="1CO 3:16">1 Kor 3:16</ref>. </char>
    </note> N'oha oramuhabwire oku ashemereire kutwaza?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 36:23">Nari shi n'oha owaakumugira ati: Waashobya.<verse eid="JOB 36:23" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOB 36:24" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">36:24: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 92:5">Zab 92:5</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 104:33">104:33</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 1:46">Luk 1:46</ref>; <ref loc="REV 15:3">Kush 15:3</ref>. </char>
    </note> Ijuka kusingiza omurimo gwe,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 36:24">Ogu abantu baabaire beeshongoraho.<verse eid="JOB 36:24" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOB 36:25" />Abantu boona bakaba bagureeba,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 36:25">Omuntu agwetegyerereza hare.<verse eid="JOB 36:25" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JOB 36:26" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">36:26: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JOB 37:5">Yob 37:5</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 90:2">Zab 90:2</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 102:27">102:27</ref>; <ref loc="1CO 13:12">1 Kor 13:12</ref>. </char>
    </note> Reeba, Ruhanga ni mukuru, kwonka itwe titumumanya;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 36:26">Emyaka ye terikubaasa kubarwa;<verse eid="JOB 36:26" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JOB 36:27" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">36:27: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="GEN 2:6">Kut 2:6</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 147:8">Zab 147:8</ref>. </char>
    </note> Ahakuba ainamura amatondo g'amaizi, gaba ekicu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 36:27">Akihindura enjura,<verse eid="JOB 36:27" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JOB 36:28" />Ehiika ahaiguru, ekasheesheka ahansi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 36:28">Ekateera abantu, ekagwa nyingi munonga.<verse eid="JOB 36:28" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JOB 36:29" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">36:29: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JOB 26:9">Yob 26:9</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 18:11">Zab 18:11</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 105:39">105:39</ref>. </char>
    </note> Hariho owaakubaasa kumanya oku ebicu bibuga hoona,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 36:29">N'oku okuhinda kuhindira omu ihema rya Ruhanga?<verse eid="JOB 36:29" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JOB 36:30" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">36:30: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JOB 37:3">Yob 37:3</ref>. </char>
    </note> Reeba, ashashaanura omushana, gumwehinguririza,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 36:30">Kandi ashweka emizi y'enyanja.<verse eid="JOB 36:30" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JOB 36:31" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">36:31: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JOB 37:13">Yob 37:13</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 104:27">Zab 104:27</ref>, <ref loc="PSA 104:28">28</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 136:25">136:25</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 14:17">Byak 14:17</ref>. </char>
    </note> Ahabw'okuba ebyo nibyo acwisa emanja z'amahanga,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 36:31">Kandi nibyo ahaisa abantu eby'okurya bingi munonga.<verse eid="JOB 36:31" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="JOB 36:32" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">36:32: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="HAB 3:4">Hab 3:4</ref>. </char>
    </note> Engaro ze azishweka enkuba,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 36:32">Agiragiira; ahi yaagiragiira, ehateera.<verse eid="JOB 36:32" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JOB 36:33" />Okuhinda kwayo kumanyisa ebye,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 36:33">Kandi kumanyisa enyamaishwa ku eihunga ryaza kwija.<verse eid="JOB 36:33" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 36" />
  <chapter number="37" style="c" sid="JOB 37" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 37:1" />Kandi ebi nabyo bireetera omutima gwangye</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 37:1">Kutetema n'okwesikura.<verse eid="JOB 37:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 37:2" />Yeimwe, nimuhurire okuhinda kw'eiraka rye,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 37:2">Okurikurigitira omu kanwa ke.<verse eid="JOB 37:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 37:3" />Akwohereza kubuga eiguru ryona,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 37:3">N'okutyankana kw'emirabyo ye kuhika aha muheru gw'ensi.<verse eid="JOB 37:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 37:4" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">37:4: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JOB 40:9">Yob 40:9</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 18:13">Zab 18:13</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 29:3-9">29:3-9</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 68:33">68:33</ref>. </char>
    </note> Bwanyima yaayo eiraka rye rihinda,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 37:4">Arigitsa eiraka ry'ekitiinisa kye,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 37:4">Eiraka rye ku rihurirwa, tazibira nkuba.<verse eid="JOB 37:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 37:5" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">37:5: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JOB 5:9">Yob 5:9</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 147:16">Zab 147:16</ref>, <ref loc="PSA 147:17">17</ref>. </char>
    </note> Ruhanga ahindisa eiraka rye omu buryo bw'okutangaaza,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 37:5">Akora ebikuru ebi tutarikubaasa kushoboorora;<verse eid="JOB 37:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 37:6" />Ahabw'okuba agambira ebirika ati: Gwa ahansi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 37:6">Kandi agira orutoonyerera n'enjura ati: Mugire amaani.<verse eid="JOB 37:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 37:7" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">37:7: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 109:27">Zab 109:27</ref>. </char>
    </note> Azibira abantu kukora,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 37:7">Ngu boona bamanye ebi arikukora.<verse eid="JOB 37:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 37:8" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">37:8: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JOB 38:40">Yob 38:40</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 104:22">Zab 104:22</ref>. </char>
    </note> Obwo enyamaishwa zitaaha omu bweshereko bwazo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 37:8">Ziguma omu nyanga zaazo,<verse eid="JOB 37:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 37:9" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">37:9: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JOB 1:19">Yob 1:19</ref>; <ref loc="JOB 9:9">9:9</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 21:1">Isa 21:1</ref>. </char>
    </note> Omuyaga gw'akasooroora gureetwa obukiizi-bwa-buryo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 37:9">N'embeho eruga aha bukiizi-bwa-bumosho.<verse eid="JOB 37:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 37:10" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">37:10: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JOB 38:29">Yob 38:29</ref>, <ref loc="JOB 38:30">30</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 147:17">Zab 147:17</ref>. </char>
    </note> Ahabw'omwitsyo gwa Ruhanga amaizi gakwata,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 37:10">N'ebiyanja bikwata okuhika ahi birikugarukira.<verse eid="JOB 37:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 37:11" />Ekicu kikwaitse akiijuza amaizi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 37:11">Abamba ebicu ebirimu enkuba ze.<verse eid="JOB 37:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 37:12" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">37:12: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PRO 8:31">Enf 8:31</ref>. </char>
    </note> Biguma nibyehinguririza ahabw'okwebembera kwe,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 37:12">Ngu bibone kuhikiiriza eki arikubiragiira kukora kyona</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 37:12">Omu nsi etuurwamu abantu.<verse eid="JOB 37:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 37:13" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">37:13: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JOB 36:31">Yob 36:31</ref>; <ref loc="JOB 38:23">38:23</ref>, <ref loc="JOB 38:26">26</ref>, <ref loc="JOB 38:27">27</ref>; <ref loc="EZR 10:9">Ezr 10:9</ref>; <ref loc="1KI 18:45">1 Bag 18:45</ref>; <ref loc="1SA 12:18">1 Sam 12:18</ref>, <ref loc="1SA 12:19">19</ref>; <ref loc="EXO 9:18">Kur 9:18</ref>, <ref loc="EXO 9:23">23</ref>. </char>
    </note> Eki abiikiririza kubaho, n'ahabw'okuhana,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 37:13">Nari ahabw'ensi ye, nari ahabw'embabazi ze.<verse eid="JOB 37:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 37:14" />Iwe Yobu, hurira ebi; ba orekire,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 37:14">Obanze oteekateekye aha mirimo ya Ruhanga erikutangaaza.<verse eid="JOB 37:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 37:15" />Noomanya oku Ruhanga ateeraho ebicu bye ebiragiro,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 37:15">Akaragiira omurabyo gwe kubityankaniramu?<verse eid="JOB 37:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 37:16" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">37:16: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JOB 36:4">Yob 36:4</ref>; <ref loc="1SA 2:3">1 Sam 2:3</ref>. </char>
    </note> Nari shi noomanya okuzeereera kw'ebicu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 37:16">Ku guri omurimo ogurikutangaaza ogw'Ogwo oine okumanya okuhikire,<verse eid="JOB 37:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 37:17" />Iwe, ou ebijwaro bitagata,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 37:17">Ensi ku egira obucureera ahabw'omuyaga gw'obukizi-bwa-buryo?<verse eid="JOB 37:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 37:18" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">37:18: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="GEN 1:6">Kut 1:6</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 42:5">Isa 42:5</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 44:24">44:24</ref>. </char>
    </note> Noobaasa kubamba eiguru nkawe,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 37:18">Erigumire nk'endeeberwamu eheesirwe?<verse eid="JOB 37:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 37:19" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">37:19: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EPH 4:18">Efe 4:18</ref>. </char>
    </note> Twegyese ebi turaamugambire;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 37:19">Ahabw'okuba titurikubaasa kutebeekanisa bigambo byaitu ahabw'omwirima.<verse eid="JOB 37:19" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 37:20" />Akaagambirwa ku ndikwenda kugamba nawe?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 37:20">Hariho omuntu oyenda kumirirwa kimwe?<verse eid="JOB 37:20" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 37:21" />Kandi na hati abantu tibarikubaasa kureeba omushana ogurikumurinkana omu iguru</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 37:21">Omuyaga gwaheza kuhinguraho, gwayeruuraho ebicu.<verse eid="JOB 37:21" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 37:22" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">37:22: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 104:1">Zab 104:1</ref>. </char>
    </note> Aha bukiizi-bwa-bumosho harugayo okumurinkana nk'okw'ezaabu;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 37:22">Ruhanga ajwaire ekitiinisa kirikwitsa obwoba.<verse eid="JOB 37:22" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOB 37:23" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">37:23: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 99:4">Zab 99:4</ref>; <ref loc="LAM 3:33">Tonz 3:33</ref>; <ref loc="1TI 6:16">1 Tim 6:16</ref>. </char>
    </note> Ow'obushoboorozi bwona titurikubaasa kumwetegyereza,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 37:23">Rugambwa omu bushoboorozi, taita manja,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 37:23">Kandi omu kuhikiirira kwe okuhikire taribonabonesa.<verse eid="JOB 37:23" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOB 37:24" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">37:24: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 130:4">Zab 130:4</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 10:28">Mat 10:28</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 11:25">11:25</ref>; <ref loc="1CO 1:26">1 Kor 1:26</ref>. </char>
    </note> N'ahabw'ekyo abantu bamutiina;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 37:24">Kandi tayeta ha muntu weena orikweyeta omunyabwengye.<verse eid="JOB 37:24" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 37" />
  <chapter number="38" style="c" sid="JOB 38" />
  <para style="s1">Ruhanga okugarukamu Yobu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 38:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">38:1: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JOB 13:22">Yob 13:22</ref>. </char>
    </note> Bwanyima MUKAMA yaagarukamu Yobu omu muyaga mwingi gw'akasooroora ati:<verse eid="JOB 38:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 38:2" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">38:2: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JOB 35:16">Yob 35:16</ref>; <ref loc="JOB 42:3">42:3</ref>. </char>
    </note> Ogu n'oha orikugamba ebigambo ebitarimu bwengye,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 38:2">Ebirikushereka enaama?<verse eid="JOB 38:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 38:3" />Yezirikye mashaija,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 38:3">Naaza kukubuuza, naiwe ongarukyemu.<verse eid="JOB 38:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 38:4" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">38:4: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 104:5">Zab 104:5</ref>; <ref loc="PRO 8:24-29">Enf 8:24-29</ref>; <ref loc="PRO 30:4">30:4</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 40:12-14">Isa 40:12-14</ref>. </char>
    </note> Obu naataho omusingi gw'ensi, okaba orahi?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 38:4">Ku oraabe nooyetegyereza, ngambira.<verse eid="JOB 38:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 38:5" />N'oha owaataireho orugyero rwayo, ku oraabe noomumanya?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 38:5">Nari shi, owaagigyereise omugoye n'oha?<verse eid="JOB 38:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 38:6" />Omusingi gwayo gukabyarwa ahari ki,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 38:6">Nari shi, owaataireho eibaare ry'obuhamizo n'oha,<verse eid="JOB 38:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 38:7" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">38:7: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JOB 1:6">Yob 1:6</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 19:1-4">Zab 19:1-4</ref>. </char>
    </note> Obu enyonyoozi z'akasheeshe zaayeshongorera hamwe,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 38:7">N'abaana ba Ruhanga boona bakateera akaari k'okushemererwa?<verse eid="JOB 38:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 38:8" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">38:8: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="GEN 1:9">Kut 1:9</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 33:7">Zab 33:7</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 104:8">104:8</ref>; <ref loc="JER 5:22">Yer 5:22</ref>. </char>
    </note> N'oha owaacungiire enyanja n'enyigi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 38:8">Obu yaatimbira omunda y'ensi,<verse eid="JOB 38:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 38:9" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">38:9: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JOB 22:13">Yob 22:13</ref>. </char>
    </note> Obu naakora ebicu kuba ekujwaro kyayo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 38:9">N'omwirima ndindindi gukaba engozi yaayo,<verse eid="JOB 38:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 38:10" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">38:10: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JOB 26:10">Yob 26:10</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 104:9">Zab 104:9</ref>. </char>
    </note> Nkagiteeraho obugarukiro,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 38:10">Nkataho empimbi n'enyigi,<verse eid="JOB 38:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 38:11" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">38:11: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 89:9">Zab 89:9</ref>. </char>
    </note> Kandi nkagira nti: Garukira aha, otariharenga;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 38:11">Aha niho ebingonzi byawe by'amaryo biricungirirwa?<verse eid="JOB 38:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 38:12" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">38:12: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 74:16">Zab 74:16</ref>. </char>
    </note> Waaba kubaho, oraragiire akasheeshe,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 38:12">Kandi oramanyiise omushekye omwanya gwagwo,<verse eid="JOB 38:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 38:13" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">38:13: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="NEH 5:13">Neh 5:13</ref>. </char>
    </note> Gukabona kukwata enshonda z'ensi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 38:13">Okakunkumura ababi abagirimu?<verse eid="JOB 38:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 38:14" />Ensi ehinduka, eba nk'eibumba eritairweho akamanyiso,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 38:14">N'ebintu byona bireebeka nk'ebijwaro byayo.<verse eid="JOB 38:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 38:15" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">38:15: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JOB 18:5">Yob 18:5</ref>; <ref loc="JOB 24:13-17">24:13-17</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 10:15">Zab 10:15</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 30:21">Ezk 30:21</ref>, <ref loc="EZK 30:22">22</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 6:23">Mat 6:23</ref>. </char>
    </note> Ababi baimwe omushana,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 38:15">N'emikono yaabo ebangire ehendeka.<verse eid="JOB 38:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 38:16" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">38:16: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 77:19">Zab 77:19</ref>. </char>
    </note> Orahikire okuzimu omu nshuro z'enyanja,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 38:16">Nari oragyendeire okuzimu ahagati y'enyanja?<verse eid="JOB 38:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 38:17" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">38:17: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 9:13">Zab 9:13</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 107:18">107:18</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 38:10">Isa 38:10</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 16:18">Mat 16:18</ref>. </char>
    </note> Orashuuruuriirwe amarembo ga rufu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 38:17">Nari orareebire amarembo g'ekibunda kyayo?<verse eid="JOB 38:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 38:18" />Oramanyire obuhango bw'ensi?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 38:18">Ku oraabe noomanya ebyo byona, bigambe.<verse eid="JOB 38:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 38:19" />Omuhanda ogurikuza ahu omushanga gutuura, gurahi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 38:19">Kandi omwirima gwo gutaaha hi,<verse eid="JOB 38:19" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 38:20" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">38:20: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JOB 24:13">Yob 24:13</ref>. </char>
    </note> Obone kugutwara omu nsi yaagwo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 38:20">N'okumanya emihanda erikuza omu ka yaagwo?<verse eid="JOB 38:20" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 38:21" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">38:21: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JOB 15:7">Yob 15:7</ref>. </char>
    </note> Eego noobimanya, ahabw'okuba okaba waazairwe,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 38:21">N'ebiro byawe bikaba byabaire baingi!<verse eid="JOB 38:21" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 38:22" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">38:22: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 135:7">Zab 135:7</ref>; <ref loc="REV 16:21">Kush 16:21</ref>. </char>
    </note> Hariho obu orahikire omu mabiikiro g'ebirika?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 38:22">Nari shi, orareebire ahu orubaare rubiikwa,<verse eid="JOB 38:22" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOB 38:23" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">38:23: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JOS 10:11">Yos 10:11</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 30:30">Isa 30:30</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 13:11">Ezk 13:11</ref>, <ref loc="EZK 13:13">13</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 38:22">38:22</ref>. </char>
    </note> Oru naabiikiire ebiro by'enaku,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 38:23">Kurukoresa omu biro by'orugamba n'obweme?<verse eid="JOB 38:23" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOB 38:24" />Omushana ku guba nigugyenda, gutoora muhanda ki?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 38:24">Nari shi, omuyaga gw'oburugwa-izooba guraba hi, niguza kutaataanira omu nsi?<verse eid="JOB 38:24" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOB 38:25" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">38:25: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JOB 28:26">Yob 28:26</ref>. </char>
    </note> N'oha oracwereire enjura emikura,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 38:25">Akaha omurabyo gw'enkuba omuhanda,<verse eid="JOB 38:25" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JOB 38:26" />Okugwisa enjura aha nsi etarimu bantu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 38:26">Omu ihamba eritatuurwamu,<verse eid="JOB 38:26" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JOB 38:27" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">38:27: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="GEN 1:11">Kut 1:11</ref>; <ref loc="2SA 23:4">2 Sam 23:4</ref>. </char>
    </note> Okuhaazya eitaka ry'amatongo eririmu busha,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 38:27">Ngu ribone kumera obunyaatsi bw'oruhiira?<verse eid="JOB 38:27" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JOB 38:28" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">38:28: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 147:8">Zab 147:8</ref>; <ref loc="JER 14:22">Yer 14:22</ref>. </char>
    </note> Noogira ngu enjura egira isheyo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 38:28">Nari n'oha owaazaire amatondo g'orume?<verse eid="JOB 38:28" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JOB 38:29" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">38:29: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 147:16">Zab 147:16</ref>, <ref loc="PSA 147:17">17</ref>. </char>
    </note> Amaizi gakwataine gakaruga omunda y'oha?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 38:29">Kandi n'oha owaazaire embeho y'enyababa?<verse eid="JOB 38:29" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JOB 38:30" />Amaizi gakwata gaba nk'eibaare,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 38:30">N'aha mutwe gw'amaizi hakwata.<verse eid="JOB 38:30" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JOB 38:31" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">38:31: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JOB 9:9">Yob 9:9</ref>; <ref loc="AMO 5:8">Amo 5:8</ref>. </char>
    </note> Okaabaasa kuboherana enyonyoozi za Kakaaga n'enjegyere,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 38:31">Nari shi okuyuzya emirunga ya Orioni?<verse eid="JOB 38:31" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="JOB 38:32" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">38:32: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="2KI 23:5">2 Bag 23:5</ref>. </char>
    </note> Noobasa kushohoza Mazaroosi omu bunaku bwazo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 38:32">Nari shi noobaasa kwebembera Arukutuuro n'abaana baayo?<verse eid="JOB 38:32" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JOB 38:33" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">38:33: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JER 31:35">Yer 31:35</ref>. </char>
    </note> Noomaya ebiragiro ebirikutegyeka eiguru?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 38:33">Noobaasa kuhamya obutegyeki bwaryo aha nsi?<verse eid="JOB 38:33" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="JOB 38:34" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">38:34: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JOB 22:11">Yob 22:11</ref>. </char>
    </note> Noobaasa kwimutsya eiraka ryawe, rikahika omu bicu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 38:34">Ngu amaizi gakweshukyera?<verse eid="JOB 38:34" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="JOB 38:35" />Noobaasa kwohereza enkuba, ngu zigyende,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 38:35">Zikakwetaba zitakagyenzire ziti: Turi aha?<verse eid="JOB 38:35" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="JOB 38:36" />N'oha owaataire obwengye omu bicu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 38:36">Nari owaahaire oruho okwetegyereza?<verse eid="JOB 38:36" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="JOB 38:37" />N'oha orikubaasa kubara ebicu ahabw'obwengye bwe?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 38:37">N'oha orikubaasa kushuka amaizi g'omu furebe z'ahaiguru,<verse eid="JOB 38:37" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="JOB 38:38" />Obu omucuucu guba ebyondo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 38:38">N'ebitaka bikakwatana?<verse eid="JOB 38:38" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="JOB 38:39" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">38:39: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 104:21">Zab 104:21</ref>. </char>
    </note> Okaabaasa kugira eki waahiigira entare,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 38:39">Nari okumara emigunju y'entare eifa,<verse eid="JOB 38:39" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="JOB 38:40" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">38:40: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JOB 37:7">Yob 37:7</ref>. </char>
    </note> Zibyami omu maaya gaazo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 38:40">Nari ziri omu myanya ei zigwereiremu?<verse eid="JOB 38:40" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="JOB 38:41" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">38:41: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 147:9">Zab 147:9</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 6:26">Mat 6:26</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 12:24">Luk 12:24</ref>. </char>
    </note> N'oha otungira ekikoona eby'okurya,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 38:41">Ebyana byakyo ku bitakira Ruhanga,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 38:41">Byazengyerera nibisherura eby'okurya?<verse eid="JOB 38:41" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 38" />
  <chapter number="39" style="c" sid="JOB 39" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 39:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">39:1: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 29:9">Zab 29:9</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 104:18">104:18</ref>. </char>
    </note> Noomanya ahu enzaza z'omu nshozi zizaarira?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 39:1">Nari noobaasa kureeba enuuma neezaara?<verse eid="JOB 39:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 39:2" />Okaabaasa kumanya ameezi agu zimara zihakire,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 39:2">Nari shi noomanya obunaku obu zizaariramu,<verse eid="JOB 39:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 39:3" />Zihenda enkokora, zizaara abaana baazo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 39:3">Zikira obusaasi?<verse eid="JOB 39:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 39:4" />Abaana baazo bagira amaani, bakurira omu bwerere,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 39:4">Bacuuka, tibagaruka ahari zaanyinabo.<verse eid="JOB 39:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 39:5" />Owaarekire enturegye kugyenda nk'oku zirikwenda n'oha?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 39:5">Kandi n'oha owaazitsibwire,<verse eid="JOB 39:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 39:6" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">39:6: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JOB 24:5">Yob 24:5</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 107:34">Zab 107:34</ref>; <ref loc="JER 2:24">Yer 2:24</ref>; <ref loc="JER 17:6">17:6</ref>. </char>
    </note> Ezi naahaire eihamba ngu zituuremu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 39:6">N'ensi y'engugo kuba obutaaho bwazo?<verse eid="JOB 39:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 39:7" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">39:7: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JOB 3:18">Yob 3:18</ref>. </char>
    </note> Zanga orwari rw'omu rurembo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 39:7">Kandi tizihurira kwamira kw'orikuziseetura.<verse eid="JOB 39:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 39:8" />Zitarangira omu nshozi ei ziriira,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 39:8">Nizisherura ekintu kyona ekibisi.<verse eid="JOB 39:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 39:9" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">39:9: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="NUM 23:22">Kub 23:22</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 1:3">Isa 1:3</ref>. </char>
    </note> Embogo neikiriza kukukorera,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 39:9">Nari shi okuraara omu kihongore kyawe?<verse eid="JOB 39:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 39:10" />Noobaasa kukomerana embogo n'omuguha, ekaguma omu minyarara neehinga?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 39:10">Neebaasa kwanjara eitaka ry'omu mpanga ekukuratiire?<verse eid="JOB 39:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 39:11" />Noija kugyesiga, ngu ahabw'okuba amaani gaayo ni maingi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 39:11">Nari shi, noija kugirekyera omurimo gwawe?<verse eid="JOB 39:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 39:12" />Noogyesiga ngu neija kugaruka,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 39:12">Kukureetera oburo bwawe aha mbuga?<verse eid="JOB 39:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 39:13" />Amapapa ga maaya egateera n'amaryo;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 39:13">Beitu noogira ngu ago mapapa n'amooya gaayo gagira embabazi?<verse eid="JOB 39:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 39:14" />Ahabw'okuba amahuri gaayo egatsiga aha itaka,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 39:14">Gabumbatirwa omucuucu;<verse eid="JOB 39:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 39:15" />Eyebwa ku ekigyere kyakugaata,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 39:15">Nari enyamaishwa ku yaakubaasa kugaribatiirira.<verse eid="JOB 39:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 39:16" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">39:16: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="LAM 4:3">Tonz 4:3</ref>. </char>
    </note> Eita kubi abaana nk'abatari baayo;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 39:16">N'obu eraabe ehendekyera busha, kwonka tetiina.<verse eid="JOB 39:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 39:17" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">39:17: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JOB 35:11">Yob 35:11</ref>. </char>
    </note> Ahabw'okuba Ruhanga akagiima obwengye,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 39:17">Tiyaagiha kwetegyereza.<verse eid="JOB 39:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 39:18" />Ku eba neeyenda kuhunga,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 39:18">Egaya embaraasi n'ogitembire.<verse eid="JOB 39:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 39:19" />Niiwe oha embaraasi amaani gaayo?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 39:19">Niiwe waagihaire omugaara gw'okugijangarara omu bitsya?<verse eid="JOB 39:19" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 39:20" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">39:20: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JER 8:6">Yer 8:6</ref>, <ref loc="JER 8:16">16</ref>. </char>
    </note> Niiwe ogigurukisa nk'oruzigye?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 39:20">Ekitiinisa ky'okukanga kwayo kiitsa obwoba.<verse eid="JOB 39:20" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 39:21" />Erahiza omu ruhanga, neeyemanya amaani;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 39:21">Eshohora kubugaabugana n'engabo eziine eby'okurwanisa.<verse eid="JOB 39:21" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 39:22" />Eshekyerera obwoba; tegira ki etiina,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 39:22">Tehunga rurara.<verse eid="JOB 39:22" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOB 39:23" />Omutana, eicumu eririkutyanka n'emihunda</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 39:23">Bigibomborekanira aha mugongo.<verse eid="JOB 39:23" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOB 39:24" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">39:24: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="AMO 3:6">Amo 3:6</ref>. </char>
    </note> Ahabw'obushaarizi n'ekiniga emaraho ensi n'eiruka;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 39:24">Tebaasa kuhamira hamwe yaahurira eiraka ry'enzamba.<verse eid="JOB 39:24" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOB 39:25" />Ku ehurira eiraka ry'enzamba, egira eti: Otyo!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 39:25">Ekagira orugamba hare, endigito n'orwari eby'abakuru b'engabo.<verse eid="JOB 39:25" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JOB 39:26" />Akaca kashungyezibwa obwengye bwawe,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 39:26">Obu kajanjamura amapapa gaako, kagyemire obukiizi-bwa-buryo?<verse eid="JOB 39:26" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JOB 39:27" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">39:27: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JER 49:16">Yer 49:16</ref>; <ref loc="OBA 1:4">Oba 4</ref>. </char>
    </note> Eishamba ritumbiika eiguru ahabw'ekiragiro kyawe,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 39:27">Kandi nikyo kiryarikisa ahaiguru?<verse eid="JOB 39:27" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JOB 39:28" />Omu bibaare nimwo ritaaha, rikahagira eka yaaryo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 39:28">N'omu bicokoromi by'amabaare.<verse eid="JOB 39:28" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JOB 39:29" />Ryema okwo, riranzya eki riraateere;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 39:29">amaisho gaaryo gakireebera hare.<verse eid="JOB 39:29" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JOB 39:30" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">39:30: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 24:28">Mat 24:28</ref>. </char>
    </note> Obwana bwaryo bunywa eshagama;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 39:30">Ahu omutumbi guri, niho riza.<verse eid="JOB 39:30" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 39" />
  <chapter number="40" style="c" sid="JOB 40" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 40:1" />MUKAMA yaagaruka yaagira Yobu ati:<verse eid="JOB 40:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 40:2" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">40:2: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JOB 33:13">Yob 33:13</ref>. </char>
    </note> Omuhakani naabaasa kuhakanisa Ow'obushoboorozi bwona?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 40:2">Orikuteera empaka na Ruhanga, naakigarukyemu.<verse eid="JOB 40:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 40:3" />Bwanyima Yobu yaagarukamu MUKAMA ati:<verse eid="JOB 40:3" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yobu okutandika kumanya ekibi kye</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 40:4" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">40:4: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JOB 21:5">Yob 21:5</ref>; <ref loc="EZR 9:6">Ezr 9:6</ref>. </char>
    </note> Reeba, nyowe tiinyine ku ndi.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 40:4">Mbwenu nkugarukyemu ki? Naata engaro aha munwa.<verse eid="JOB 40:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 40:5" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">40:5: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 62:11">Zab 62:11</ref>. </char>
    </note> Ngambire rimwe, tinkigarukamu;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 40:5">Eego nangwa ni kabiri, kwonka tinkyeyongyera.<verse eid="JOB 40:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 40:6" />Bwanyima MUKAMA yaagarukamu Yobu omu muyaga mwingi gw'akasooroora ati:<verse eid="JOB 40:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 40:7" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">40:7: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JOB 38:3">Yob 38:3</ref>. </char>
    </note> Yezirikye mashaija;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 40:7">Naaza kukubuuza, naiwe ongambire.<verse eid="JOB 40:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 40:8" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">40:8: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JOB 32:2">Yob 32:2</ref>. </char>
    </note> Nooyenda kumpindura otahikire,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 40:8">N'okuncwera orubanja, ngu iwe obone kurwihwaho?<verse eid="JOB 40:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 40:9" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">40:9: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JOB 37:4">Yob 37:4</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 89:13">Zab 89:13</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 63:12">Isa 63:12</ref>. </char>
    </note> Noinganisa na Ruhanga emikono?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 40:9">Noobasa kuhindisa eiraka nkawe?<verse eid="JOB 40:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 40:10" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">40:10: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 93:1">Zab 93:1</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 104:1">104:1</ref>. </char>
    </note> Yehunde obwanyakusinga n'obukuru;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 40:10">Yejwekye ekitiinisa n'okumurinkana kwakyo.<verse eid="JOB 40:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 40:11" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">40:11: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 2:11">Isa 2:11</ref>; <ref loc="DAN 4:37">Dan 4:37</ref>. </char>
    </note> Shuka omwegyemure g'ekiniga kyawe,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 40:11">Oreebe omuntu weena ow'amaryo, omucwe busha.<verse eid="JOB 40:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 40:12" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">40:12: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 59:16">Isa 59:16</ref>. </char>
    </note> Reeba ow'amaryo weena, omugarure ahansi;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 40:12">Kandi oribatiirire ababi ahu beemereire.<verse eid="JOB 40:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 40:13" />Boona obasherekye hamwe omu mucuucu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 40:13">Obakome ahamaisho bari omu mwanya ogwekiikire.<verse eid="JOB 40:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 40:14" />Obwo nibwo ndikugambira,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 40:14">Ku omukono gwawe gwa buryo gurikubaasa kukujuna.<verse eid="JOB 40:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 40:15" />Reeba <note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">40:15 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Behemoosi n'enyamaishwa mpango erikushusha enjubu </char></note>Behemoosi ei naahangire nkaiwe;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 40:15">Neerya obunyaatsi nk'ente.<verse eid="JOB 40:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 40:16" />Reeba amaani g'omu bishohoro byayo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 40:16">N'amaani g'enyama z'ebikamba by'enda yaayo.<verse eid="JOB 40:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 40:17" />Ehanika omukira gwayo nk'omwereezi;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 40:17">Emitsi y'omu kibero kyayo erabainemu.<verse eid="JOB 40:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 40:18" />Amagufa gaayo ni nk'enshekye z'emiringa;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 40:18">Amaguru gaayo ni nk'empimbi z'ebyoma.<verse eid="JOB 40:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 40:19" />Omu byahangirwe Ruhanga niyo nyamaishwa rugambwa;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 40:19">Owaagihangirre wenka niwe arikubaasa kugiirira haihi na rurara.<verse eid="JOB 40:19" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 40:20" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">40:20: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 104:26">Zab 104:26</ref>. </char>
    </note> Buzimazima ebibungo bigyeerera eby'okurya,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 40:20">Ei enyamaishwa z'omu ihamba zoona zikinira.<verse eid="JOB 40:20" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 40:21" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">40:21: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 68:30">Zab 68:30</ref>. </char>
    </note> Eyebyamira ahansi y'amarebe,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 40:21">Omu mwanya ogwekiikire omu mubimbiri n'omu rufunjo.<verse eid="JOB 40:21" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 40:22" />Ebiti ebiine ekicuucu bigisangira;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 40:22">Emikinga y'aha mugyera egyehinguririza.<verse eid="JOB 40:22" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOB 40:23" />Reeba, omugyera ku guba gwijwire, tetiina;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 40:23">N'obu Yorudani yaakwijura ekaboogaboogyera omu kanwa kaayo, teine ki eyetaho.<verse eid="JOB 40:23" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOB 40:24" />Noogira ngu hariho owaakugikwata neereeba,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 40:24">Nari akagirabya omurunga omu nyindo?<verse eid="JOB 40:24" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 40" />
  <chapter number="41" style="c" sid="JOB 41" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 41:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">41:1: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 74:14">Zab 74:14</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 104:26">104:26</ref>. </char>
    </note> Mbwenu okaabaasa kukwata <note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">41:1 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Leviasaani n'enyamaishwa erikushusha enshambya. </char></note>Leviasaani n'eirobo, ogiiha omu maizi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 41:1">Nari okukomesa orurimi rwayo omurunga?<verse eid="JOB 41:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 41:2" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">41:2: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="2KI 19:28">2 Bag 19:28</ref>. </char>
    </note> Okaabaasa kurabya omuguha omu nyindo zaayo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 41:2">Nari okufumura oruba rwayo n'eirobo?<verse eid="JOB 41:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 41:3" />Noogira ngu neija kukweshengyereza,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 41:3">Nari okugamba gye naiwe?<verse eid="JOB 41:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 41:4" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">41:4: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EXO 21:6">Kur 21:6</ref>. </char>
    </note> Neija kuragaana naiwe endagaano,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 41:4">Ngu ebe omuhuuku waawe ebiro byona?<verse eid="JOB 41:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 41:5" />Okaagizaanisa nk'orikuzaanisa enyonyi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 41:5">Nari okaagita aha nkomo kushetsya abazaana baawe?<verse eid="JOB 41:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 41:6" />Abajubi bakaacwererana obuguzi bwayo;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 41:6">Bakaagibaganisiza abashuubuzi?<verse eid="JOB 41:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 41:7" />Okaabaasa kwijuza oruhu rwayo eshando,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 41:7">Nari omutwe gwayo engobe?<verse eid="JOB 41:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 41:8" />Gibangire omukono; kwonka oijukye ku ruri orugamba,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 41:8">Kandi torikigarukira.<verse eid="JOB 41:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 41:9" />Reeba, omuntu okugigiraho amatsiko n'okweruhiza busha;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 41:9">Ahakuba owaakugicwa ati eriisho, omutima gukaamuhwa omunda.<verse eid="JOB 41:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 41:10" />Tihariho manzi eyaakwehanga kugiturukirira;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 41:10">Mbwenu shi n'oha owaakubaasa kuunyemerera omu maisho?<verse eid="JOB 41:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 41:11" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">41:11: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 24:1">Zab 24:1</ref>; <ref loc="ROM 11:35">Rom 11:35</ref>. </char>
    </note> N'oha oragizire eki yampa, ngu mmugarurire?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 41:11">Byona ebiri ahansi y'eiguru oku ringana n'ebyangye.<verse eid="JOB 41:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 41:12" />Tindikwija kureka kugamba aha ngingo zaayo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 41:12">Nari aha maani gaayo amaingi, nari aha kyemerero kyayo ekirungi.<verse eid="JOB 41:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 41:13" />N'oha owaakujuura ekijwaro kyayo eky'enyima?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 41:13">N'oha owaakwozya omu kooti zaayo ez'ekyoma?<verse eid="JOB 41:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 41:14" />N'oha owaakubaasa kugyashamura?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 41:14">Amaino gaayo oku gakiikiize goona nigaitsa obwoba.<verse eid="JOB 41:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 41:15" />Engamba zaayo ezigumire nizo eyehimbisizaho,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 41:15">Zitembekyeraine hamwe, zaaramatana.<verse eid="JOB 41:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 41:16" />Engamba emwe ekwataine n'endiijo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 41:16">Kireetera embeho kutazirabamu.<verse eid="JOB 41:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 41:17" />Zikwataine, tizirikubaasa kutaanisibwa.<verse eid="JOB 41:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 41:18" />Ku eyetsyamura, orwoya rwayo rurabya nk'omushana;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 41:18">Kandi amaisho gaayo ni nk'ebitsigye by'omushekye gurikujuguta.<verse eid="JOB 41:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 41:19" />Omu kanwa kaayo harugamu emuri ezirikwaka,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 41:19">Ensasi z'omuriro zitaraaka.<verse eid="JOB 41:19" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 41:20" />Omu nyindo zaayo hacumbuukamu omwika,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 41:20">Nk'ogw'enyungu erikutogota, nari nk'ekibingo ekirikusya.<verse eid="JOB 41:20" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 41:21" />Orwoya rwayo rwatsya amakara,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 41:21">Kandi omu kanwa kaayo harugamu endimi z'omuriro.<verse eid="JOB 41:21" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 41:22" />Omu bitsya byayo nimwo amaani gaba,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 41:22">Okutiinisa kwayo kugyenda nikugigurukaguruka omu maisho.<verse eid="JOB 41:22" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOB 41:23" />Enyama z'omubiri gwayo zihingamiraine,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 41:23">Zigihamiireho, tizirikubaasa kugirugaho.<verse eid="JOB 41:23" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOB 41:24" />Omutima gwayo gugumire nk'eibaare;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 41:24">Buzimazima gugumire nk'orubengo.<verse eid="JOB 41:24" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOB 41:25" />Ku eimuka, amamanzi gatiina,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 41:25">Ahabw'okukangarana kwayo gagwa eiraro.<verse eid="JOB 41:25" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JOB 41:26" />N'obu baakugiteera rurara, teine ki yaakugiitsa,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 41:26">N'obu ryakuba eicumu, nari endiga, nari omuhunda.<verse eid="JOB 41:26" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JOB 41:27" />Ebyoma ebireeba nk'ekumbwe,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 41:27">N'emiringa nk'ekiti kijunzire.<verse eid="JOB 41:27" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JOB 41:28" />Emyambi tegibinga;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 41:28">Ahariyo amabaare g'enjungu ni nk'ebishushunga.<verse eid="JOB 41:28" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JOB 41:29" />Emihini ahariyo neeshusha nk'embuba,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 41:29">Eshekyerera okukomangana kw'emihunda.<verse eid="JOB 41:29" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JOB 41:30" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">41:30: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 28:27">Isa 28:27</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 41:15">41:15</ref>. </char>
    </note> Aha nda yaayo ni nk'engusyo z'obwogi;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 41:30">Ku erambira aha byondo, eba nk'ekyoma kirikuhuura.<verse eid="JOB 41:30" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JOB 41:31" />Ereetera amaizi g'okuzimu kutogota nk'enyungu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 41:31">Ehindura enyanja nk'amajuta.<verse eid="JOB 41:31" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="JOB 41:32" />Ahi yaaraba, ehatsiga ekirari kirikwengyengyeta;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 41:32">Omuntu akaateekateeka, ngu ahagati y'amaizi hamezire enju.<verse eid="JOB 41:32" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JOB 41:33" />Omu nsi tiharimu erikugishusha,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 41:33">Ekihangirwe ekitagira bwoba.<verse eid="JOB 41:33" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="JOB 41:34" />Ereeba ebiri ahaiguru byona,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 41:34">Niyo mukama w'ebinyamaryo byona.<verse eid="JOB 41:34" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 41" />
  <chapter number="42" style="c" sid="JOB 42" />
  <para style="s1">Okweteisa kwa Yobu</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 42:1" />Bwanyima Yobu yaagarukamu MUKAMA ati:<verse eid="JOB 42:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 42:2" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">42:2: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="GEN 18:14">Kut 18:14</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 19:26">Mat 19:26</ref>. </char>
    </note> Nimmanya ku orikubaasa byona,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 42:2">Kandi tihariho kirikubaasa kuzibira eki omaririire kukora.<verse eid="JOB 42:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 42:3" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">42:3: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JOB 38:2">Yob 38:2</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 40:5">Zab 40:5</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 139:6">139:6</ref>. </char>
    </note> Ogwo n'oha orikushereka enaama, haza ataine ki arikumanya?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 42:3">Nikyo kingambiise ebi ntarikushoborokyerwa,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 42:3">Ebirikutangaaza munonga ebindengire,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 42:3">Ebi mbaire ntarikumanya.<verse eid="JOB 42:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 42:4" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">42:4: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JOB 40:7">Yob 40:7</ref>. </char>
    </note> Ogizire oti: Tega okutu, naaza kugamba;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 42:4">Nkubuuze, haza naiwe ongarukyemu.<verse eid="JOB 42:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 42:5" />Nkaba nkuhuriza amatu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 42:5">Kwonka hati eriisho ryangye ryakwereebera.<verse eid="JOB 42:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 42:6" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">42:6: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JOB 2:8">Yob 2:8</ref>; <ref loc="GEN 18:27">Kut 18:27</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 11:21">Mat 11:21</ref>. </char>
    </note> Nikyo ndikwetamira,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 42:6">Nkeeteisiza omu mucuucu n'omu iju.<verse eid="JOB 42:6" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ruhanga okuhabura banywani ba Yobu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 42:7" />MUKAMA ku yaaherize kugambira Yobu ebyo bigambo, yaagira Elifaazi Omutemaani ati: Nkugiriire ekiniga kingi, iwe na bangyenzi baawe bombi, ahabw'okuba timungambireho bihikire, nk'omwiru wangye Yobu oku agizire. <verse eid="JOB 42:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 42:8" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">42:8: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 1:5">Yob 1:5</ref>; <ref loc="JAS 5:16">Yak 5:16</ref>; <ref loc="1JN 5:16">1 Yoh 5:16</ref>; <ref loc="1SA 12:23">1 Sam 12:23</ref>; <ref loc="NUM 23:1">Kub 23:1</ref>; <ref loc="GEN 20:7">Kut 20:7</ref>. </char></note> N'ahabw'ekyo hati mutware enimi mushanju n'empaya z'entaama mushanju, muze ow'omwiru wangye Yobu, mwetambirireyo ekitambo ky'okwotsya; bwanyima omwiru wangye Yobu naija kubashabira; ahabw'okuba niwe ndikwija kwikiriza, nkareka kubatwaza nk'obushema bwanyu oku buri; ahakuba timungambireho bihikire nk'omwiru wangye Yobu oku agizire. <verse eid="JOB 42:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 42:9" />Elifaazi Omutemaani na Biludaadi Omushuuhi na Zofari Omunaamasi nikwo kugyenda, bakakora eki MUKAMA yaabaragiira, na MUKAMA akaikiriza okushaba kwa Yobu.<verse eid="JOB 42:9" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ruhanga okutambira Yobu n'okumushumbuusaha</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 42:10" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">42:10: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 14:7">Zab 14:7</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 61:7">Isa 61:7</ref>. </char>
    </note> Yobu ku yaaherize kushabira bagyenzi be, MUKAMA yaamutambira enaku ze; yaamushumbuusha ebirikwingana kabiri n'ebi yaafeereirwe. <verse eid="JOB 42:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 42:11" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">42:11: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 24:22">Kut 24:22</ref>; <ref loc="JOB 19:13">Yob 19:13</ref>. </char></note> Bwanyima beene ishe boona na banyaanya, n'abaabaire nibamumanya baija ah'ari, baariira hamwe nawe omu nju ye, baamugirira esaasi, baamugumya ahabw'ebihikiirizi byona ebi MUKAMA yaamureetsireho; buri muntu yaamuha ekicweka ky'efeeza n'empeta y'ezaabu. <verse eid="JOB 42:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 42:12" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">42:12: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 1:2">Yob 1:2</ref>, <ref loc="JOB 1:3">3</ref>; <ref loc="JOB 8:7">8:7</ref>; <ref loc="JOB 42:10">42:10</ref>. </char></note> MUKAMA yaaha omugisha ebiro bya Yobu ebya bwanyima okukira eby'okubanza; yaatunga entaama kakumi n'enkumi ina, engamira enkumi mukaaga, enimi z'okuhingisa enkumi ibiri, n'ebuguma z'endogoya rukumi. <verse eid="JOB 42:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 42:13" />Kandi yaazaara aboojo mushanju n'baishiki bashatu. <verse eid="JOB 42:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 42:14" />Omwishiki w'okubanza yaamweta Yemima, orikumukurata yaamweta Keeziya, n'owa kashatu yaamweta Kerenihapuki. <verse eid="JOB 42:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 42:15" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">42:15: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 27:1-8">Kub 27:1-8</ref>. </char></note> Kandi omu nsi egyo hakaba hatarimu bakazi barungi nka bahara ba Yobu. Ishe yaabaraga ebye na banyaanyabo. <verse eid="JOB 42:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 42:16" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">42:16: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 50:23">Kut 50:23</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 128:6">Zab 128:6</ref>. </char></note> Bwanyima y'ebyo yaamara emyaka igana na makumi ana, yaareeba abaijukuru n'abaijukuruza, okuhika aha ruzaaro rwa kana. <verse eid="JOB 42:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 42:17" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">42:17: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 5:26">Yob 5:26</ref>. </char></note> Bwanyima Yobu yaafa, ari omugurusi amazire emyaka mingi.<verse eid="JOB 42:17" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 42" />
</usx>